window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3601,"title":"Chapter 3601 When There Is No Other Way (4)","paragraphs":["3601 When There Is No Other Way (4)","If Li Moying was really invaded by evil qi, it would be like a bolt from the blue to the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","With Li Moying’s talent, once he is transformed into an evil cultivator under the influence of evil qi, his destructive power will definitely be countless times stronger than other evil cultivators!","This is a disaster for the entire God Realm.","As for the Cloudy Qilin Clan, not only will they lose such a peerless genius who can lead the clan to the peak, but they will also become sinners of the entire God Realm!","No matter what, Li Shihong was unwilling to accept such a result.","As soon as he got excited, the profound energy in his body overflowed uncontrollably, making even the ordinary Doctor Lin blush.","“Ahem, Patriarch Li, please be calm and calm, things are not as bad as you think! This old man is just guessing, because at first it seems that this energy is really a bit like evil qi. However, evil qi existing in this world is extremely rare, and even I only saw it once many years ago by chance, so in fact, I can’t really tell whether it’s evil qi or not.”","Seeing that Li Shihong still looked anxious and depressed, Doctor Lin thought for a while, and then said: “Actually, this energy is unlikely to be evil qi. Because of medical records, once a cultivator is invaded by evil qi, there are two situations. Exploding and dying, another situation is to become manic and violent, such as Young Master Li who is unconscious, I have never heard of it!”","“Moreover, the energy in Young Master Li’s body is very strong. If it is really evil qi, he can’t bear it at all. The conflict between profound energy and evil qi is enough to tear ten of him to pieces! So, this is impossible. The old man is not sure what is going on.”","If Huang Yueli were here, she would be able to explain Miracle Doctor Lin’s doubts.","Cultivators who were invaded by evil qi and died because their bodies were not good enough and their meridians were not strong enough, and those who became bloodthirsty murderers were because their souls were not strong enough.","Li Moying’s talent is high enough, and his soul is strong enough, so none of this will happen.","However, neither Li Shihong nor Doctor Lin knew this.","The two pondered for a while, and they both felt that this was not a symptom of evil qi entering the body, so they overruled Miracle Doctor Lin’s guess.","“Doctor Lin, you’re right! It can’t be an evil qi. I don’t know what Huang Sanbai did to Moying! Sigh, what should I do!” Li Shihong sat down on the chair and gulped down a big cup of tea.","Doctor Lin shook his head, “It’s hard to guess. One possibility is that when Young Master Li was cultivating, he was attacked by someone with a unique technique, causing him to be seriously injured. Take the opportunity to pour into him... But, if this is the case, he should have suffered from Qi Deviation, and he doesn’t look like it now.”","“There is another possibility, that is, the poisoning that you said earlier, Patriarch Li! If it is really poisoning, this poison is really difficult to solve, and the old man is also at a loss. Where did the Holy Phoenix Clan find such a vicious and strange poison? Yes, it is simply unheard of!”","After hearing this, Li Shihong was so angry that he slammed his fist on the table beside him.","The cups on the table were shaken to the ground, smashed to pieces with a bang.","“Huang Sanbai, that old fox! If I let him find him, he must be cut into pieces! No, even if he kills his whole clan, it won’t make up for the loss of our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”"]},{"number":3602,"title":"Chapter 3602 When There Is No Other Way (5)","paragraphs":["3602 When There Is No Other Way (5)","“No, it’s not enough to kill Huang Sanbai. If there is something wrong with Moying, I will kill every Holy Phoenix Clansmen I see in the future!” Li Shihong became angry when he thought of the faces of Huang Sanbai and others when the two sides negotiated. where to come.","Hearing these words, Miracle Doctor Lin trembled in his heart.","Listening to Li Shihong’s tone, if Li Moying really can’t wake up, the Cloudy Qilin Clan will formally declare war with the Holy Phoenix clan!","Although the mood of the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan is understandable, once the two sides go to war, the peace in the God Realm that has been maintained for tens of thousands of years will be completely broken!","At that time, other god races will definitely join in the melee, and the demon race will take advantage of the gap, and the entire god world will no longer have peace.","Thinking of this, Miracle Doctor Lin wanted to persuade, “Patriarch Li, don’t get excited... Although Young Master Li’s current situation doesn’t look like he will wake up anytime soon, within a month or two, he won’t wake up.” His life is in danger. The old man has a holy qi condensing pill here, let Young Master Li take it, and he will be safe and sound for at least half a year.”","The pills in the God Realm are divided into ordinary grades, earth grades, heaven grades, and holy grades from low to high. There are also legendary god grades on top of them.","However, divine elixir is hard to come by now, and contemporary pharmacists can’t refine it. Only the major gods have collections from ancient times.","The holy medicine elixir that Miracle Doctor Lin took out is already very precious.","After hearing this, Li Shihong relaxed a little.","He took the elixir and thanked Miracle Doctor Lin repeatedly: “Your Excellency, I will definitely keep it in my heart. If Miracle Doctor Lin has anything to do in the future, he can come to the Cloudy Qilin Clan for help!”","Doctor Lin hurriedly shook his head, “Patriarch Li, what are you talking about. I came here to repay the Cloudy Qilin Clan. A pill is nothing, but the old man is ashamed of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and failed to cure the Young Master’s illness... ...”","Li Shihong sighed deeply, “Your Excellency can’t be blamed for this, it’s all the bastards from the Holy Phoenix Clan...” Following the words, his fists clenched again.","Seeing that he was about to get angry again, Divine Doctor Lin quickly stepped in, “Clan Chief Li, this old man has an idea, but...it’s a little troublesome, but it’s still an opportunity!”","“What? Doctor Lin, what can you do? Come on, tell me quickly! As long as I can save Moying, I’m not afraid of any trouble!” Li Shihong couldn’t let go of any hope now, and immediately asked.","Doctor Lin thought for a while, and said: “Outsiders say that the Supreme Elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, the elixir medicine, like this old man is the person with the highest medical skills in the God Realm. However, this is not the case. We people just treat more patients. So the name is big, but many real miracle doctors are hidden in the folk.”","After hearing this, Li Shihong nodded, “That’s right, I’ve heard about it in the past. However, these miraculous folk doctors rarely show up. Although I have tried my best to search for them, I still can’t find a few.”","Doctor Lin said: “That’s because Patriarch Li didn’t find the right way. You have to know that for us healers, we don’t need fame or money, but we can’t resist the temptation to improve our medical skills.”","Li Shihong was taken aback, “Your Excellency means...”","Doctor Lin looked around and lowered his voice, “Patriarch Li, there are rumours that there is a bottle of Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew hidden in the warehouse of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Is it true?”"]},{"number":3603,"title":"Chapter 3603 There Is No Way (6)","paragraphs":["3603 There Is No Way (6)","Li Shihong was obviously taken aback, “This... how do you know?”","Divine Doctor Lin said: “I also heard it by accident. Judging from Patriarch Li’s reaction, this should be the case! That would be great! Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew is a very precious material for us Spirit Medicine Masters. When the divine grade pills are made into pills, they all need to add Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew to form them. Today’s Spirit Medicine Masters can’t refine the divine grade pills because Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew is becoming more and more scarce.”","Li Shihong pondered and said: “This... there is indeed Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew in our clan. However, to refine the divine grade pills, the strength of the Spirit Medicine Master is more important, right? If there is not enough ability, even having Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew will not help!”","The Cloudy Qilin Clan found a whole bottle of Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew in an ancient ruin more than a thousand years ago. The clan has a complete collection of books, so it is impossible not to know its function as an important ingredient to refine the divine grade pills.","However, even after many saint ranked Spirit Medicine Masters in the clan used these Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew, none of them were able to refine the divine grade pills.","After several attempts, Li Shihong finally realised that the problem was not with Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew, but with the Spirit Medicine Master!","Divine Doctor Lin said with a smile: “It’s true, but if you haven’t tried it, who would admit that your strength is not enough? No saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master can resist the temptation to become a divine ranked Spirit Medicine Master! If Patriarch Li can come up with A small bottle... no, just a few drops of Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew as a reward, and a public competition will be held, and at that time, the Divine Doctors who live in seclusion in various places will be moved by the wind and gather in Arcane City!”","Li Shihong was still frowning at first, but when he heard the analysis of Divine Doctor Lin, he suddenly had an idea!","“That’s right! Your Excellency is absolutely right! There must be a brave man under the reward, and it is half the battle won to get so many genius doctors to show up. At that time, we will use Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew as a reward, let them openly compete, and finally choose the one with the highest skills to diagnose and treat Moying. I don’t believe I can’t find a genius doctor who can cure Moying!”","Li Shihong quickly made up his mind.","Although Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew was very precious, it was nothing compared to Li Moying’s life.","He couldn’t wait to raise his voice and shouted: “Come, come! Pass my order, immediately post a notice, offer a reward to the twelve continents of the God Realm, and recruit folk genius doctors with real talents...”","...","This was the current top priority of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and no one dares to neglect it.","In the afternoon of that day, notices of the Medicine Competition were plastered all over the streets and alleys of Arcane City.","In addition, the notice of the competition was sent to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda for Spiritual Medicines, and Divine Doctor Lin was responsible for mobilising the resources of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda for Spiritual Medicines, so that all Spirit Medicine Masters on the twelve continents would know about it.","And Huang Yueli was in Arcane City, so of course she saw the notice with her own eyes and was one of the first to get hold of this news.","“Any cultivator, as long as he thinks he has enough strength in medicine and alchemy, can participate in this competition... The highest reward in the competition is... Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew! What is Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew?”","Huang Yueli didn’t know much about the medical skills in the God Realm, so she couldn’t help muttering to herself.","Fortunately, among the onlookers, there were still some people who knew some medical skills, and they quickly introduced the origin of Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew to everyone.","For a moment, everyone let out bursts of exclamation.","“This time, the Cloudy Qilin Clan really did a great job!”"]},{"number":3604,"title":"Chapter 3604 A Big Event (1)","paragraphs":["3604 A Big Event (1)","“Even such a precious material has been taken out!”","“Such a tempting reward, even my heart is tempted. It’s a pity... I don’t think my medical skills are that good!”","“I have a relative who is a Spirit Medicine Master, I’m going to tell him!”","Everyone was extremely excited, discussing in low voices, wishing they could sign up on the spot.","However, Huang Yueli noticed something that others didn’t notice, and her delicate brows were tightly knitted together, “The Cloudy Qilin Clan has already made such a bad plan, and even openly recruited folk genius doctors... With the power of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it is not difficult to seek treatment from the Supreme Elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, which shows that even the famous doctors in the God Realm can’t cure Moying...”","“However...” Huang Yueli pondered, “The Cloudy Qilin Clan is openly recruiting candidates, this may be an opportunity...”","Thinking of this, she immediately became excited, and carefully read the notice several times from beginning to end.","After reading it, Huang Yueli felt a little dejected again.","Because, although it was written in the notice that cultivators of any origin can participate, the arrangement of the official competition already excluded most cultivators including Huang Yueli.","Before meeting Li Moying, all Spirit Medicine Masters had to go through a series of screenings, comparing their skills in alchemy and pulse diagnosis.","These competitions were real, and the notice clearly states that the difficulty of the third round of competition was equivalent to the difficulty of the examination of a Saint Spirit Medicine Master.","This means that in the end, those who can diagnose Li Moying’s pulse in person are at least at the Spirit Medicine Masters at the saint level.","It’s just that some well-known doctors among the people may not have obtained a rank in the Heaven Elixir Pagoda.","For a true genius doctor, these competitions should be nothing. The requirements of the Cloudy Qilin Clan seem harsh, but they are actually very reasonable, because with such a huge reward, there must be countless Spirit Medicine Masters who will come to participate. After screening, only a handful will get in.","It was impossible for everyone to see Li Moying.","However, in this way, it became a huge problem for Huang Yueli.","Because, she herself does not have such high medical skills!","If it’s just to cure Li Moying, then no one can compare to her, because she has the skills given to her by Saint Iniquitous Shadow, and she can definitely heal him in a short time.","However, if she had to compete head-to-head with her medical skills, she was helpless.","Although she also learned some medical skills when she was in Soaring Heavens Continent, she also participated in a rookie competition to save Li Moying. After winning the competition, she did not continue to practice.","Even though she is a bit talented in healing, she hasn’t put in much effort at all, her foundation was not stable, and she can still deceive people in the lower realm, but in the god realm, compared with a real medical genius, it’s ridiculous.","Still want to win in the competition?","This was simply impossible!","Huang Yueli was a very realistic person. After thinking for a while, she immediately dismissed the idea of participating in the competition in person.","“For the current plan, the best way is to find someone to compete for me. As long as I can survive the three rounds of competition in the early stage, and I will make a move when I can diagnose Moying’s pulse, then there will be no problem.”","However, it was not so easy to find someone to replace the match.","First of all, the other party must be at least a Saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master."]},{"number":3605,"title":"Chapter 3605 A Big Event (2)","paragraphs":["3605 A Big Event (2)","If it’s too low, they won’t pass the test at all.","As for the Spirit Medicine Master who can reach the saint level, whoever is not eye-catching is likely to be unable to accept such a thing as a replacement.","“It seems that we can only rely on spending money!” Huang Yueli held her chin and thought silently, “After winning the first place, Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew can be given to the other party, and I will give another hundreds of thousands of spirit jade. Someone should be willing... However, it was difficult to guarantee the character of a Spirit Medicine Master who came here for the purpose of money. I have to hide my identity under the eyes of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and I have to sneak into Moying’s room. If that person isn’t reliable, then I’ll be in big trouble!”","It really doesn’t seem like a good idea to find someone to replace the match, but unfortunately, Huang Yueli thought about it and didn’t have a better idea.","It was only ten days before the start of the competition, and she was not arrogant enough to think that she could rise from a third-level Spirit Medicine Master to a saint level in such a short period of time.","“It’s useless to think too much here, I’ll just go to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda and have a look first!”","After Huang Yueli made up her mind, she immediately set off to Heaven Elixir Pagoda.","The style of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda was completely different from that of the Sky Gem Glass Chamber.","Sky Gem Glass Chamber was always located on the busiest streets of major cities, and it was very likely to be the most luxurious building in the city.","However, the Heaven Elixir Pagoda was generally a thatched roof house, and it was often located in the suburbs.","However, no matter how remote the location of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda was, there was still a constant flow of people going in and out and there were many visitors.","Wearing a veiled hat, Huang Yueli followed the crowd in a very low-key manner to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda.","Before she got close, she heard bursts of exclamations at the door, which were also mixed with various cheers and disputes.","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows, knowing that something happened ahead, so she used a little profound energy to squeeze through the crowd.","Looking ahead, at the gate of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, two young men dressed with the uniform of Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters were standing in front of the gate, with an alchemy furnace in front of each of them.","The two of them were surrounded by so many people, but they still glared at each other, arguing a few words from time to time.","This posture...","Huang Yueli turned her head and asked a cultivator beside her, “Brother, do you know what they are doing?”","The cultivator turned his head, and when he saw Huang Yueli’s face, he was a little surprised.","Huang Yueli’s disguised face was also extremely beautiful, enough to shock ordinary cultivators.","Seeing that she was a beauty, the cultivator immediately explained graciously, “Girl, you seldom come to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, right? These two Spirit Medicine Masters are going to publicly compete in the alchemy technique!”","“An open competition?”","“Isn’t it? It’s said that there is a saying among Spirit Medicine Masters called the Pill Competition!”","When Huang Yueli heard it, she became interested, “Pill Competition? How do they compete?”","The cultivator smiled and said: “It’s just that the two Spirit Medicine Masters put the alchemy furnace outside, and let all the onlookers testify as they refine pills. The materials used by the two are the same. In the end, whoever made pills that are of higher quality and more in quantity, will be considered a win.”","“So that’s how it is...” Huang Yueli was stunned.","The cultivator said again: “It’s rare to see such a thing, moreover, this time it’s at the gate of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda! Tsk tsk, if you lose, it’s a shameful thing! That kid in white is really stirring up some trouble!”","When Huang Yueli heard the words, she subconsciously glanced at the Spirit Medicine Master dressed in white on the right.","This time, the other party just turned around, allowing her to see his face.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in surprise."]},{"number":3606,"title":"Chapter 3606 A Big Event (3)","paragraphs":["3606 A Big Event (3)","This person turned out to be...","Liu Buyan!","Why was he here?","A beauty like Huang Yueli naturally attracts attention. The moment Liu Buyan raised his eyes, he also noticed her.","!!","However, Huang Yueli’s disguise was perfect, and Liu Buyan couldn’t see any flaws, but he also felt that the woman in front of him had an inexplicable sense of familiarity, so he took a few more glances at her.","However, the competition was about to start. After a little thought, he felt that he had never seen this woman before, so he looked away.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in shock, and it took her a long time to come back to her senses.","She wondered when Liu Buyan soared?","Although Liu Buyan had reached the peak of the Ninth Layer Realm a long time ago, and it was only a matter of time before he would ascend to the God Realm, but it took less than half a year for her to ascend to the present, and Liu Buyan had already appeared here. Huang Yueli was greatly surprised.","Realizing that she had met an acquaintance, Huang Yueli no longer had the mentality of watching the excitement.","She thought for a while, and asked the young cultivator beside her: “Brother, you came early, did you see how these two people got into an argument? Why did they start this Pill Competition at the entrance of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda?”","Liu Buyan was not as aggressive as Li Moying’s, so he usually wouldn’t get into trouble with others like this.","The young cultivator said regretfully: “Oh, it’s also this kid’s luck. How unlucky is he? Not only is he unfamiliar with the place, but he provoked someone who can’t be provoked as soon as he came!”","“A person who can’t afford to provoke?” Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows in doubt.","The young cultivator nodded and explained: “Did you see that Spirit Medicine Master dressed in purple?”","Huang Yueli glanced at Liu Buyan’s opponent. Compared with the handsome and extraordinary Liu Buyan in, he looked very wretched.","Especially when his opponent was still Liu Buyan, he was turned into scum.","“Oh, you said that wretched man... I saw him! What is his background?”","“Cough, cough, cough...” The young cultivator didn’t expect Huang Yueli to speak so directly, and almost choked on his saliva.","After finally stopping coughing, he hurriedly warned Huang Yueli, “Girl, you...be careful what you say! This Spirit Medicine Master is Lu Dongfeng, and he is the son of an extremely well-known Divine Doctor Lu of Heaven Elixir Pagoda of Cloudy Qilin Continent. This Young Master Lu has been learning the art of healing since elementary school, and his medical skills are also considered to be excellent due to his clan’s background, so he is quite famous in our Cloudy Qilin Continent.”","Huang Yueli was even more puzzled when she heard this, “If that’s the case, why did they quarrel?”","The young cultivator showed a bit of embarrassment, seeing that no one was paying attention to them, he moved a little closer, and said in a low voice: “To tell you the truth, although this Young Master Lu is good at medicine, he is a man who loves money. When selling medicinal pills, he often looks at who’s the one buying. When he sees low-status people, he’ll pass the average medicinal pills off as excellent ones, pretending that the regular pills are top-quality ones and sell them to others.”","“This... this is too much!” Huang Yueli frowned, and a stern look flashed in her eyes, “Other people buy his medicine to save their lives! We’re talking about lives at stake here! Selling fake medicine ... Isn’t this murder?”","Huang Yueli was furious for a moment, and her voice became a little louder.","Someone nearby heard the movement and couldn’t help but look back at her.","Seeing this, the young cultivator immediately became nervous."]},{"number":3607,"title":"Chapter 3607 A Big Event (4)","paragraphs":["3607 A Big Event (4)","“Hey, girl, you...you should keep your voice down!”","Huang Yueli also realized that she had lost her composure, and lowered her voice, “Alright, I’ll keep my voice down! So, when Lu Dongfeng was selling counterfeit medicine, he was exposed by that Spirit Medicine Master in white, and the two quarrelled?”","The young cultivator looked at Huang Yueli in surprise.","“Girl, you are really too smart, that’s exactly what happened! Young Master Lu did this not once or twice, we all know it in Arcane City, but there are many people from inside and outside the city, and there are still people that were fooled. But we dare not expose him, after all, he is the son of Divine Doctor Lu! Divine Doctor Lu is an elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda in Cloudy Qilin Continent. If anyone offends him, no doctor in Cloudy Qilin Continent will give him treatment in the future.”","!!","“So that’s how it is...” Huang Yueli nodded thoughtfully.","She still knows Liu Buyan’s character very well.","He doesn’t like to meddle in other people’s affairs, and he doesn’t have much leisure time to help others.","However, there is one thing that Liu Buyan can’t accept the most, that is, some people shoddy the pills and tampered with them.","For Liu Buyan, alchemy and healing is a very sacred craft, and anyone who engages in such tricks is not worthy of being a Spirit Medicine Master.","The two sides probably ended up quarrelling like this.","Sure enough, the young cultivator continued: “This young man in white must have come from another place. He doesn’t know Young Master Lu’s background at all. When he saw him selling fake medicines, he exposed him on the spot. Young Master Lu immediately defended himself and said that it’s nonsense and the medicine he sells is very good! This is enough for ordinary cultivators, but the young man in white is also a Spirit Medicine Master, and he immediately pointed out the flaws of his medicine. In a fit of anger, Young Master Lu proposed to the young man in white to a Pill Competition!”","Huang Yueli nodded after listening.","This matter...it really seems like Liu Buyan could do it!","But...","“I didn’t expect that. Aren’t Spirit Medicine Masters always upright? Why is it that in the God Realm, Spirit Medicine Masters are even hotter than us Spiritual Armament Masters, and if they disagree with each other, they will immediately go into a battle...” Huang Yueli touched her chin, and said in a low voice in a disgruntled tone.","The young cultivator couldn’t hear what she said, and asked strangely, “What did you say?”","Huang Yueli shook her head, “It’s nothing. Oh, that’s right! What are those people doing?”","She pointed to a group of people not far away.","These people gathered around a small table, talking loudly with great excitement, and looked at the two Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters from time to time, but they didn’t come to watch.","It looks a little suspicious.","The young cultivator looked in the direction of her finger, and said with a smile: “Those people... must be betting!”","“Place a bet?”","“Yes, this is also the tradition of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda. If there is a Spirit Spirit Medicine Master battling, many times someone will bet on which side will win. However, today’s gamble probably won’t work.”","Huang Yue asked strangely: “There are so many people around there, why don’t you say it can’t be opened?”","The young cultivator smiled and said, “Although there are quite a few people, everyone bet on Young Master Lu to win! There is no one betting on the other side, so how can you bet?”","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows, “Is this Young Master Lu really that powerful? No one dares to bet on that Spirit Spirit Medicine Master?”","The young cultivator said: “It’s not just because of Young Master Lu’s background. When it comes to alchemy, he is also second to none!”"]},{"number":3608,"title":"Chapter 3608 A Big Event (5)","paragraphs":["3608 A Big Event (5)","“Although Young Master Lu is not very old, he hasn’t even reached fifty yet he is already almost able to refine the medicinal pill of heaven grade, and his medical skills are quite good. Such a kind of talent is considered top-notch in the entire Cloudy Qilin Continent. Although the white robed Spirit Medicine Master is a stranger, the badge on his chest shows that he is only an earth grade Spirit Medicine Master, and he cannot be compared with Young Master Lu.”","This young cultivator had been here for an hour, hence he was very clear about the ins and outs of the incident.","After hearing this, Huang Yueli’s expression did not change, she just asked, “This competition of theirs... how do they compete?”","“I heard that the two agreed to refine the Special Jade Pill, a kind of earth grade pill, and the victory depends on the quality and quantity of the batch of earth grade pills refined. If you compare all the various earth grade pills, this Special Jade Pill is actually one of more difficult ones to refine. Young Master Lu is already close to reaching the level of heaven grade, so there is no problem, but the white robed Spirit Medicine Master has only just advanced to the earth level, so he might fail to refine such a complicated pill! Alas, he is doomed ! It’s rare to meet someone with such a sense of justice, it’s really...”","!!","As the young cultivator spoke, he let out a despondent sigh.","Like most of the onlookers, he was on Liu Buyan’s side emotionally, but rationally he believed that it was absolutely impossible for him to win.","Thinking about this young man’s offending the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Continent Heaven Elixir Pagoda, it can be said that his future is completely ruined, and they all sympathised with him.","However, when he was still here sighing, he glanced out of the corner of his eye and found that Huang Yueli didn’t even listen to him and even walked away and went straight to the group of people who were starting the bets.","“Eh? Girl, what are you doing there?”","Huang Yueli walked to the small table, and sure enough, she saw a group of people standing around dejectedly, looking very disappointed.","The dealer was sitting behind the table. When he saw someone coming, he didn’t even raise his head. He just waved his hand casually, trying to dismiss her.","“Go, go, today’s game can’t be played. I’m unlucky, no one bet on that brat in white. Don’t worry about it, let’s go and watch the fun!”","Originally, upon hearing this, the people who came to bet would all be disappointed and leave.","However, after he finished speaking this time, he found that not only did the visitor not leave, but she also put a money bag on the table.","“I bet the white robed Spirit Medicine Master wins!” A gentle female voice sounded.","The dealer was taken aback immediately, thinking he had heard wrong.","“What? What did you say?”","He suddenly raised his head and fixed his eyes on Huang Yueli, “Lady, what did you just say? I didn’t hear clearly!”","Huang Yueli curled her lips slightly, and repeated clearly and loudly: “I bet this young man in white will win!”","“What? Did I hear correctly? But...but...” The dealer was dumbfounded, extremely surprised.","Huang Yueli smiled, and said: “Why? Can’t it? Didn’t you just say that because no one bet on the white robed young man winning, the bet won’t go on? Isn’t it a good thing to have my capital now?”","“This...” The dealer didn’t know what to say for a while, “This... This is of course a good thing, no... nothing wrong with it. But Lady, you...have you really thought it through? Let me say first, the young man in white has very high odds, reaching one to five, but since you are the only one betting on him, you have to bet at least one spirit jade!”"]},{"number":3609,"title":"Chapter 3609 A Big Event (6)","paragraphs":["3609 A Big Event (6)","Hearing this, everyone was in an uproar!","One piece of spirit jade was equivalent to 10,000 pieces of top-grade crystal jade!","For ordinary cultivators, that was a huge amount of wealth that could never be earned in a lifetime. Among the cultivators present, none of them can afford it.","However, Huang Yueli was still very calm.","She didn’t speak, but directly took the money bag in her hand and shook the contents out.","With a clatter, a large handful of spirit jade fell onto the rough table.","The dealer took a closer look, and his eyeballs almost fell to the ground, “This...so much spirit jade!”","He never dreamed that such an extraordinary beauty would get so much money once she made a move, which was simply blinding people’s eyes!","Huang Yueli said calmly: “Here are a hundred pieces of low-grade spirit jade. I bet the white robed Spirit Medicine Master to win. I wonder if you can keep up with it!”","When the dealer heard this, he couldn’t help but feel a battle between heaven and man, and fell into a dilemma.","One hundred low-grade spirit jade was not a small amount of money for a dealer like him.","According to common sense, he would not dare to accept such a high bet, because once Liu Buyan wins, he will have to compensate five hundred low-grade spirit jade. Although there are many people who bet on Lu Dongfeng’s victory, the amount collected still seemed impossible to reach five hundred spirit jade, hence the extra portion can only be made up by him.","However, the situation is different now.","Obviously, the winner would definitely be Young Master Lu, and the Spirit Medicine Master in white had no chance of winning.","So, taking these one hundred pieces of low-grade spirit jade was equivalent to a guaranteed profit.","Who can push out the money that was securely in hand already?","While the dealer was still contemplating and calculating his odds in his head because there was quite a bit of commotion happening here, even the two Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters who were preparing for the competition heard what was going on here.","When Lu Dongfeng heard that someone had bet on his opponent to win, a look of dissatisfaction suddenly appeared on his fleshy face.","He looked viciously at the betting table, wanting to see which blind guy dared to oppose him, Young Master Lu! Hmph! He must be banned by the Heaven Elixir Pagoda in the future!","But who knows, when he saw it, he was stunned.","Because, the one who made the bet...was actually a pretty and beautiful woman!","Lu Dongfeng’s eyes were so straight that he almost drooled, but when he looked again, the lady threw a hundred pieces of spirit jade...","Beautiful and rich...","This was the best of the best!","Lu Dongfeng immediately yelled loudly, “Lady, Lady, don’t rush to bet! To tell you the truth, I am about to become a Heaven ranked Spirit Medicine Master, and I am sure to win today’s competition. That kid is just putting on a farce, in fact he just became a low-level Spirit Medicine Master today, so he can’t be my opponent at all. You must not be fooled by the dealer. He is afraid that the bet will not go on, so he deliberately lied to win your money!”","Hearing this, the cultivators around the dealer all changed their expressions.","They were all waiting for Huang Yueli to place a bet and earn her money. How could someone jump out and tell the truth?","That was a hundred spirit jade!","They have never seen so much money before!","Now, wasn’t all of this going to fly away before their very eyes?!","However, the person who said this was Lu Dongfeng himself, and everyone else dared not speak out.","Compared to the disappointment of the others, Lu Dongfeng looked at Huang Yueli with a proud face.","He felt that he was a hero who saved the beauty just now, and it would definitely make Huang Yueli feel good about him."]},{"number":3610,"title":"Chapter 3610 Don’t Cry (1)","paragraphs":["3610 Don’t Cry (1)","Huang Yueli didn’t look directly at this wretched Fatty Lu at all, but turned her gaze to Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan also happened to look this way, with the corners of his mouth slightly upturned, and glanced at her with a half-smile, but he didn’t say anything.","It seems that Huang Yueli had nothing to do with whether she placed a bet or lost money. In the face of Lu Dongfeng’s slander, he has no intention of justifying his name at all.","Huang Yueli suddenly felt a little interesting.","To be honest, she is not very clear about Liu Buyan’s medical skills.","Although Liu Buyan was the well-deserved No. 1 Divine Doctor in Soaring Heavens Continent, this was the God Realm after all. From her perspective where she had only dabbled a bit in medical skills, she really couldn’t tell what level Liu Buyan could reach.","However, judging from Liu Buyan’s reaction, he should be very confident in himself, right?","While thinking about it, Huang Yueli pushed the spirit jade towards the dealer, shook her head and said slowly, “Thank you, Young Master Lu, for reminding me, but, I have already placed a bet, so I’m afraid it’s not good to go back on it now?”","As soon as Huang Yueli said this, the dealer and the group of gamblers behind her were obviously relieved.","“That’s right! Those are the rules on our gambling table, once you’ve placed your bet, you can’t take it back!”","“This young man in white has an honest appearance, so he may not necessarily lose, Lady, if you win, you will make a lot of money!”","“Isn’t it? If you want to make a lot of money, you have to take some risks!”","Everyone was chattering, their eyes fixed on the pile of spirit jade, for fear that Huang Yueli would take it back.","When Lu Dongfeng saw this, he became even more angry.","“What do you people mean? Do you think that this Young Master can’t win against such a kid? How dare you fight against this Young Master! You all don’t want to mess around, right? Come, remember their faces, and you will never be allowed to fight in the future.” They have stepped into Heaven Elixir Pagoda!”","The faces of the dealer and the others froze. They were obviously frightened, and they didn’t dare to speak immediately.","Lu Dongfeng turned to Huang Yueli, his ferocious expression suddenly became very amiable, “Lady, you can rest assured that Arcane City is my territory, and other than the people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, no one dares to go against me! Just take back the spirit jade, I can guarantee that no one will dare to blame you!”","As he spoke, he glanced at the crowd with warning eyes. Seeing that no one dared to say anything, he immediately smiled even more triumphantly.","Lu Dongfeng still did not forget to cast a wink at Huang Yueli, feeling that he was out of the limelight, this beauty would definitely be overwhelmed by his domineering demeanor, and would bow down to his greatness!","Huang Yueli saw the wretched smile in Lu Dongfeng’s squinting eyes, and almost vomited out last night’s meal.","Fortunately, she had strong self-control, the corners of her mouth twitched, but she didn’t show anything.","She said calmly: “No need, I’ve already made a bet! I bet the young man in white’s victory!”","As she said that, she looked at the dealer, “What? You don’t accept these spirit jade? Don’t you plan to take this gamble?”","The dealer obviously hesitated. He looked at the pile of sparkling spirit jade in front of him, and then at Lu Dongfeng’s ashened face. Finally, he gritted his teeth, “Who says the game can’t be played! As long as someone places a bet, it will be played!”","With these one hundred pieces of spirit jade, he won’t have to come out to do business in the future.","He must get this money!"]},{"number":3611,"title":"Chapter 3611 Don’t Cry (2)","paragraphs":["3611 Don’t Cry (2)","With the dealer taking the lead, the gamblers also swarmed up and surrounded the betting table excitedly.","“I, I, I... I want to place a bet!”","“Get out of the way, obviously I came first, dealer, take my money first!”","“I’m a big client. This time I want to bet two thousand top-grade crystal jade! Let me go first!”","“Go away, what is two thousand? I want to place three thousand high-grade crystal jade!”","The gamblers had the same idea as the dealer, and they all felt that this was a great opportunity to make money.","Although Lu Dongfeng’s odds were not high, if one bet 100 crystal jades, one could only get 120 if won, but this was a sure win!","Normally, if one encounters such a competition without any suspense, even if the betting could go on, the amount of bets would be limited, because the dealer will worry about losing money.","But this time it was different, Huang Yueli directly threw in a hundred pieces of spirit jade, no matter how they bet, it was enough!","In order to make a lot of money, many people directly put their entire net worth on it.","What’s more, for fear of missing this opportunity to make a fortune, they simply started borrowing money from their friends, as much as they could!","There were also some people who didn’t want to gamble at first, but now they couldn’t help but be tempted.","Lu Dongfeng was very angry when he saw it at first, and felt that it was really embarrassing for these cultivators to ignore his command.","However, after thinking about it later, he felt that this was a good opportunity to let that little beauty lose all her money, so that she would be impressed and understand what an outstanding Spirit Medicine Master he was!","Thinking about it this way, Lu Dongfeng didn’t continue to stop everyone.","As a result, the tide of betting was extremely high, and the bet that Lu Dongfeng won was rising rapidly.","The dealer’s expression was a bit ugly. Fortunately, the winning party would have to pay him an additional 10% of the handling fee, otherwise, he would have lost all his profits.","There were simply too many people betting!","When Liu Buyan heard the movement, he couldn’t help but look at Huang Yueli a few more times.","It’s inconceivable that people who have never met before would place such a large bet on him.","Where does the other party get her confidence when no one else was optimistic about him at all?","There were quite a few people who have such doubts. The cultivators who watched have gathered together, whispered to each other, and started discussing.","“What’s going on here? Could it be that the white robed Spirit Medicine Master is really powerful, and he came here on purpose today? And that Lady knows what he’s capable of, so she came here to bet to make money?”","“How is this possible? You don’t know the level of Young Master Lu? There are very few Spirit Medicine Master geniuses like him in the entire God Realm! Anyone who can win against him is not famous, how can he be such a person? What’s more, he’s a new face?”","“Then how do you explain this? It can’t be that Lady fell in love with the white robed Spirit Medicine Master, right?”","“Hey, that’s really hard to say! Although that kid is bold, he is really good-looking. It’s not surprising that rich girls will fall in love with him, right?”","“Tch! What’s so great about being so handsome, hmph!”","All kinds of unreliable guesses and slanders, without missing a single word, were heard by Huang Yueli, who had a strong primordial spirit.","The corners of her mouth curled up into a smirk.","Dare to gossip about her, wait a minute, these people will lose even their pants!","When the time comes, don’t cry!"]},{"number":3612,"title":"Chapter 3612 Don’t Cry (3)","paragraphs":["3612 Don’t Cry (3)","Amidst all the noise, many people had already forgotten the two protagonists who were still preparing for the competition.","Fortunately, the referee sent by the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, still remembered this. He went to the crowd and loudly announced the start of the competition.","Only then did the crowd calm down, and surrounded Lu Dongfeng and Liu Buyan again, preparing to watch them refine.","Although in their view, this was one competition without any suspense, but there were not many opportunities to see Spirit Medicine Master refining on the spot, and many people were interested in gaining such a first hand experience.","After Huang Yueli arrived in the God Realm, it was the first time she saw someone refining pills, she was very interested, and immediately squeezed to the front.","The two Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters shot at the same time, and a ball of flame flew out from their fingertips and entered the fire inlet at the bottom of the alchemy furnace.","It was just such a simple action, and the crowd booed immediately.","“What... what’s going on here? The flame released by the Spirit Medicine Master in white is a little too ordinary!”","“Look at Young Master Lu’s primordial spirit and flame, and then look at his... Sigh, the difference in strength is too obvious! I thought that the white robed Spirit Medicine Master was some kind of master disciple of a hidden Divine Doctor, but now it seems that it was really me, thinking too much!”","“It’s a pity for that little beauty, a hundred pieces of spirit jade... Tsk tsk, no matter how rich you are, you can’t afford to spend so much! I’m afraid I’m going to regret it?”","Intentionally or not, everyone cast their eyes on Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli stood in the crowd, but her expression was calm all the time, as if she had never heard of it.","A hundred pieces of spirit jade, for these human cultivators, was really a huge amount of wealth that was difficult to earn in a hundred lifetimes, but for her, it is really worthless, and she may not be interested in picking it up even if it was thrown on the ground .","For her, what was really important...was Liu Buyan’s refining technique!","Others don’t know what’s going on, but Huang Yueli knew Liu Buyan’s details, and understands that he actually has a better deviant flame, but he didn’t use it. Instead, he used a fairly common kind of flame.","In this case, he would definitely not lose on purpose.","Therefore, in the end, she felt that he had won for sure, so he wanted to slap this Young Master Lu in the face!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli felt even more relieved, and simply put aside all the rumors that were flying around and concentrated on observing Liu Buyan’s refining.","On the surface, there was not much difference between the spirit medicine technique in the God Realm and the alchemy technique in Soaring Heavens Continent.","They all heat up the alchemy furnace first, then add various medicinal materials, and after mixing the medicinal power, they finally condense the pill.","However, Huang Yueli has experience in refining Spirit Armaments, so she knows that this was just a superficial phenomenon. In fact, the principle of the pills from the God Realm was mostly related to the the force field brought about by channelling the profound energy.","One of the most obvious evidence is that the outer layers of all the pills from the God Realm have pill patterns.","No matter what the quality was, there would be pill patterns, the difference is only the colour, depth and complexity.","And the pill pattern, if understood from another angle, was a special array pattern.","Using these lines to build a force field, guide the medicinal materials and profound energy to work in the cultivator’s body. This was the true source of the power of the pill to revive human flesh and bones.","The type of flame that Liu Buyan used was very common. As a result, the strength was far less powerful than that of Lu Dongfeng.","Lu Dongfeng has already heated up the alchemy furnace and added several medicinal materials, but Liu Buyan was still heating the furnace over here."]},{"number":3613,"title":"Chapter 3613 Don’t Cry (4)","paragraphs":["3613 Don’t Cry (4)","Although the cultivators who were spectating were not Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters, such an obvious gap could still be seen.","For a while, everyone shook their heads and sighed.","It was not unusual for this white robed Spirit Medicine Master to lose to Lu Dongfeng, but it was really surprising that he lost so ugly.","They thought that a Spirit Medicine Master who had the guts to challenge Lu Dongfeng would at least have some ability!","Yet, the results of it? Even a furnace had to be heated for a long time!","It wasn’t until Lu Dongfeng added all the medicinal materials into the furnace and started to try to build the force field of the medicinal pill that Liu Buyan’s furnace heated up to the acceptable temperature.","He slowly lifted the furnace cover, and stretched out his hand to the bamboo basket with medicinal materials on the side.","Everyone couldn’t bear to watch it anymore!","“It’s a good thing he can still calm down and continue refining. If it were up to me, seeing the gap is so big, I would be ashamed to make a fool of myself, and I can only admit defeat!”","“The most important thing for a Spirit Medicine Master is to calm down and have a good concentration. In this aspect, this kid is pretty good.”","“Wait, who said he can hold his breath? Look, he... what is he doing??”","The last speaker yelled in shock, and pointed to Liu Buyan’s pill furnace.","The others looked in the direction of his finger, and were immediately taken aback.","Because, they all saw Liu Buyan stretch out his hand to the top of the bamboo basket, but he didn’t take out any medicinal materials. Instead, he directly lifted the entire bamboo basket, and with a flick of his wrist, he threw all the medicinal materials into the alchemy furnace!","The eyeballs of the onlookers almost fell to the ground!","Although they were not Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters, they still had basic knowledge! Even if one were to think about it with their toes, one would also know that when refining, one can’t do such nonsense, right?","“This... this... this...”","The cultivators were all tongue-tied, not knowing what to say?","This kid...wouldn’t it be that he was so anxious that he was about to lose? He even completely forgot how to refine!","And after Lu Dongfeng noticed what was happening around him, he raised his eyebrows proudly, and almost couldn’t laugh out loud on the spot!","If he had known how stupid this guy was, he wouldn’t have had to work so hard to refine such a difficult pill just now.","Lu Dongfeng subconsciously glanced at Huang Yueli again.","As a result, seeing this made him tremble with anger, and almost knocked over the alchemy furnace!","Because, Huang Yueli’s gaze stayed on Liu Buyan all the time, from the beginning to now, she didn’t shift her gaze in the slightest, and she didn’t even give him the slightest glance.","Lu Dongfeng’s face flushed with anger, and he really wanted to rush to Huang Yueli and ask, what’s so good about that pretty face? The level of refining skills was so poor, it was simply a waste of materials!","He became impatient and wished he could refine a batch of pills right now, and trample Liu Buyan under his feet, so that Huang Yueli could look at him with admiration.","With this kind of mentality, Lu Dongfeng’s hand movements became eager, and even when he was doing his hand gestures, he couldn’t concentrate and think seriously. .","After several twists and turns, his pill was finally about to take shape.","“It’s only the last step! As long as the condensing is successful, I can...”","Lu Dongfeng stared at his alchemy furnace with all his attention, pouring all his profound energy into it.","But at this moment...","“What? How is it possible? Look, that white robed Spirit Medicine Master has already...has already refined a pill!”"]},{"number":3614,"title":"Chapter 3614 Really Cried (1)","paragraphs":["3614 Really Cried (1)","The screams of the onlookers suddenly reached their ears.","Lu Dongfeng’s hand shook immediately, and the profound energy condensed in his palm scattered at once. The medicinal pill that had been almost formed also showed signs of collapsing.","Lu Dongfeng noticed this, and he shuddered all over, and hastily typed out several hand gestures one after another, trying to remedy it.","In the end, his basic skills were solid, and he barely managed to keep the half-finished medicinal pill without letting it get completely destroyed.","Only then did Lu Dongfeng heave a sigh of relief.","As long as the medicinal pill doesn’t shatter immediately, it can still be saved. It doesn’t count as a refining failure, as long as it waits a while and re-condenses the medicinal pill, it will be a slight loss in quality at most.","However, it is more than enough to fight against a little kid.","Thinking of this, Lu Dongfeng couldn’t help but glared in the direction of the screaming just now, wanting to see who the eyeless person was making such a fuss about, almost disturbing his alchemy!","He wants to write down this guy’s appearance, and find an opportunity to take revenge on him in the future!","But who knows, when Lu Dongfeng glanced at the crowd, he found that no one was looking at him, and everyone’s eyes were on Liu Buyan who was beside him. Moreover, the expressions on everyone’s faces were like It was like swallowing a fly alive, indescribably shocked and amazed!","Seeing such a scene, Lu Dongfeng was startled, and an ominous premonition arose in his heart.","He subconsciously turned his head and looked to the right.","Liu Buyan, who was wearing a white Spirit Spirit Medicine Master’s robe, was making hand gestures towards the alchemy furnace. His movements were as smooth as flowing clouds, but neither slow nor fast. It seemed that his speed was not fast.","However, under the control of his profound energy, the lid of the alchemy furnace was slowly raised in mid-air.","Lu Dongfeng opened his mouth wide, his eyes stared straight.","In the process of refining the elixir, in order to ensure that the elixir is properly heated and heated evenly, the furnace lid must not be opened casually.","Generally speaking, the only situation where the lid will be opened is... the refining is over!","Either the medicinal pill has been formed, or it has failed!","And this little kid... Could it be that his medicinal pill had already been refined?","No, it’s impossible!","It took him so long just to heat up the alchemy furnace just now, even if he could refine it successfully in the end, the speed could not be so fast, so he must have already smelted all the medicinal materials into slag, this is to admit defeat !","Lu Dongfeng kept chanting silently in his heart to convince himself, but the uneasy feeling in his heart could not be reduced at all.","In just an instant, the lid of Liu Buyan’s alchemy furnace had already been lifted to one side.","Liu Buyan clapped his hands and said, “My Special Jade Pill has been refined, please take a look at it.”","Lu Dongfeng thought he was under too much pressure and had hallucinations!","The refining was complete? This kid has refined the Special Jade Pill?","What a joke!","However, the Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters sent by the Heaven Elixir Pagoda to be judges had already walked over and surrounded Liu Buyan’s pill furnace.","The leader of the group looked into the furnace and coughed lightly, “This...”","He showed hesitation, and instead of taking out the medicinal pill immediately, he turned his head and glanced at Lu Dongfeng.","The eyes of the two happened to meet.","There was a sudden bang in Lu Dongfeng’s head, like a thunderbolt exploding in his head!","This referee is also from the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, so he was naturally on his side."]},{"number":3615,"title":"Chapter 3615 Really Cried (2)","paragraphs":["3615 Really Cried (2)","If Liu Buyan hadn’t refined the Special Jade Pill, the referee would have shouted out a long time ago, announcing Liu Buyan’s failure, but now, he was hesitant...","Obviously, Liu Buyan not only refined the medicinal pill, but the quality was quite good as well!","Liu Buyan saw that the referees were just watching and didn’t speak, so he couldn’t help raising his eyebrows, and a trace of coldness flashed in his eyes, “Seniors, shouldn’t you take out my medicinal pill and let all the cultivators who came to watch the Pill Competition take a look and make a judgment as well?”","“That’s right! Take it out and let us have a look!”","!!","“Did that kid in white really refine the Special Jade Pill?”","“How could he be faster than Young Master Lu? I don’t believe it! Unless seeing is believing!”","The onlookers urged the referee one after another. They had long wanted to see the medicinal pill that Liu Buyan had refined. Although they were not professional Spirit Medicine Masters, they could identify the real high-quality medicinal pill just by looking at it. Experienced cultivators will have their own judgments.","However, the referees remained silent.","The three lower-level Spirit Medicine Masters all looked at the leader in unison.","Seeing that he couldn’t evade, the leading heaven-level Spirit Medicine Master coughed and said dryly: “This...don’t be so impatient! The quality and quantity of alchemy is what is compared in such competitions, not the speed of alchemy, so, it would be fairer to wait for Young Master Lu to finish the refinement, and then bring it out for everyone to judge.”","As soon as the words fell, Liu Buyan let out a mocking sneer.","“Fair?Hmph, this is really fair!”","A layman may not understand it, but it is impossible for a professional Spirit Medicine Master not to know that after the pill is formed, it cannot be kept in the pill furnace forever.","Because the remaining temperature in the pill furnace will also have a certain impact on the formed pills, and the pressure and humidity in the furnace are not suitable for storing pills.","In order to maintain the best quality of the medicinal pill, it is usually taken out immediately after refining, and stored in a special jade box, so as to minimize the loss of medicinal effect.","And if it was kept in the pill furnace in such a manner, the quality of the pill would drop in a short time.","By saying this and doing so, the referee was obviously helping Lu Dongfeng.","They wanted to use this method to delay time.","On the one hand, Liu Buyan’s advantage of completing the refinement earlier was wiped out, and on the other hand, the quality of his medicinal pill was also reduced. This way, the possibility of Lu Dongfeng winning is much greater!","Knowing this, Liu Buyan coldly glanced at the referees.","Seeing his cold and stern eyes, the referees felt chills all over. They were a little confused why a fledgling young Spirit Medicine Master would have such sharp eyes, making him feel like a martial arts master with extraordinary strength!","Before he had time to say anything more, the onlookers felt dissatisfied first.","Although they were not Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters, and they didn’t know that the quality of the pill would drop because of this, they were not fools!","Although it is true that when they had such alchemy competitions, the number and quality of the refined pill was compared, the speed of refining was also very important, and it was not as insignificant as the referee said.","The speed of refining was the embodiment of power!","Ordinary cultivators have such a simple cognition.","All of a sudden, everyone protested.","“What’s the situation? We just want to see the medicinal pill!”","“That is, many of us have placed bets just now, and have the right to know the result of the competition!”"]},{"number":3616,"title":"Chapter 3616 Really Cried (3)","paragraphs":["3616 Really Cried (3)","The referees had no choice, but it was impossible to give in, so they could only keep a cold face, without even defending themselves, and said directly: “Shut up! Who is the referee? If you dare to make trouble here in Heaven Elixir Pagoda, you will be banned from here in the future.”","It has to be said that the deterrent effect of these words were strong enough.","Immediately, the whole place became quiet again.","Liu Buyan just watched silently from the sidelines. At the end, he sneered, “Don’t think I don’t understand your thoughts. Well, I’ll just wait and see what your renowned Lu can refine!”","!!","Lu Dongfeng was already shocked by this scene, and forgot that he was still in the midst of refining.","After the leading referee gave him countless glances, he suddenly remembered where he was, and hurriedly looked at the pill furnace in front of him again.","Due to his negligence just now, the flames of the pill furnace were erratic and even almost snuffed out.","The medicinal materials that had been melted in the alchemy furnace were almost burnt.","Lu Dongfeng frantically tried to remedy the situation, displaying all his unique skills of pressing the bottom of the furnace.","The referees have helped him so much, he must now refine this batch of pills, and he must do so as soon as possible! If he fails, his face will never be regained!","However, people are like this. The more anxious one wants to get things done, the more things will backfire.","The strength of the flame started to fluctuate, which had always been a big taboo in alchemy. Lu Dongfeng was in a hurry, and he started to make several mistakes. Several factors superimposed, and a tragedy happened.","“Boom–!”","A loud noise came from where Lu Dongfeng was standing.","The alchemy furnace in front of him exploded!","The thick black smoke, mixed with the scalding liquid in the alchemy furnace and the flames, shot out in all directions!","When Liu Buyan heard the sound, relying on the reaction he had cultivated for many years, he rushed out to the side immediately, and at the same time, he did not forget to take away his already cooled alchemy furnace.","But the four medicinal pill referees did not react as quickly as he did. By the time they realized that the danger was approaching, the black smoke had already rushed into their faces.","“Not good! Quick! Get out of the way!”","“Damn it!”","Amidst the exclamation, the four referees were sprayed with black smoke all over their heads and faces, and they turned black in an instant.","Lu Dongfeng was the closest to the alchemy furnace, even if he had Liu Buyan’s reaction, he couldn’t escape. Therefore, he was also the most seriously injured.","The thick black smoke enveloped his whole body and his clothes were immediately ignited, but in an instant, it turned into a ball of flames.","“Not good!”","Before the four referees had time to wipe off the dust on their faces, they heard Lu Dongfeng’s screams and hurried over to rescue him.","Fortunately, there is a beautiful man-made pond next to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, the medicinal pill. The four of them splashed water, undressed and slapped them, and put out the fire quickly in a hurry.","However, Lu Dongfeng had already been burned, and his body was curled up into a ball, rolling and howling on the ground.","“I... my eyes! My eyes can’t see! Ahhhhh!”","That heart-piercing scream was really worse than killing a pig.","The cultivators present were all shocked by such a sudden change, and they all froze in place, unable to recover for a long time.","Originally, everyone thought that Lu Dongfeng would win this match."]},{"number":3617,"title":"Chapter 3617 Really Cried (4)","paragraphs":["3617 Really Cried (4)","But who would have thought that at the end of the competition, there would be such a turning point!","Not to mention Liu Buyan made the medicinal pill first, and the referee helped Lu Dongfeng cheat, but in the end, Lu Dongfeng actually blew up the medicinal pill furnace by himself! He even burned himself to such a sorry state!","Although for cultivators, burns of this degree could still be cured, but one can imagine how painful it is to be burned so miserably by the flames.","For a moment, everyone looked at each other, not knowing whether to sympathize with him or despise him.","The four referees wanted to help Lu Dongfeng up, but Lu Dongfeng was so pampered that he couldn’t bear the pain when the four of them touched him, he refused to get up.","In desperation, the Spirit Medicine Masters had no choice but to ask the guards to find a stretcher and carry Lu Dongfeng inside.","The stretcher was delivered quickly.","However, just when they were about to leave, a white figure stepped out from the side, blocking their way.","“Wait, a few referees, and this... Young Master Lu! The result of our competition hasn’t been announced yet, so I’m afraid it’s not good for you to leave like this?”","After hearing this, the referees remembered what the occasion was now.","They have completely forgotten about the Pill Competition!","The leader immediately lowered his face, and said angrily, “Young Master, what do you mean? I didn’t see that Young Master Lu had already suffered such a serious injury. Why are you still concerned about the result of the Pill Competition? My God How can there be such a heartless person like you down there? Hurry up and get out of the way, haven’t you seen Young Master Lu so painful that he can’t stand it?”","He spoke harshly, thinking that what he said was very reasonable. Anyone who heard this would definitely retreat with guilt.","However, Liu Buyan was not such an easy person to fool.","He didn’t move at all, and glanced at Lu Dongfeng lightly, “Such a serious injury? With all due respect, this kind of flesh burn can only be regarded as a minor injury to a cultivator, and his actions will not be affected at all. I have to say that this is the first time I’ve seen someone who can’t withstand such an injury that they even have to lie on a stretcher.”","“You... What do you mean?” The leader’s face turned even darker.","Liu Buyan didn’t take his anger seriously at all, “I’m not talking nonsense, just ask the cultivators present, who else is like this?”","In fact, Lu Dongfeng and the four referees were not the only ones who were hit by the flames of the explosion just now. Some onlookers who stood too close were also hit.","However, as cultivators, they still have some perseverance. Although they were burned, most of them didn’t fall at all, they just took medicine in a hurry.","The four referees also knew that Liu Buyan was right, but Lu Dongfeng was not pretending. How did he cultivate?","The leading referee could only hold back, “Stop talking nonsense, I will warn you one last time, get out of the way!”","Liu Buyan remained motionless, a sneer twitched at the corner of his mouth, and he said slowly, “Why are you leaving in such a hurry? If you have time to say so many threats to me, why don’t you just declare that I have won? Senior, however, would rather talk nonsense than announce the result, could it be... is he trying to take advantage of this opportunity to muddle through this and get away with it?”"]},{"number":3618,"title":"Chapter 3618 Really Cried (5)","paragraphs":["3618 Really Cried (5)","Hearing this, the expressions on the faces of several referees were stunned.","In fact, they did have this plan and planned to take advantage of the chaos to deny the announcement of the result.","Even if Liu Buyan pursued it in the future, they could still explain that Lu Dongfeng was injured at the time, he made a mistake because he had been so busy and forgot about it for a while, so they would just mention the matter in passing.","But who knew that Liu Buyan would expose them directly in front of so many onlookers.","Now, the gazes of the onlookers are all focused on them, their eyes full of doubts. Under such circumstances, it was not easy for them to open their eyes and talk nonsense, so they could only say vaguely: “This...how could it be? You think too much! It’s just that Young Master Lu’s injury...”","“Oh, Young Master Lu’s injury...”","Liu Buyan looked at Lu Dongfeng’s dark face, nodded with a comprehending expression, “This is indeed a problem. Although Young Master Lu’s injury is not serious, if he does not treat it in time, he will suffer a lot.”","When the referees heard it, they heaved a sigh of relief.","Several people suddenly showed joy and nodded repeatedly, “It’s good that you understand, it’s good that you understand...”","Liu Buyan nodded, and continued: “However, this small injury can be healed if you treat it casually. Why bother to carry him to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda?”","“What? You... what did you say?”","The referees didn’t expect that Liu Buyan turned another corner while talking, thinking that they had heard it wrong.","“Treat... casually? This... this... are you kidding? This injury is not serious, but burns are the most difficult to treat among all traumatic injuries. We need to apply ointment all over his body and wrap him and he has to lie down for at least three to five days before he can be cured without leaving any scars...”","The leading referee frowned, looked at Liu Buyan with dissatisfaction, and at the same time introduced the treatment method to the curious onlookers.","What he said was not a lie, it was just... a little exaggerated.","However, most of the cultivators present were not experts, and they couldn’t tell anything wrong even after thinking about it.","After finishing speaking, the referee glared at Liu Buyan again, “Alright, get out of the way!”","Liu Buyan still didn’t move, he snorted softly, and said: “It seems that the Spirit Medicine Master in the Heaven Elixir Pagoda of Arcane City, is really not very good. It’s just such a simple burn, and they still have to keep the patient in bed. Three to five days, tsk tsk... If they are all treated like you, I am really worried that the cultivators in Arcane City will be killed by you if they are injured in the future.”","“What did you say??” The referees were so angry that they almost jumped up!","“Who are you? You’re just an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master. What qualifications do you have to say that our medical skills are not good?”","“That’s right, with your ability, you still have to be a good man, and you actually slander seniors like this!”","Facing the accusations of the four people, Liu Buyan was not flustered at all, but even laughed, “We Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters are not Seniors because of their age, but depends on the level of medical skills! You can’t even treat such a small injury properly, aren’t you ashamed to call yourself a senior?”","“We can’t cure it, so can you cure it?” The leader said angrily.","Liu Buyan said calmly, “It’s just a matter of raising my hands!”","“You...” The referee didn’t believe it at all, and snorted coldly, “You have a serious tone, and if you have the ability, you come here and cure Young Master Lu!”"]},{"number":3619,"title":"Chapter 3619 Really Cried (6)","paragraphs":["3619 Really Cried (6)","Liu Buyan shrugged his shoulders and said, “This is what you asked for. Don’t try to deny it with various reasons later.”","Deny?","Deny... what?","Why did this sound a bit wrong?","!!","When the four judges heard this, they suddenly had an ominous premonition, and subconsciously wanted to go back on their word. However, what they said just now was on this point, and now they couldn’t find a reason to go back on their words.","While they were hesitating, Liu Buyan had already walked in front of Lu Dongfeng.","He took out a porcelain white medicine bottle from his sleeve, poured out a pill from it, and stuffed it into Lu Dongfeng’s mouth.","“Hey, wait! What did you feed Young Master Lu?”","Liu Buyan’s movements were so fast that the four of them didn’t see the appearance of the medicinal pill clearly, so they couldn’t help becoming anxious, and hurried forward to ask.","Liu Buyan said: “Why are you so anxious? Can I still give him poison in full view? This is of course a medicine that can treat burns!”","The judges always feel that things are not that simple, and want to keep asking.","But at this moment, exclamations came from the crowd of onlookers.","“Hurry up, everyone, take a look! The wound on Young Master Lu’s body seems to be...healing!”","“The burnt area has also begun to grow new flesh!”","“It’s unbelievable! This... what kind of medicinal pill is this?”","“It’s too powerful, it’s really too powerful! With such a good burn medicine, how much trouble can we save when we are cultivating? This Divine Doctor, do you sell your medicinal pill?”","Hearing the discussion of the cultivators, the four judges immediately turned their heads and looked at Lu Dongfeng who was lying on the stretcher.","After only one glance, they were stunned.","It really happened as the onlookers said.","Lu Dongfeng’s scorched wound began to turn pink and tender red. Anyone with a little knowledge of medicine could tell that it was new flesh growing under the scorched skin.","Lu Dongfeng was originally stretched out on the stretcher, but now his face was full of pain. While moaning, he rubbed back and forth on the stretcher, because growing new flesh was very itchy, so it’s no wonder he feels so uncomfortable!","The four judges looked at each other, and rushed to Lu Dongfeng at the same time, and began to check.","Seeing this, Liu Buyan took a step back and gave up the position closest to Lu Dongfeng.","Anyway, the medicinal pill he took out could really cure burns, and he is not afraid of their inspection at all.","The four judges squatted in front of Lu Dongfeng, checked him from left to right, up and down, and finally came to the conclusion that Lu Dongfeng’s injury had really improved visibly to the naked eye, and, in such a short period of time, he had already healed quite a bit!","“This...how is this possible?”","The four of them looked at each other, but they had to admit this fact.","Liu Buyan put his arms around his chest, looked at them condescendingly, and said slowly, “How is it? Have you checked Young Master Lu’s injuries? Since he is fine, can we announce the result of the fight?”","All four of them were ashamed.","They didn’t expect that Liu Buyan could really cure Lu Dongfeng, and with such a neat method!","How is this possible?","Unless, the medicinal pill he took out just now is the legendary saint medicinal pill!","But, how could there be such a thing as an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master like him?","Liu Buyan urged again impatiently.","The leading judge said: “This Young Master...”"]},{"number":3620,"title":"Chapter 3620 Really Cried (7)","paragraphs":["3620 Really Cried (7)","He only said a few words before being interrupted by Liu Buyan.","“Wait, what did you call me?”","The leading judge was startled, “Ah? I said Young Master...”","“Wrong, did you address me wrongly?” Liu Buyan said calmly.","“Address you wrongly? What do you mean?” The four judges all had blank expressions on their faces, and even the cultivators who were watching couldn’t react.","If they don’t call him Young Master, what should they call him?","Calling a young cultivator a Young Master was already a very polite address, so there really shouldn’t be any faults?","On the other hand, Huang Yueli understood as soon as she heard this, and couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","Everyone was in a daze. The scene was very quiet, but her smile was very radiant. Many people looked at her.","Huang Yueli said openly and generously: “Several Spirit Medicine Masters, didn’t the young man in white say that just now? Those with high medical skills are Seniors, and you all agreed. If so, the young man in white has already cured burns that you couldn’t cure which shows that he has better medical skills, how dare you call him Young Master? Shouldn’t you honor him as a Senior?”","As soon as the words came out, laughter came from the crowd one after another.","Some people were afraid that the world would not be chaotic, and even started booing directly.","“That’s right, he should be addressed as Senior!”","“The medical skills of the young man in white are much better than those of you old coots. What else do you have to say?”","“Isn’t it a fine tradition for Spirit Spirit Medicine Masters to respect their predecessors?”","These gloating words made the judges even more embarrassed to get off the stage. Their faces were flushed, and they held back for a long time before they could speak.","They really feel wronged and aggrieved!","They were all in their 70s and 80s. Usually in the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, they bully the new Spirit Medicine Masters because they were older. No one dares to offend them at all!","And Liu Buyan was not even half their age, so how could they address him like this?","Besides, they were not convinced by Liu Buyan’s medical skills at all.","Although Liu Buyan cured Lu Dongfeng with a single medicinal pill, they didn’t believe that Liu Buyan made the medicinal pill himself. He must have bought it from somewhere, and it doesn’t represent his medical skills at all!","The leading judge thought for a while and said, “Young Master, you don’t have to be so aggressive, right? Although this medicinal pill has miraculous effects, it’s not made by you...”","Liu Buyan frowned slightly, “How do you know that this medicinal pill was not made by me?”","When the leading judge heard this, he thought he was right, and immediately said: “Is there any need to guess? You are just an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master, and you can’t refine such a high-level medicinal pill! Everyone We all know it well, it will be boring for you to pretend again! We also know that what we did today is not right.”","When these words came from the judge, he thought it was already a kind of goodwill.","However, this is still a tone of charity, which makes people feel strangely uncomfortable.","The cultivators onlookers booed, and they were quite disdainful of the judges’ attitude.","Some people even yelled, tell Liu Buyan not to be fooled by the judges’ few words, and make him bow his head and make them call him Senior!","However, Liu Buyan’s attitude had no fluctuation.","He glanced at the judges, “Then now, can we announce the result of the Pill Competition?”"]},{"number":3621,"title":"Chapter 3621 Really Cried (8)","paragraphs":["3621 Really Cried (8)","“Yes, yes, of course!” The leading judge nodded repeatedly.","Previously, they denied it in every possible way and favored Lu Dongfeng, mainly because they were afraid that Elder Lu behind Lu Dongfeng would blame them, and they couldn’t afford it.","But now the situation is a little different.","Liu Buyan took out a precious saint level medicinal pill and cured Lu Dongfeng’s injury.","At that time, if Elder Lu pursues it, they can still use this matter as an excuse, and it can be regarded as an explanation.","Thinking of this, the leading judge immediately turned around, faced all the onlookers, and announced loudly: “Everyone, there was an accident just now, so the result of the Pill Competition had not been announced. However, everyone should have seen the situation just now, so there is no need for me to say more. Now, since Young Master Liu has an opinion, let me make it official. The winner of the fight is Young Master Liu. He managed to refine the finished Special Jade Pill, unfortunately, Young Master Lu met with an accident hence he can only be at a disadvantage.”","What he said was very skillful.","First, he said that everyone with eyes can tell the winner or loser, so as to justify the behavior he denied just now.","Then, he said emphatically that something happened to Lu Dongfeng here, and he deliberately didn’t say how many pills Liu Buyan had refined and what quality they were. In this way, it seemed that Liu Buyan’s alchemy skills were average, but It’s as if luckily won when Lu Dongfeng had an accident.","When Huang Yueli heard this, she despised these Spirit Medicine Masters even more in her heart.","Who were these people? Do you really think everyone else was a fool?","The shocked and speechless expressions of the judges when they saw Liu Buyan’s pill furnace just now explained everything.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Liu Buyan’s pill was of really good quality, how could he be so surprised!","It’s just that after Lu Dongfeng’s burn and healing, it has been delayed for so long, and Liu Buyan’s pill is still in the pill furnace. Even if it is not directly damaged, the quality must have dropped by several grades.","In this way, it can really be said that there is no proof.","Huang Yueli was angry in her heart, and as soon as she turned her eyes, she was about to stand up and speak for Liu Buyan.","But at this moment, Liu Buyan glanced in her direction intentionally or unintentionally.","The two of them made eye contact, and Huang Yueli saw a smile flashing across Liu Buyan’s eyes. She was startled, and couldn’t help but stop.","Only to hear Liu Buyan speak again: “Thank you to the judges for your fair decision. I am very grateful.”","Upon hearing this, some of the onlookers who were more understanding became a little anxious.","“Young Master, what are you thanking them for!”","“They have cheated you so much, don’t be so stupid!”","Liu Buyan acted as if he had never heard of it, and his expression and tone seemed very sincere.","The four judges immediately felt that the young man was quite clever, and the expression on his face relaxed a lot.","However, before they breathed a sigh of relief, they heard Liu Buyan and said lightly: “Since the matter of Pill Competition is over, then we should talk about the next thing. Let’s settle the fee for the treatment just now!”","“The fee... for treatment?” The judges were stunned for a moment, with confused expressions on their faces.","Liu Buyan nodded, and said slowly, “That’s right, I gave Young Master Lu a consultation just now, but I didn’t say it was free! The Fire Rejuvenation Pill he took is a saint ranked medicine pill!”"]},{"number":3622,"title":"Chapter 3622 Really Cried (9)","paragraphs":["3622 Really Cried (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After hearing these words, the four judges were completely stunned. In the situation just now, everyone subconsciously thought that Liu Buyan treated Lu Dongfeng because he was eager to prove his medical skills and suppress them.","No one would have thought that Liu Buyan would still charge money!","No wonder he was so talkative just now, and he didn’t force them to call him Senior anymore. It turns out that he had a more vicious trick waiting here!","The leading judge’s face was blue and white, and after a while, he choked out, “What do you mean? When you took out the medicinal pill just now, you didn’t say we had to pay for it. How can you...”","Liu Buyan said coldly: “You need to pay money for seeing a doctor, and you need money to buy medicines. Do you need me to tell you about such a simple matter? Everyone is a Spirit Medicine Master. Is it like this when you usually treat others? Wow, I really respect you, you don’t even accept money?”","!!","“This...this...” Several people were tongue-tied.","When the surrounding cultivators heard this, they all reacted one by one.","Although most people also understand that Liu Buyan just dug a hole for a few judges to jump into!","However, what Liu Buyan said was completely impeccable, making it impossible to refute.","“Yes, yes, how can you not pay for medical treatment?”","“Isn’t it? When I went to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda to ask a few Spirit Medicine Masters for medical treatment, the fees you charged for the treatment were so expensive that we ordinary cultivators would go bankrupt. How could it be your turn to renege on your bill ?”","“That’s right, you guys are so poor in medical skills, yet you still charge a high price. This young man in white has such superb medical skills, and his medication worked so well. Of course, he should charge money, and he should charge a little more!”","Relying on their own skills, the Spirit Medicine Masters of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda not only charge extremely high fees for diagnosis and treatment, but also often take advantage of the cultivator’s ignorance of the spirit medicine technique to deliberately charge exorbitant fees. Some people have long been dissatisfied.","Taking advantage of this opportunity, everyone ridiculed them, obviously speaking for Liu Buyan, but secretly complaining about Spirit Medicine Masters.","The four judges were so scolded that they couldn’t lift their heads, and their faces were extremely ugly.","The leading judge coughed heavily, and said sharply, “Enough! Who allowed you to make such a noise at the gate of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda? Shut up! When did I say I won’t pay?”","After finishing speaking, he turned to Liu Buyan, and said unwillingly: “Young Master saved our Young Master Lu, no one else can ask for this opportunity. Here, take it!”","As the lead judge said, he took out a money bag from his sleeve, and threw it at Liu Buyan in the face.","He really wanted to smash Liu Buyan’s handsome face!","Just such a suave-looking little boy, actually managed to play with all of them, Senior Spirit Medicine Masters!","Today, they really underestimated him, and they were completely tricked!","It’s a pity that the deepest wishes of the judges have absolutely no possibility of coming true.","Liu Buyan’s skill was much better than they imagined. He stretched out his hand and caught it casually.","He immediately took out the money bag and shook out the money inside in front of everyone.","“One, two, three... fourteen, fifteen, sixteen. A total of sixteen pieces of middle-grade crystal jade.”","Liu Buyan finished counting, frowned slightly, and turned to the leading judge, “Did you take the wrong money bag?”"]},{"number":3623,"title":"Chapter 3623 Really Cried (10)","paragraphs":["3623 Really Cried (10)","Sixteen pieces of middle-grade crystal jade was quite a fortune for ordinary cultivators.","However, for Liu Buyan, getting this little money was far from enough.","“I took it wrong? How is it possible?” The lead judge said, “This is the fee for your diagnosis and treatment. There is nothing wrong with it!”","Liu Buyan’s face darkened, “What, are you sending the beggar for this little money?”","The lead judge snorted coldly, and said: “You really think highly of yourself! You are just an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master, and the cost of seeing a doctor is so high?! If you don’t believe me, you can have a look yourself.” Take a look at the price of diagnosis and treatment hanging at the gate of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda for medicinal pill. It’s just a little guy who just started, does he really think he’s a Saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli, who was standing in the crowd, turned her head subconsciously and looked towards the entrance of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda.","Sure enough, there was an exquisite small plaque hanging there, on which was written the various fees for consultation and medicinal pills by Spirit Medicine Masters of all levels.","“I didn’t expect that the regulations of the medicinal pill would be so detailed!” Huang Yueli muttered to herself, slightly surprised.","Thinking about it, the headquarters of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, has a good idea. It is hoped that more cultivators can be treated at a standardized price.","But in fact, it was impossible to do it.","Because the number of Spirit Medicine Masters was very scarce, and ordinary people don’t know about medicinal pill techniques, if they want to treat them carefully, they must pay extra money, which must far exceed the price on the plaque.","Some saint level Spirit Medicine Masters with great reputations rarely appear in the Heaven Elixir Pagoda. If you want to invite them to see you, you can only do it by entrusting various connections and spending countless amounts of money and time.","Therefore, even if it is the earth-level Spirit Medicine Master of Arcane City’s Heaven Elixir Pagoda, it is impossible to only take this little diagnosis and treatment fee.","Most cultivators understand this truth in their hearts.","However, the lead judge said it in such a high-sounding tone, it was impossible to say that he was wrong.","After all, the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, the medicinal pill, was really stipulated this way. It’s just that there were many accidents when it was implemented. However, it was definitely impossible to say publicly about the things under the table, and it was impossible to make sense of them.","Many people thought that Liu Buyan’s actions were self-defeating.","He was determined to suffer from this loss.","Unexpectedly, Liu Buyan didn’t look back at the writing on the plaque at all. Instead, he stuffed the crystal jade back into the purse, and slapped the leading judge in the face with a wave of his hand.","Most of the Spirit Medicine Masters’ martial arts cultivation bases were not very good.","Liu Buyan’s shot was quick and accurate, he couldn’t dodge it in time, and was hit directly at the bridge of his nose.","When the hard crystal jade hit the nasal bone, not only did it hurt, but also a sore feeling came from his face immediately. The lead judge opened his mouth, and tears flowed down his face.","The cultivators in the audience all exclaimed in shock!","The lead judge also realized that his current appearance was very embarrassing, and tried hard to hold back his tears.","It’s a pity that no matter how hard he tried, it didn’t work.","Because he will cry, mainly not because the pain is unbearable, but a physiological reaction, this was simply unbearable!","“Oh, you... What’s the matter with you? It’s just a dozen or so mid-grade crystal jades, why did it make you cry?” Liu Buyan’s face gradually showed an exaggerated expression of shock.","“What do you mean? You dare to be rough to a Spirit Medicine Master!”"]},{"number":3624,"title":"Chapter 3624 Really Cried (11)","paragraphs":["3624 Really Cried (11)","Seeing this scene, the other three judges were startled and angry, and could no longer hide behind the leader, so they quickly stood up and questioned Liu Buyan’s action together.","Liu Buyan blinked his eyes, and said innocently: “What do you mean by this? Violence? How can I be violent?”","“You...you threw your money bag in Doctor Chen’s face, and you said you didn’t use any violence? You’re clearly insulting him!” One Spirit Medicine Master said angrily.","Liu Buyan still looked innocent, “This...what did you say? Throwing a money bag at the face, isn’t it the etiquette among the Spirit Medicine Masters of Arcane City? This Doctor Chen just gave the money to me in the same way. As for what I did, I learned from him because I was afraid that I would not be well-mannered when I first arrived here!”","!!","“Pfft...”","When Huang Yueli heard his ‘innocent explanation’ she almost burst out in laughter.","Her Senior Brother was also very black-bellied. Don’t simply look at the fact that he came from the lower realm, he was quite stable in front of himself and Li Moying. In fact, if you provoke him, the consequences will be very serious!","Today, these Spirit Medicine Masters provoked him, and it was regarded as their bad luck for eight lifetimes.","Huang Yueli’s smile broke the silence in the crowd.","The people who were stunned just now came to their senses now, and laughed mockingly.","Liu Buyan’s move was really amazing!","If others were rude to him, he would return it as it is!","Not only that, but he was able to act so innocent, knowing that what he said was ironic, but it was irrefutable!","Several judges blushed with anger, but there was nothing they could do.","However, what made them even more desperate was yet to come.","Liu Buyan walked under the small plaque with the price, pointed to a line of small characters on it, and said, “Actually, everyone is a colleague of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, and the method of diagnosis and treatment I just had is very simple. I’m also a bit embarrassed about the middle-grade crystal jade, but the money...forget it!”","Liu Buyan’s words surprised everyone.","Did he... feel that he had achieved his goal, and decided to accept it?","The judges and Lu Dongfeng who was lying on the stretcher all looked at him in surprise. They couldn’t believe that Liu Buyan would be so kind.","“You... What are you planning? Would you be willing not to take money?” Lu Dongfeng said in a trembling voice.","Liu Buyan smiled and said, “Does Doctor Lu have any misunderstandings about me? I said no fee for diagnosis and treatment. It’s just that I won’t charge consultation fee! But...”","He paused, and then said: “However, for the sake of everyone being a Spirit Medicine Master, consultation fee may not be charged, but you still have to pay me for the medicinal pill? It is written on the plaque that if during consultation that medicinal pills were needed as part of the treatment plan, then the medicinal pills will be charged separately. The medicinal pill which I took out just now was a saint level medicinal pill! I am just an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master, and I am very poor. I’m sure you can understand that I can’t give away such things for free.”","Upon hearing this, the faces of Lu Dongfeng and the others turned green!","They knew it! He wouldn’t be so kind!","He also said that the consultation fee for diagnosis and treatment will not be charged. It turns out that he was waiting to collect the money for the medicinal pill!","Lu Dongfeng really wanted to say that he didn’t want to take this medicinal pill at all, but Liu Buyan forced it into him. If he had known earlier that this was a saint level medicinal pill and had to pay for it, then he would rather suffer for a few more days than take it casually!","But now, he had already eaten it and his injury had healed, so it was already too late to say anything more!"]},{"number":3625,"title":"Chapter 3625 Really Cried (12)","paragraphs":["3625 Really Cried (12)","With so many people watching, he had no choice but to bite the bullet and ask, “How much is your medicinal pill...?”","Liu Buyan smiled slightly, “It’s not expensive, it’s just ten thousand low-grade jade quartz!”","“Ten thousand pieces of low-grade jade quartz!!”","“My goodness! Why is it so expensive!”","“Saint grade pills are so valuable!”","The ordinary cultivators who were watching at the sidelines were all shocked by this astonishing sky-high price.","Not only them, even Lu Dongfeng and the four judges also changed their faces.","The leading judge immediately said: “How dare you say that you are not taking the opportunity to blackmail? Saint grade pills are usually only one or two thousand low-grade jade quartz, and you actually want to sell it for ten thousand jade quartz! It is simply a robbery!”","Liu Buyan said slowly: “Doctor Chen, you have to be responsible for what you say! Everyone is a Spirit Medicine Master, don’t you know that the price of the medicinal pill is not only based on its grade, but also on the specific quality of the medicinal pill? The quality of pills varies greatly in quality and efficacy, and the price will naturally vary by several times.”","As Liu Buyan spoke, he took out the medicine bottle from his sleeve, and poured out several pills from it at once.","“My Fire Rejuvenation Pills are all top-grade saint level pills. The grains of the pills are threefold, and the color is even more perfect. According to the market price, ten thousand low-grade jade quartz is still considered cheap! ”","Liu Buyan stretched out his hand in front of the four judges, and showed them the pill.","The four of them took a closer look and were all dumbfounded on the spot.","Although their own strength was not up to the level of Saint Spirit Medicine Masters, they still knew their stuff.","These pills were indeed the best saint grade pills. One could tell just by looking at the pill pattern outside and the faint halo surrounding the pills.","The faces of the four of them immediately became extremely ugly!","They couldn’t figure it out, the young man in front of them was just an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master, how could he take out a saint level medicinal pill so casually, and it was even the best among the saint grade!","Moreover, he even took out so many at once!","Now, the evidence was right before them, they couldn’t even deny it!","Liu Buyan was right. If you’re lucky, it’s not uncommon for such a pill to sell for twenty thousand jade quartz at the auction house. Ten thousand jade quartz was indeed cheap.","Lu Dongfeng originally wanted to refute and find out some faults in the pills, but after seeing these pills, he was speechless.","The muscles on his face were twitching involuntarily.","Ten thousand low-grade jade quartz!","He had been a Spirit Medicine Master for so many years, and the money he earned was less than a thousand jade quartz!","He couldn’t afford so much money by himself, so he had to go home and ask Elder Lu for it.","If Elder Lu knew that he not only lost the Pill Competition, but also made such a fool of himself, he would definitely deal with him using the family’s law!","Liu Buyan didn’t expect them to answer, but just said with a faint smile: “Young Master Lu, if money is tight for you, you can just write an IOU, and I’ll go to Elder Lu to ask for money some other day. Seeing that you are still not in the best condition, so I won’t bother you to write it, I’ll just write the IOU in your stead.”","He took out a brush and paper, vigorously wrote a few sentences and handed it to Young Master Lu.","“Wait, show me the IOU!” Doctor Chen feared that he was playing tricks again, so he immediately stood up and snatched the IOU away.","The four judges huddled together and studied the IOU carefully."]},{"number":3626,"title":"Chapter 3626 Playing Around (1)","paragraphs":["3626 Playing Around (1)","There was only a very brief sentence written on the IOU: “On X year, Xmonth, Xday, Lu Dongfeng seeked a medical consultation with Liu Buyan, an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master and took a top saint grade Fire Rejuvenation Pill, worth ten thousand low-grade jade quartz. Here is the IOU as a record and he is to pay Liu Buyan ten thousand low-grade jade quartz within seven days, and if the time limit is exceeded, the interest will be 100 low-grade jade quartz per day.”","It can be said that the content on this IOU was not at all different from the facts.","Although there was a clause that interest must be paid beyond the time limit, it was still within reasonable grounds. Such a requirement will appear on any IOU, lest the person who wrote the IOU would delay the payment with excuses.","This IOU was too normal!","!!","However, how could Liu Buyan not play tricks?","The four judges and Lu Dongfeng didn’t believe that he would be so kind. They checked the IOU several times, but still couldn’t find any problems.","Liu Buyan was not in a hurry, and kept watching calmly from the side.","No matter how they looked at it, they couldn’t find anything wrong with it, because he hadn’t tampered with the IOU in the first place.","After a long time, although Liu Buyan didn’t urge him, the crowd around him couldn’t stand it anymore, and they were even more impatient than him.","“What the hell is going on here? Why haven’t you signed yet?”","“It’s just a piece of paper, how many words can there be on it? After looking at it for a long time, don’t tell me you want to renege on your debt?”","“Today we have learned a lot! The majestic heaven-level Spirit Medicine Master is usually very arrogant in front of us, and looks rich and powerful. As a result, now he doesn’t pay for the medicinal pill!”","“Today was really a big show! It’s infinitely more exciting than the usual Pill Competitions!”","The discussion of the onlookers became louder and louder, reaching the ears of several judges, and immediately made them all blush and feel ashamed.","Today was the most shameful day of their lives!","From the beginning to the end, Liu Buyan was just trampling on their confidence and pride.","Moreover, even though they knew that they were being tricked by Liu Buyan, they still couldn’t reason it out with him!","It was simply because Liu Buyan’s alchemy skills were so outstanding that he completely crushed Lu Dongfeng.","If it wasn’t for the few of them being smart enough to use unfair means to suppress Liu Buyan and forcibly prevent him from winning, then these subsequent things might not have happened.","This was really lifting a rock and hitting yourself in the foot!","Thinking of this, the few people stopped hesitating and said directly to Lu Dongfeng: “Young Master Lu, there should be no problem with the IOU, why don’t you sign your name now! Ten thousand low-grade jade quartz should not be regarded as a lot for Elder Lu. Just give him the money when the time comes.”","Lu Dongfeng secretly groaned in his heart.","During this period of time, Elder Lu heard about the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who was seriously ill, and has been doing various experiments, trying to develop a medicine that could cure him, so that he can climb the high branch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan .","For this reason, he used countless precious medicinal materials every day, and spent money like running water.","Ten thousand low-grade jade quartz may not be a big deal to the former Elder Lu and he’ll just casually pay for him.","However, now is the time when he’s short of money, and if Lu Dongfeng still bothers him with this kind of thing, it will definitely not please him!","However, he couldn’t say these words.","In desperation, he could only take the brush and paper, and signed his name on the IOU in despair."]},{"number":3627,"title":"Chapter 3627 Playing Around (2)","paragraphs":["3627 Playing Around (2)","“Well, there is no problem with the IOU. This time I gave you a super low price, but since we are all in the same business, there is no need to thank me too much.”","Liu Buyan took the IOU, looked at it casually, stuffed it into his pocket, turned his head and said to Lu Dongfeng with a smile.","Lu Dongfeng was so angry that he gritted his teeth, wishing he could rush up and bite him!","He had been harmed so miserably by him. Not only was he seriously injured, his wallet was bleeding, but even his reputation was also ruined. In the end, he still said such sarcastic remarks!","But who knew, this was not over yet.","After Liu Buyan received the IOU, he said with a smile: “Actually, I didn’t want to charge such a high price, because the medicinal pills I made by myself usually only charge a cost price to my colleagues, but since you don’t believe that this was made by me, so I have to charge a little more!”","Lu Dongfeng and the four judges were taken aback when they heard this!","These saint level Fire Rejuvenation Pills... were all refined by the kid in front of him? How was this possible?","But after thinking about it, he felt that there was still such a possibility. After all, Liu Buyan took out a whole bottle of pills of the same quality just now!","If he bought all of these, then it would cost hundreds of thousands of low-grade jade quartz. Where would he get so much money from?","However, the most important matter was...","The medicinal pills he made himself were sold to his peers at cost price!","When Lu Dongfeng heard these words, his mind was buzzing! What Liu Buyan said later was directly blocked by him.","Everyone was a Spirit Medicine Master. The profit of this medicinal pill was not a secret. They know it well in their hearts!","Although the various treasures of heaven and earth for refining medicine were very expensive, compared to the pills, they were only one-fifth of the value of the pills.","In other words, if he only charged the cost price, he may only need less than two thousand jade quartz to buy Liu Buyan’s medicinal pill!","Two thousand jade quartz was of course a huge sum of money to Lu Dongfeng.","However, if he sold all the treasures he had collected over the years, he could still afford this amount, so he didn’t have to show his embarrassment to Elder Lu.","Thinking of this, Lu Dongfeng immediately said excitedly: “Doctor Liu, no, Divine Doctor Liu! I didn’t expect you to be so powerful that you can even refine saint grade pills. It is really a rare medicinal pill in the entire God Realm. You are simply a genius! Just now, it was my blindness to not see the awe of yours truly. Your greatness is apparent, please do not bother with such small characters like myself!”","He changed his previous extremely arrogant attitude, and complimented Liu Buyan in various ways.","The change in attitude was so abrupt that anyone with eyes could see what was going on.","The cultivators watching couldn’t help booing.","Lu Dongfeng’s own face was also a little red, but thinking that he was already ashamed anyway, and he was not so close. If he could save such a huge sum of money by saying a few good words, he felt that everything was all worth it.","Lu Dongfeng tried his best to force a smile on his fat face, and said obsequiously: “Divine Doctor Liu, you see, you are such a remarkable genius, you certainly won’t care about a mere thousands of jade quartz, will you?”","Liu Buyan lowered his eyes, glanced at Lu Dongfeng lightly, and said slowly: “Unfortunately, I didn’t refine these pills...”"]},{"number":3628,"title":"Chapter 3628 Playing Around (3)","paragraphs":["3628 Playing Around (3)","“No, no, no! Please don’t be so humble!”","Before Liu Buyan could finish his sentence, Lu Dongfeng hurried up and said hastily: “We were in the wrong, we were blind and offended you. We really didn’t mean it! I must have eaten the heart of a bear and the guts of a leopard just now to have actually dared to compete with Divine Doctor Liu! No wonder I can’t beat you no matter what! It’s all my fault, I already know I was wrong!”","Liu Buyan nodded, “It’s good to know that you’re wrong, everyone has faults, you can correct your mistakes, and learn from it.”","When Lu Dongfeng heard these words, it seemed that Liu Buyan had relented and meant to forgive him, and he was overjoyed.","From this point of view, Liu Buyan was quite easy to talk to. To save eight thousand jade quartz in such a simple way, it could be regarded as a great fortune among misfortunes!","He was about to make persistent efforts to get Liu Buyan to tear up the IOU, but unexpectedly, Liu Buyan changed the topic and continued: “However, I really didn’t refine those pills.”","“Divine Doctor Liu, why do you still say this...” The several judges also came out to intercede.","Previously, they saw Liu Buyan as a little boy, but now that they heard these words and looked back, they suddenly felt that he was completely different from what they had envisioned him to be!","With Liu Buyan’s appearance and temperament, he was like a peerless genius at first glance!","This was definitely a hidden expert!","Liu Buyan smiled lightly and said, “What did I say? I’m telling the truth! What you said just now was not wrong. I’m just an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master, and I can’t make saint grade medicinal pills at all, moreover these are still the best of the saint grade. To be honest, my strength can indeed reach the heaven level, but the saint level... I don’t even dare to think about it myself! Those Fire Rejuvenation Pills were found in a secret realm which I had inadvertently ventured in a few days ago.”","“What... what?”","Lu Dongfeng and the four judges were all dumbfounded, staring at Liu Buyan in a daze, unable to recover for a long time.","Hearing what Liu Buyan said, they were a little undecided for a moment.","Because, the facts were indeed like this!","Liu Buyan’s bone age was less than fifty years old. At this age, he has reached the level of a heaven level Spirit Medicine Master. He was already a top genius in the God Realm. It was indeed impossible to reach the saint level...","If he was a genius of such calibre, the headquarters of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda would have already taken good care of him, how could he still have the badge of an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master?","Liu Buyan said casually: “Maybe I really said something wrong just now, which caused a few misunderstandings. I’m really sorry. Now that everything has been explained clearly, then... let’s move on. Young Master Lu , please don’t forget to prepare ten thousand low-grade jade quartz within seven days.”","He waved his hand, and then left without looking back.","Lu Dongfeng and the four judges were still unable to recover.","After a while, a few people came back to their senses.","“Damn, I was tricked by this little boy!” Lu Dongfeng slapped his thigh suddenly, so angry that his throat became sweet, and he almost vomited blood on the spot.","At this moment, he finally understood that Liu Buyan probably really couldn’t refine these pills, but the ambiguous words he deliberately said just now were obviously misleading him, making him think that there was a chance to pay back less money .","And he was already worried about the huge sum of ten thousand low-grade jade quartz, so he took the bait easily without thinking too much. He had actually flattered him with all kinds of compliments."]},{"number":3629,"title":"Chapter 3629 Playing Around (4)","paragraphs":["3629 Playing Around (4)","However, Liu Buyan simply was watching him as a joke!","He deliberately wanted to make himself ashamed more thoroughly!","Lu Dongfeng’s face turned pale, and he couldn’t bear it anymore, and suddenly collapsed.","“Oh no, Young Master Lu fainted!”","“Someone, come quickly!”","The scene was in chaos. The four judges were in a hurry to save people. The cultivators who watched the scene were still reluctant to leave after watching the drama unfold. They were still gathered around the gate of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda.","Huang Yueli saw that Liu Buyan had already reached the corner of the street, and hurriedly wanted to chase her.","However, when she was about to leave, out of the corner of her eyes, she saw the dealer who was secretly packing up his things, and her gaze turned cold.","With a flash of her figure, she appeared in front of the gambling table.","“Dealer, I bet one hundred low-grade jade quartz just now, and now the result of the Pill Competition has come out. According to the odds agreed, you should give me five hundred low-grade jade quartz, give it to me quickly. It’s not early, let’s end this earlier, I still have something to do!”","When the dealer saw Huang Yueli, his face immediately fell.","Just now he was engrossed in watching the play, and he didn’t realise until Liu Buyan left that Liu Buyan’s victory was not only not a good thing for him, but a bad thing that couldn’t be worse!","That would mean that he would give Huang Yueli five hundred low-grade jade quartz!","That money was not a small amount for Lu Dongfeng, he was only a small dealer who opens a temporary gamble, and he will lose his pants!","Thinking of this, the dealer didn’t care about anything else, and planned to sneak away quickly while Huang Yueli wasn’t paying attention.","Although his reputation was pretty good, he still chose to renege on such a large sum of money.","But who knows, Huang Yueli’s reaction speed is faster than he imagined.","Just now, she was still far away in the crowd, yet she appeared in front of him in an instant.","“This... This Lady, although she said that the young man in white did win, but the situation just now is a bit different from the bet we agreed on at the beginning...”","The dealer’s gaze went up, down, left, and right, and he was constantly thinking about it, trying to find a reason to renege on the debt.","Huang Yueli sneered, “Stop talking nonsense, if you’re willing to gamble then you also have to be prepared to admit defeat! Hurry up and give me the money!”","“This...girl, it doesn’t make sense for you to be so aggressive. You have to think about it, you are a rich man, and a hundred pieces of low-grade jade quartz are nothing to you, so I gave it out casually, but for many of the people who bet on Young Master Lu took out all their net worth! If they are all paid to you, then... they will not be able to survive!”","The dealer probably said it loudly for the other gamblers around to hear.","All of a sudden, the crowd became noisy again.","Many people were shocked by Liu Buyan’s amazing performance just now, and they didn’t realise until now that they had lost their bet!","Moreover, quite a few of them thought that they must win, and in order to earn more money from Huang Yueli, they even borrowed a lot of foreign debts!","The dealer purposely said that they were pitiful, that Huang Yueli was a rich person, just to provoke conflicts between these cultivators and Huang Yueli.","Although everyone understands the rationale behind willing to gamble then they also had to be prepared to admit defeat but when it was really their turn to lose their fortune, not many people had the courage to take responsibility.","Moreover, there were many cultivators and Huang Yueli was only one person, not to mention, she was a mere girl. With such a disparity in strength, there were a few people who started to think of ways to renege their debt!"]},{"number":3630,"title":"Chapter 3630 Playing Around (5)","paragraphs":["3630 Playing Around (5)","As soon as the dealer’s words fell, someone jumped out and said loudly: “That’s right! Lady, why since you are so rich, why do you still make things so difficult for us? So what if you lose this little bit of money?”","“You obviously came to trick us on purpose because of your wealth, right?”","“What’s the point of bullying ordinary cultivators like us who have no money?”","These people all looked filled with righteous indignation, they had long forgotten the faces they used to bet on when they thought Lu Dongfeng would win, but now, they put all the responsibility on Huang Yueli’s head, so to speak It was as if Huang Yueli held a knife to their necks to force them to bet.","Huang Yueli’s eyes turned cold, “Are you trying to renege on your debt?”","“Hehe, reneging on debts is out of the question. This bet is already outrageous. We just want to be fair.”","While defending themselves, everyone moved their feet, trying to surround the small table where they placed their bets, preventing Huang Yueli from taking the money.","Huang Yueli sneered, and said, “What are you guys doing stopping there? Even if I don’t gamble, I still have to get back the one hundred jade quartz I bet on myself, right?”","“Girl, a hundred jade quartz is just a small amount of money to you. Why are you so... Ouch!”","There were still people who wanted to make excuses, and even daydreamed, thinking that Huang Yueli said that she wanted to take back the bet because she was intimidated by so many of them, so she gave up.","Some people who harboured evil thoughts were even greedier, thinking that they could even swallow the money that Huang Yueli bet.","These people’s minds turned quickly, and they even started to think about how to scare Huang Yueli away.","But who knew, before they had time to do anything, or even finish those brazen words, the lady in front of them suddenly disappeared.","The slender figure suddenly swayed, and when she reappeared, she had already rushed in front of the person who just spoke.","This person was still smugly talking nonsense when Huang Yueli punched him on the bridge of the nose.","Huang Yueli had successfully advanced to the Heart Profound Realm and her strength had improved by leaps and bounds, and she was already comparable to cultivators in the later stages of the Heart Profound Realm.","This person was only at the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm, and he couldn’t even catch one of her moves, so he was sent flying!","His body flew a long distance, hitting the front door of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda and directly knocked down the small plaque at the door that stated the price of the diagnosis and treatment.","And, at the same time he flew out, two streams of blood floated up in the air.","This was not the fresh blood he spat out, but two streams of blood from his nose that spurted out uncontrollably.","Until this person fell to the ground, everyone took a closer look and gasped.","Huang Yueli’s punch directly broke the bridge of his nose, making his whole face a little sunken. Coupled with the unstoppable nosebleed flowing on his face, he looked extremely pathetic.","Suddenly, everyone’s eyes on Huang Yueli changed.","From the initial contempt, it turned into panic in an instant.","This weak beauty who looks delicate was actually so strong!","However, Huang Yueli herself didn’t even look at that person at all. After she knocked away the “obstacle” blocking the way, she continued to stride towards the betting table.","Most of the people were overwhelmed by Huang Yueli’s resolute strike.","However, there are still a handful of people who refuse to give up."]},{"number":3631,"title":"Chapter 3631 Playing Around (6)","paragraphs":["3631 Playing Around (6)","These people were relatively stronger among the betting cultivators, they have all reached the Heart Profound Realm, and they thought that they were tens of thousands of times stronger than that of the pathetic man that was sent flying into the air earlier.","Moreover, the thought of losing so much money at once aroused their evil thoughts.","These few people strode out, rushed in front of Huang Yueli, and stopped in front of the table.","“This Lady, if you have something to say, please speak up. Using brute force will not... Ouch!”","!!","“Arghhhh! Ouch!”","“Ugh! Ouch!”","Almost in the blink of an eye, these people were sent flying by Huang Yueli one after another, and the screams rang out one after another, but most of them didn’t even see how Huang Yueli attacked.","When everyone came back to their senses, they saw one figure after another flying over everyone’s heads, hitting the wall of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda one after another.","The Heaven Elixir Pagoda, was originally a hut with a rather simple appearance, and it couldn’t withstand such an impact at all. Several bricks and stones on the wall fell off, and it was about to be knocked down.","And after Huang Yueli sent these people flying, she rushed straight to the small table without even stopping.","At this time, it was too late for anyone else to come to stop her, and only the dealer was sitting behind the small table.","Seeing Huang Yueli approaching, he was still unrepentant. He had no choice but to lie down on the table and use his body to cover all the jade quartz to prevent Huang Yueli from taking the money.","There was only one thought in his mind, and that was to keep the money no matter what!","After today, his credibility had been completely ruined. Even if he becomes a dealer again, no one would dare to bet with a person like him who doesn’t keep his word! Therefore, he can’t lose the pension money!","It’s a pity that what he thought had no effect on Huang Yueli at all.","Huang Yueli stretched out her slender fair hands, grabbed the dealer’s collar, and threw him out without any effort!","The onlookers watched dumbfoundedly as the dealer flew in a wonderful arc in the air, and finally... it just landed on the chimney of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda!","Inside the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, there are many Spirit Medicine Masters refining medicinal pills every day and that generated a lot of smoke which was expelled from this chimney.","Therefore, this chimney was built very high, and it was filled with thick smoke all year round.","Now the dealer’s body landed directly on the top of the chimney, just blocking the exit.","The dealer immediately howled like a pig being killed, because all the hot smoke hit him, and the taste was almost the same as that of Lu Dongfeng being scalded by the pill furnace before.","Thick smoke continued to accumulate at the bottom of the chimney, and finally reached the limit, generating a huge force that dragged the dealer’s body up.","The dealer was like a bottle cork that was bounced off. His body flew straight into the sky, then crossed the sky, and fell out of everyone’s sight.","The onlookers were fascinated by the scene that unfolded before them as they watched with relish. They waited until the dealer’s voice could no longer be heard, before they slapped their thighs and suddenly came to their senses.","“Oh my god! This dealer really got it bad this time! What a miserable fellow!”","“Looking at the arc of his flight, it is really pleasing to the eye!”","“Did you see how he looked when he was sent flying by the thick smoke? It was so ridiculous, he looked like a dead mouse, and he was still black!”","“This kid is doomed now, he might be beaten into a useless person! I really don’t know if that lady did it on purpose, or is it just a coincidence?”"]},{"number":3632,"title":"Chapter 3632 Liu Buyan’s Experience (1)","paragraphs":["3632 Liu Buyan’s Experience (1)","There weren’t just one or two people who had such doubts.","Huang Yueli was able to knock away so many experts at the Heart Profound Realm at once, even a blind person could see that her strength was extraordinary.","However, if you want to get so far away, just throwing people on top of a chimney tens of meters high, this was something that even many Life Profound Realm cultivators can’t do. , but... Few people can come up with such a cruel and funny method.","When everyone heard this question, they subconsciously turned to the direction of the small table, wanting to see what Huang Yueli was doing.","But when they turned around, they were surprised to find that Huang Yueli had disappeared!","In fact, the moment everyone went to check on the dealer, Huang Yueli directly grabbed all the money and treasures on the table, took advantage while no one was paying attention and left directly!","In fact, she didn’t want to argue with others at all, and she didn’t have time to argue. She just wanted to get back the money she deserved.","Although a hundred pieces of low-grade jade quartz was really considered small change for her, and if those cultivators who had lost their fortunes had sincerely requested her to let them go, she would just rush to chase after Liu Buyan, maybe she wouldn’t even bother to care about it.","However, these people actually came up with such a shameless idea and wanted to threaten her!","Then don’t blame her for being cruel and merciless, teaching them how to behave on behalf of their parents and master!","According to the rules of placing bets in the God Realm, after Huang Yueli placed her bet, the dealer had to put enough money and equivalent valued items next to her bet, to prove that he would have the money to pay if he lost.","Just now, the dealer had already taken out all his money and treasures on the small table, and it was too late to take them away.","This saved Huang Yueli a lot of work. She just cleaned up everything on the table and left!","After leaving quietly, Huang Yueli was ready to chase Liu Buyan.","Just now, she was stopped by the dealer and the others, which took a lot of her time. She hoped that she wouldn’t lose track of Liu Buyan.","However, she was still very familiar with Liu Buyan’s style of doing things. He knows how to enjoy life and he will definitely live in some of the most luxurious inns in Arcane City. It shouldn’t be difficult to find out.","Huang Yueli was thinking while walking, when suddenly, she felt a powerful aura approaching from behind.","“Who?!”","She turned around abruptly, and there was already a small but extremely sharp dagger in her hand.","Her body turned around flexibly, and as she moved, the dagger hit the neck of the person.","“Ahem... Junior Sister, I haven’t seen you for more than half a year. Is this how you welcome me, your Senior Brother?”","Liu Buyan, who was dressed in a white, stared nervously at the dagger on his neck, and said helplessly.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, then put away the dagger, “You didn’t leave?”","Liu Buyan smiled and said, “You’re here, of course I can’t leave! I didn’t expect you to be so sharp and arrogant after arriving in the God Realm, not at all inferior to when you were in the Lower Realm!”","Huang Yueli curled her lips, “That’s why you haven’t seen how embarrassed I was hiding a few days ago! By the way, how did you find out my real identity? Could it be that there is something wrong with my disguise? ”","As Huang Yueli said, she subconsciously touched her face.","Liu Buyan shook his head, “No, there’s nothing wrong with your disguise. When I first saw you, I thought you were a foolish girl from the God Realm who had been enamored by my good looks...”"]},{"number":3633,"title":"Chapter 3633 Liu Buyan’s Experience (2)","paragraphs":["3633 Liu Buyan’s Experience (2)","Hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but give him a blank look, “I’ve never seen anyone so narcissistic!”","Liu Buyan smiled nonchalantly: “In what manner of narcissism is this considered? What I said is true! Didn’t you notice that when I was challenging that Young Master just now, there were many ladies staring at me?”","Huang Yueli could only laugh while gnashing her teeth.","When standing next to Li Moying before, Liu Buyan didn’t dare to be so arrogant.","It has only been two years since Li Moying left, and Liu Buyan has regained his flamboyant nature.","Liu Buyan was stared at by Huang Yueli for a few times, so he could only touch his nose and return to the main topic: “Well, I really didn’t find anything wrong with you before, everyone bet that I would lose badly, only you placed such a big bet all of a sudden, betting that I would win, of course that made me think that you were interested in me...”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she glanced at him coldly.","Liu Buyan was not afraid usually, but he was afraid that Huang Yueli, his little Junior Sister would be scared off by him so he could only laugh dryly: “I knew I was wrong later on! However, after I left , I felt that there must be a reason for you to suddenly jump out to help me, so I didn’t leave immediately. I hid on purpose and waited for you, and then I saw you showing off your skills and beating up those who didn’t have eyes!”","“I’m still very familiar with your moves. Besides, how many talented girls can be so powerful at such a young age, so I naturally thought of you.”","Huang Yueli nodded after listening, “As expected of my Senior Brother, he’s quite smart!”","“Of course!” Liu Buyan was still a little embarrassed.","At this moment, there were bursts of chaotic footsteps not far away.","Huang Yueli hurriedly looked around, pulled Liu Buyan and left, “This is not a place to talk, let’s go to the inn where you are staying first!”","Liu Buyan followed Huang Yueli’s words and brought Huang Yueli back to where he was staying. It was indeed the largest and most expensive inn in Arcane City.","Huang Yueli sat down on the chair, looked at the decorations in the room, and said with a smile: “You really know how to enjoy yourself so much! This place should be very expensive, so tell me, how did you get promoted so quickly? ? And, looking at you, it seems that you are doing well in the God Realm! You actually became an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master so soon!”","When it came to this matter, Liu Buyan was most proud of it.","However, he doesn’t have many acquaintances in the God Realm, and he has no place to show off his pride.","When he met Huang Yueli, he was able to talk about his situation over the past two years.","“Actually, it has been twenty years since I reached the peak of the Ninth Level Profound Realm. In terms of cultivation alone, when Li Moying ascended, I had already reached the level before his soul splitting, but the combat power was not as good as the both of you. However, for ascension, what I was focusing on was cultivation, not actual combat. After the space barrier was broken through, I was lucky enough to find an ancient relic, practiced in seclusion for more than a year, and successfully ascended.”","Huang Yueli nodded thoughtfully.","Although Liu Buyan said it lightly, Huang Yueli also knew that the ancient ruins Liu Buyan found must be extraordinary.","Otherwise, Liu Buyan’s talent can only be said to be ordinary compared with the cultivators of the God Realm and it was not so easy to ascend, plus he has the blood of the human race...","“Huh? Wait! Why do I feel that your bloodline aura is a little different from before? Did you accept some inheritance from the God Realm and change your bloodline talent?”"]},{"number":3634,"title":"Chapter 3634 Liu Buyan’s Experience (3)","paragraphs":["3634 Liu Buyan’s Experience (3)","Liu Buyan was surprised for a moment before he laughed.","“You really deserve to be a Junior Sister! Your vision is so sharp! Yes, I did inadvertently gain the inheritance left by the White Fen Clan in Soaring Heavens Continent. I was lucky enough to pass the inheritance trial and get a part of the blood of the White Fen Clan.”","Liu Buyan said it very lightly, but Huang Yueli knew very well how difficult it was to be able to achieve this!","She had a deep understanding of how difficult the inheritance trials of these ancient god clans were.","!!","Moreover, Huang Yueli herself had the blood of the Sacred Phoenix Clan and was still a god-level talent. It took a lot of effort to pass these trials.","And what about Liu Buyan? His own talent had not reached the god level, and he was a human. It was difficult to get the approval of the ancient gods... It was simply unimaginable!","Even Huang Yueli couldn’t figure out how difficult the challenge Liu Buyan had to complete in order to get such a reward.","However, Liu Buyan obviously didn’t intend to say more. Huang Yueli thought about it, but didn’t continue to ask.","Every cultivator has their own secrets, and they will never tell others even if they were killed. Although Liu Buyan may not refuse to tell if she asked, she did not have the hobby of probing into other people’s privacy.","Huang Yueli smiled, and said: “No wonder your alchemy has improved so much, it’s much better than when you were in the lower realm! So it’s because you have the blood of the White Fen Clan... The White Fen Clan are renowned for their wood attributes and they are the ancient God Clan who are best at medicinal pills, and most of the top Spirit Medicine Masters in the God Realm are from the White Fen Clan.”","Liu Buyan smiled and said: “So that’s how it is. When I accepted the inheritance, I didn’t know about it. I only heard about it after I arrived in the God Realm. However, I found a lot of classics on medicinal pill techniques in the ruins which helped me a lot.”","Huang Yueli asked Liu Buyan a few more words, and roughly understood some of his deeds after his ascension.","To put it simply, although Liu Buyan has accepted a part of the blood of the White Fen Clan, he was still a little bit different from peerless geniuses with pure blood like her and Li Moying. In addition, he has a loose nature and does not have a strong sense of belonging to the White Fen Clan. As long as the thought of going to a big family and being restrained, he couldn’t stand it.","Therefore, after he arrived in the God Realm, he did not go to the White Fen Continent, but chose to become a free and easy Spirit Medicine Master, practicing around the God Realm and healing people at the same time.","Huang Yueli nodded, and asked again: “Then... has my father already ascended to the God Realm? How is my mother’s situation now?”","Liu Buyan shook his head and said: “Marquis Bai probably hasn’t ascended yet, at least when I ascended, he didn’t show signs of breaking through, he and Madam have already returned to the South Yue Kingdom to live in seclusion, so they should be cultivating quietly there. ”","“Really?” Huang Yueli was slightly surprised, her eyes widened.","To be honest, Bai Liufeng’s cultivation level was obviously higher than Liu Buyan’s, and it was not much different from Li Moying’s.","According to Huang Yueli’s prediction, Bai Liufeng should be the first to ascend after her.","However, the facts were completely different from her guess.","Liu Buyan said: “It must be very easy for Marquis Bai to ascend. However, Madam has been imprisoned in the extreme northern ice field for more than ten years, her body is seriously injured, her cultivation is progressing slowly, and she is still far away from the tenth level. Come to think of it, Marquis Bai probably wants to ascend with his wife, right?”"]},{"number":3635,"title":"Chapter 3635 Liu Buyan’s Experience (4)","paragraphs":["3635 Liu Buyan’s Experience (4)","After Liu Buyan said this, Huang Yueli immediately understood.","Knowing Bai Liufeng’s deep love for his wife, he must be worried about leaving his wife alone in Soaring Heavens Continent after his ascension.","In fact, Li Moying was also the same. If he hadn’t encountered a life-and-death crisis at that time, Li Moying would not have broken through to the tenth level easily. When he broke through, the space barrier of Soaring Heavens Continent happened to be broken, which made him soar inadvertently.","If it weren’t for this, Li Moying had always wanted to ascend with his wife.","The corners of Huang Yueli’s lips curled up, “It seems that my parents should be living well in the lower realm, so I can rest assured.”","Liu Buyan smiled and said: “Before I ascended, I also went to see the two seniors. Marquis Bai and Madam are indeed very affectionate. However, they are a little worried about you, and they really want to come to the God Realm to see you in person. Besides, Madam Bai also plans to go to the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s inheritance which you mentioned to accept trials and improve her cultivation!”","“Ah, mother, she actually...” Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, her eyes were a little dark, “I’m really unfilial, I finally recognized my parents, but I didn’t stay with them for a few days, just to find my husband I rushed to the God Realm...”","Thinking of the excited and sad faces of Bai Liufeng and Huang Siluo when they met her, Huang Yueli felt very guilty.","As a daughter, she was really unqualified!","Seeing this, Liu Buyan comforted her softly: “Junior Sister, you don’t have beat yourself up about it. I think Marquis Bai and Madam Bai would definitely like to see you become a truly peerless powerhouse and climb to the pinnacle. They will be proud of a genius daughter like you! Since you have already reached the God Realm, don’t think too much about it.”","Huang Yueli bit her lip and nodded heavily, “Well, I will definitely work hard to gain a firm foothold in the God Realm. In this way, after my parents arrive in the God Realm, they will have a better life than in the Lower Realm!”","Speaking of which, Huang Yue’s heart was ignited with a new fighting spirit!","Originally, her ideal was to find Li Moying and cultivate hard with him, but now, she has another goal!","However, Huang Yueli’s excitement only lasted for a few moments.","Soon, she thought of the predicament she was facing now, and returned to reality.","Huang Yueli stared at Liu Buyan and asked, “Senior Brother, I’m asking you a question, you must answer it truthfully.”","Liu Buyan was taken aback, “What’s the problem?”","“The Fire Rejuvenation Pill that you gave to Young Master Lu earlier... Did you refine it?”","Liu Buyan looked at her, shook his head helplessly, and said, “Sure enough, I can’t hide anything from you, Junior Sister! It’s true that I refined those pills. I just said that because I just wanted to teach those rascals a lesson.”","Not only that, but Liu Buyan also didn’t want his talent for refining to be exposed so soon.","This was not the Soaring Heavens Continent. A young Spirit Medicine Master with such perverse talent, without the protection of a clan, he will easily encounter many people with malicious intentions.","However, if he seeks refuge with a powerful force, his safety will be guaranteed, but the freedom he wants most would be gone.","Huang Yueli understood his thoughts, nodded, and continued to ask: “So, you...you have actually reached the level of a Saint Spirit Medicine Master?”","When she said this, Huang Yueli’s voice trembled with excitement."]},{"number":3636,"title":"Chapter 3636 Liu Buyan’s Experience (5)","paragraphs":["3636 Liu Buyan’s Experience (5)","A Spirit Medicine Master reaching the saint level was almost the same as a Spiritual Armament Master reaching the level of a Sky Gem Grandmaster.","If Liu Buyan was already at the saint level, then he was even more powerful than Huang Yueli!","Huang Yueli had not been able to refine any treasure armament yet!","However, Liu Buyan had never been reborn, so in terms of bone age, he was much older than Huang Yueli.","Liu Buyan shook his head and said, “Whoa, your thoughts have really flown! If I was really a genuine saint level Spirit Medicine Master, I would have gone to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda and exchanged the medicinal pill for a badge. Why would I be picked on by that kid surnamed Lu and suffer such humiliation?”","Huang Yueli felt the same when she thought about it, and she couldn’t help but feel strange, “However, your Fire Rejuvenation Pills... are very perfect in appearance!”","Liu Buyan explained: “Fire Rejuvenation Pill is actually the only saint grade medicinal pill that I can successfully refine. In the place where I received the inheritance, I saw the refining method of the Fire Rejuvenation Pill improved by the White Fen Clan. I was also lucky to be able to get the Serene Spirit Flame which is one of the deviant flam inheritance of the White Fen Clan. This kind of deviant flame has a strong additive effect when refining the Fire Rejuvenation Pill. Only by adding various factors together can I refine the pills.”","“If I change to other saint level pills, there’s nothing I can do. Even refining heaven grade pills, I can’t refine all kinds of medicines successfully.”","After listening, Huang Yueli couldn’t help frowning.","There was nothing wrong with what Liu Buyan said.","Spirit Medicine Masters are somewhat different from Spiritual Armament Masters.","When the Spiritual Armament Master’s level is relatively low, in fact, he only needs to master more than a dozen standard Spirit Armament refining methods. Because for ordinary cultivators, the standard Spirit Armament can meet the needs of more than 90% of people. Those who have special requirements for the Spirit Armament need to be customized, and they are usually strong people above the Dao Profound Realm. Once these people customize the Spirit Armament, it must be the least at the level of a treasure armament, and that is the ability that only Sky Gem Grandmasters can master.","However, pills are different. Whether it is an ordinary cultivator or a top expert, there are all kinds of pills that are needed. There are hundreds of pills passed down in the God Realm.","Liu Buyan hasn’t been in the God Realm for a long time, and it’s normal that he doesn’t know how to refine many medicinal pills.","It’s just that Huang Yueli originally had high hopes for Liu Buyan, but now she was about to be disappointed.","“Hey, so it’s hard for you to pass the medicinal pill competition held by the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","As soon as Huang Yueli finished speaking, Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows.","“How do you know that I came this time to sign up for the competition?”","“Eh? Are you here to participate in the competition?” Huang Yueli was surprised.","Liu Buyan’s gaze stayed on her face, and slowly said: “I was just skeptical at first... Now it seems that I guessed right. This Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who was seriously injured and unconscious, is it Li Moying?”","Huang Yueli was startled, “That’s right, you guessed it a long time ago?”","It is no secret in Soaring Heavens Continent that she has the blood of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but few people know about Li Moying’s blood of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","However, Liu Buyan has had too much contact with them, even if the two of them didn’t say it clearly, it’s not surprising that he could see it.","Liu Buyan nodded solemnly, “After I arrived in the God Realm, the first thing I heard was the reputation of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, saying that he was the number one genius in tens of thousands of years in the God Realm! The time also coincides with Li Moying’s. At that time, I suspected it was him, but I’m not sure yet.”"]},{"number":3637,"title":"Chapter 3637 Liu Buyan’s Experience (6)","paragraphs":["3637 Liu Buyan’s Experience (6)","“In the Soaring Heavens Continent, Li Moying is of course the number one strongest person, but in the God Realm, can he still be so strong? To be honest, even I don’t really believe it.”","When Huang Yueli heard his words, she couldn’t help but curl her lips into a smile, “Of course my husband is powerful enough, no one else can compare with him!”","For Li Moying, she has always been full of confidence.","Liu Buyan snorted and said with great disdain: “All right, all right, your husband is the best, are you happy now?”","“Of course!” Huang Yueli replied arrogantly.","Liu Buyan turned his gaze contemptuously, refusing to be forcibly stuffed with this kind of sweet display of affection.","He continued on his own: “Anyway, I have heard a lot of rumors about the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. He is so handsome that he has attracted countless noble ladies from the God Clan. He is so talented in the Thunder Element that he even killed a mid-phase Sky Devil. These words sound more and more like him, but I still don’t understand...”","“What can’t you understand?” Huang Yue wondered.","Liu Buyan glanced at her, and said coolly: “It is said that the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan is suave, and there are countless aristocratic ladies who pursue him. However, the Cloudy Qilin Clan intends to let him marry within the clan, or rather they have already found several candidates for his fiancée... Then I am surprised, the Li Moying I know is already married!”","“Uh, this...cough cough!” Huang Yueli coughed awkwardly, “This is just a misunderstanding, it’s a rumor! Well, it can’t be said that it’s all a rumor, the Cloudy Qilin Clan did choose a fiancée for him, but, Moying has been with me all this time, and has never paid any attention to them.”","Liu Buyan snorted softly, “Junior Sister, you won’t be fooled by Li Moying, right? Let me tell you, this kind of man who is too handsome and too strong has too many temptations outside, so it’s hard to guarantee that he won’t make mistakes!”","Huang Yueli was not angry at all when she heard the words, she just gave Liu Buyan a funny look.","When he was in the Lower Realm, Liu Buyan liked to bring Li Moying down very much, and he still does the same now.","She naturally knew what kind of person Li Moying was, so it was impossible for her to doubt her husband because of this.","“Senior Brother, you envy us being a couple, so there’s no need to do that! Since you’ve been asking about Moying for so long, you should have heard about it. Later, he found a wife by himself, and almost fell out with his clam, right?”","Seeing that Huang Yueli couldn’t take the bait, Liu Buyan was a little disappointed.","However, he didn’t take it to heart, and said directly: “You are smart, I did hear people say later that Li Moying brought a human girl to the Empyrean Fox Continent, and said that it was his wife whom he had married in the lower realm. I also don’t understand how you, a genius girl from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, turned into a human race. However, I can confirm your identities at this time. After all, it is no coincidence that so many evidences come together to explain it.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she nodded with a smile.","“So, you came to Cloudy Qilin Continent on purpose this time, and you plan to sign up for the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s medicinal pill competition, just to save Moying?”","“Uh... this...”","A look of embarrassment flashed across Liu Buyan’s face, “Well, I did rush here on purpose, but I didn’t come here on purpose to save Li Moying, I just wanted to see if this kid is dead? What if something goes wrong? If anything happens, I can abduct you, Junior Sister.”"]},{"number":3638,"title":"Chapter 3638 Where Is The Problem?(1)","paragraphs":["3638 Where Is The Problem?(1)","After hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but curl the corners of her mouth.","Although Liu Buyan said so, Huang Yueli could tell that he had let go of his obsession with her.","If it wasn’t like this, Liu Buyan wouldn’t have rushed to Cloudy Qilin Continent on purpose.","No matter how stubborn he was, he came here to save Li Moying, and he made this decision when he was still not sure if Li Moying was injured!","Huang Yueli took a deep look at Liu Buyan, and felt very relieved in her heart. She always hoped that Liu Buyan could let go of her completely, instead of having to give in due to various reasons. Liu Buyan had helped both her and Li Moying so many times before and she really hoped that her Senior Brother could find his other half and they would truly love each other and also live a life of showing off their affection every day.","Liu Buyan was stared at by Huang Yueli’s strange gaze, and couldn’t help but shudder, “Ju... Junior Sister, why are you looking at me like this? What kind of ghostly ideas are brewing in your head?”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, looked him up and down, looked at Liu Buyan until he broke out in a cold sweat, before she said with a smile: “It’s not a ghostly idea, but I do have an excellent idea!”","Liu Buyan looked at her cute expression, but was still very vigilant, and asked, “What’s your idea?”","Huang Yueli said: “You came at the right time this time! I also want to participate in this competition of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It’s a pity that I can’t do so with my own pill refining skills, so I came to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda today just to find a saint level Spirit Medicine Master to cooperate with!”","Liu Buyan was stunned, obviously very surprised, “Wait, you... What did you say you were going to do? Did I hear you right? You want to participate in the medicinal pill competition held by the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Did you make a mistake?”","Huang Yueli said calmly: “That’s right, that’s it, you heard me right.”","“But... but... aren’t you Li Moying’s wife? Why did you participate... Wait, are all the gossips circulating in the God Realm true? The Cloudy Qilin Clan found a fiancee for Li Moying, and then firmly refusing to admit your identity?” Liu Buyan frowned as he thought of something.","“What the hell is Li Moying doing? When he was in the Lower Realm, wasn’t he very powerful? How did he become so useless in the God Realm? He couldn’t even protect his own woman! I understand. Were you driven out by the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Then you’re worried about Li Moying’s injury, so you want to take advantage of the opportunity of the competition to sneak into the Cloudy Qilin Clan to see him!”","Liu Buyan muttered to himself, and soon made up a big drama all by himself!","Huang Yueli felt an impending headache when she heard his mutters, and quickly interrupted him, “Stop—! Stop quickly, stop guessing!”","“Guess?” Liu Buyan snorted coldly, “Am I just guessing? It’s obvious that Li Moying is not good to you at all! Hmph, is there anything that I guessed wrong? After all the people have been dealt with, will you still be here? You can take me directly to see Li Moying, right? Is there any need for you to participate in any competition, huh?”","“Cough cough...this...”","A blush of embarrassment appeared on Huang Yueli’s face, and she had to admit, “This... part of your guess is correct. The Cloudy Qilin Clan does have some opinions on my marriage with Li Moying...”","Liu Buyan immediately raised his brows, “What?! Li Moying is too outrageous!”"]},{"number":3639,"title":"Chapter 3639 Where Is The Problem? (2)","paragraphs":["\"I saw that he treated you very well when he was in the Lower Realm, so I reluctantly agreed to let him marry my Junior Sister. What happened now? You have only been married for two years, and he treats you like this! No, you can't just let him bully you like this!\" Liu Buyan was filled with righteous indignation, wishing he could rush directly to Amethyst Paramount Palace, drag Li Moying out and beat him up.","Seeing his impulsive appearance, Huang Yueli quickly stopped him, \"Hey, Senior Brother, Senior Brother! Don't be so impulsive, listen to me!\"","Liu Buyan wanted to shake Huang Yueli away, but after pushing her away, Huang Yueli didn't budge at all, and he almost fell instead.","Only then did he realize that this was no longer the time when Huang Yueli had just been reborn!","Since Huang Yueli's accession, his cultivation has been incomparable with Huang Yueli's. In the past six months, the little girl has been in the God Realm, and her cultivation must have improved a lot. Maybe she can defeat him with simply one hand.","Liu Buyan's face darkened, but he still said reluctantly: \"Junior Sister, get out of the way! Let me tell you, I didn't just go on behalf of myself! Before I ascended, your father once told me that on behalf of your natal family, I will help you take a good look, and I won't let you be bullied by that brat surnamed Li!\"","When Huang Yueli heard this, she burst out laughing.","From the tone of her words, she could tell that these were her father's original words.","Although Bai Liufeng was still very satisfied with this son-in-law, but he always speaks unforgivingly, and he was afraid that he would bully this beloved daughter of his.","Actually, he didn't even think about it, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were together, who was bullying whom?","Huang Yueli smiled and felt a little sad again.","Before getting married, her parents and Li Moying were all by her side, but such beautiful days were too short. Now, not only her parents were still in the Lower Realm, but Li Moying was seriously injured...","Just as Huang Yueli was in a trance, Liu Buyan took the opportunity to walk towards the door.","But the moment he opened the door, someone grabbed his shoulders from behind, and then, a huge force came.","Liu Buyan couldn't resist at all, his body was dragged back more than a dozen steps, and he fell to sit on the edge of the bed before stopping.","When he came back to his senses, the door had been slammed shut again.","Huang Yueli was standing in front of him with her arms folded, her expression was not very good.","\"Alright, Senior Brother, you are a Spirit Medicine Master, how can you have such poor patience? Can't you just listen to me?\"","\"I...\"","Liu Buyan still wanted to defend himself, but Huang Yueli interrupted him unceremoniously, \"Now you want to go to the Cloudy Qilin Clan to make trouble, I won't stop you, but don't blame me for not reminding you, the current you, can't even hit Moying with a single finger! He has really killed a mid-phase Sky Devil!\"","\"Even if he's in a coma, there are plenty of experts in the Cloudy Qilin Clan! It's impossible for you to get close to their Young Master.\"","The muscles on Liu Buyan's face twitched, obviously quite depressed, but he couldn't find any way to refute Huang Yueli.","At the same time, his heart was even more shocked by Huang Yueli's words!","There were many rumours in the God Realm about Li Moying's talent and strength, but it's hard to tell if it's true or not, because some of them sound too exaggerated.","However, according to what Huang Yueli said...","These were all true?"]},{"number":3640,"title":"Chapter 3640 Where Is The Problem? (3)","paragraphs":["Was Li Moying really so powerful now?","Even in the God Realm, there aren't many who have the strength to kill a Sky Devil in the mid-phase, right?","Seeing that Liu Buyan had finally calmed down, Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief.","Fearing that there would be any misfortune, she didn't dare to keep her secret anymore, so she quickly told Liu Buyan all the series of things that happened after she ascended to the God Realm.","The more Liu Buyan listened, the more shocked he became, and he almost jumped out of bed a few times.","\"You... You have only been in the God Realm for more than half a year, and you have experienced so many things! You are also a god-level talent?! My God, who the hell do I know? God-level geniuses all so common? Why do I know two of them alone?\"","Huang Yueli's mouth twitched when she heard his exaggerated words, \"Of course it's because you have a good eye, Senior Brother...\"","\"Yes, yes, I have always had a good eye! Back when Mu Chengying was a poor boy, I was the first to see that he was not just anyone...\" Liu Buyan began to frown.","Huang Yueli hurriedly coughed heavily, \"Senior Brother, do you want to listen to me?\"","Only then did Liu Buyan come back to his senses, and smiled awkwardly: \"Oh yes, please say what you want to say, I won't say anything...\"","Huang Yueli couldn't help but glared at him, then continued.","But the following changes soon made Liu Buyan unable to laugh anymore.","\"...How is it possible? You are a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. Why do the elders of the clan dare to murder you?\"","\"...You're really too pitiful! However, to be able to escape from the Sky Devil territory alive, Junior Sister, you're also scary in a way!\"","\"...The people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are really shameless! Junior Sister, you slapped their faces beautifully!\"","\"...You actually found the inheritance of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow? How lucky are you?\"","While listening, Liu Buyan commented at every turn.","Huang Yueli was a little dumbfounded. Although Liu Buyan's personality was not as silent and cold as Li Moying's before, it shouldn't be like this, right?","After arriving in the God Realm, was it because of being stifled by being alone in an unfamiliar place?","Although Huang Yueli tried to keep the story short, because too many things happened during this period, it took her more than half an hour to explain the cause and effect clearly, and many details were omitted.","At the end, Liu Buyan's expression changed completely.","\"The person who plotted against you is actually the elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! He also accused Li Moying of killing you? How could this old man be so shameless?\"","Huang Yueli sighed secretly, \"It's meaningless to talk about it now. With him in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, I dare not go back easily. Moreover, only I can cure Moying's illness.\"","Speaking of this, Liu Buyan was also distracted, and leaned over to ask: \"Only you can cure? Why do you say that? What is wrong with him? Judging from the various rumours circulating outside, this is probably caused by damaged meridians by someone with a special technique, right?\"","Regarding Li Moying's injury, there were all kinds of rumours circulating outside. As a Spirit Medicine Master, Liu Buyan naturally has his own preliminary judgement.","But who knew, Huang Yueli shook her head resolutely.","\"No, what you said is completely wrong! The reason why Moying is like this is because evil qi invaded his body!\""]},{"number":3641,"title":"Chapter 3641 Where Is The Problem? (4)","paragraphs":["\"Evil... evil qi invaded his body??\" Liu Buyan's eyes widened, his face was full of disbelief.","\"Is this something he got from the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow? If evil qi really invades the dantian, then he will be in great trouble. Even if he doesn't die, he will go crazy!\"","Liu Buyan had already read several medical classics in the God Realm, and knowing the seriousness of the matter, his complexion became even more ugly.","\"This is really bad! It is said that there is no way to get rid of the evil qi now, it can be said that he is terminally ill! How can you cure him?\"","Huang Yueli hurriedly said: \"I found the inheritance \"Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual\" left by him in the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow. As long as he practices according to the exercises in the secret manual, he can turn these evil qis into his own use, when the time comes, Moying will not only be able to wake up, but also his cultivation will improve by leaps and bounds.\"","Hearing this, Liu Buyan's complexion improved slightly, but his brows were still tightly frowned, \"But, wouldn't Li Moying become an evil cultivator this way? In the God Realm, evil cultivators are an existence that everyone can't accept! They are like street rats! Ah! Li Moying now has a bright future as the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, if he becomes an evil cultivator...\"","\"What's wrong with becoming an evil cultivator?\" Huang Yueli smiled nonchalantly, seeing Liu Buyan's surprised face, continued to explain, \"As long as people don't see him as an evil cultivator, then there will be no influence at all! \"","Liu Buyan said: \"That's right, but how can you not see it? It is said that once a cultivator becomes an evil cultivator, his temperament will change drastically and he will become cruel and bloodthirsty! Moreover, the breath will also be significantly different from ordinary cultivators, and he will not be able to hide his identity at all.\"","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, and said: \"Then... Senior Brother, do you think there is something wrong with my breath?\"","\"Ah? You? You look normal...\" Liu Buyan was taken aback.","Huang Yueli asked again: \"Then do you think my temperament has changed?\"","\"You're just as good as when you were in the Lower Realm! I've never seen a cunning little fox with a black belly like you!\" Liu Buyan said firmly.","Huang Yueli shook her head with a smile, \"Then why do you have such a wrong understanding of evil cultivators?\"","\"Wrong...what?\" Liu Buyan looked at Huang Yueli's big bright eyes, and suddenly came to his senses, \"Wait, do you mean...you have become an evil cultivator? \"","Huang Yueli nodded slowly, \"That's right, when I was attacked by Huang Sanbai, it wasn't just Li Moying who was invaded by the evil qi, but me too! However, I got the inheritance of Saint Iniquitous Shadow later, and it has been resolved. The problem of the conflict of evil qi in the body.\"","Liu Buyan looked at her incredulously, and carefully looked at her several times from top to bottom, from left to right.","In the end, he shook his head, \"Impossible? This is too abnormal! You don't look like an evil cultivator at all! How did you do it?\"","Huang Yueli said: \"This is the magic of Saint Iniquitous Shadow's cultivation technique. Don't worry, even if he becomes an evil cultivator, Moying will still be safe. The only problem now is, how do we find a way to get in Amethyst Paramount Palace and save Moying.\"","As she said that, she turned her gaze to Liu Buyan's face, \"This time, we'll have to rely on you!\"","Hearing this, Liu Buyan's face suddenly collapsed, \"Rely on me? Are you sure? It's impossible for me to win the competition!\"","Occasionally missing content, please report errors in time."]},{"number":3642,"title":"Chapter 3642 Where Is The Problem? (5)","paragraphs":["\"Are you so unconfident?\" Huang Yueli frowned, \"This isn't like you? When you fought against Lu Dongfeng just now, you were very majestic!\"","Liu Buyan said with a bitter face: \"These are two different things! Lu Dongfeng is just a heaven-level Spirit Medicine Master who has just started, and it is not difficult to compete with him. However, all the Spirit Medicine Masters of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will compete, come on. It must be a famous doctor in the entire God Clan, how can I compare with them?\"","Huang Yueli also knew that what Liu Buyan said was indeed the truth.","Anyway, Liu Buyan has only just arrived in the God Realm. For a skill as advanced as the medicinal pill technique, no matter how talented he is, it still takes a certain amount of time and accumulation.","She thought for a while and said, \"Senior Brother, I understand your concerns, but you don't need to win against all the Spirit Medicine Masters, do you? You can go to treat Moying alone, as long as you get this quota, I will go in with you as an assistant, as long as you can hand over the \"Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual\" to Moying.\"","After hearing this, Liu Buyan's expression calmed down a little.","However, after pondering for a while, he shook his head, \"Even so... I'm not sure. After all, the difficulty of the third round of competition is equivalent to the assessment of a saint level Spirit Medicine Master. My standard is far behind! These gaps are really impossible to fill in such a short period of time.\"","After Liu Buyan finished speaking, he looked at Huang Yueli with a guilty face, \"Junior Sister, I really want to help, but I can't hold you back. How about this? I will accompany you to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda and you look for a suitable candidate...\"","Huang Yueli shook her head, \"You're not familiar with the place, so what kind of Spirit Medicine Master can you find... Wait! I just thought of someone!\"","Huang Yueli suddenly thought of Xia Yunxi, the wife of the Young Patriarch of the Veracious Wyvern Clan!","Her medical skills were very high. When Huang Yueli was fighting side by side with her, she had used her medicine several times to heal her wounds.","It's just that since the last time she parted ways with Xia Yunxi at Empyrean Fox Continent, she didn't know where Jun Sihan took her, let alone where to find someone.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli calmed down again.","\"No, it's too late to find her. Moreover, based on the relationship between Moying and Jun Sihan, if they knew that Moying was seriously injured, they might have visited him a long time ago...\"","Liu Buyan was confused when he heard it, and asked strangely: \"Junior Sister, who are you talking about?\"","Huang Yueli shook her head and said, \"You don't know her... Forget it, it's not realistic to find her. Let's discuss it, how can we promote you to the saint rank as soon as possible!\"","Liu Buyan originally wanted to ask more questions, but he didn't expect that Huang Yueli would make him choke on such a sentence, and was rendered speechless for a long time.","\"I...I say...Junior Sister...Didn't you hear what I said just now? I'm still far away from the saint level...This...you should find another Spirit Medicine Master...\"","\"I'm really worried about finding someone else. There are too many secrets involved in this matter. If any one reveals us, it will cause us great trouble! Only if you do it yourself, can I rest assured.\" Huang Yueli insisted.","Occasionally missing content, please report errors in time."]},{"number":3643,"title":"Chapter 3643 Where Is The Problem? (6)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan was still hesitant, \"That's right, but...\"","\"Alright, stop being so indecisive, what does it look like for a big man to be so indecisive?\" Huang Yueli waved her hand impatiently.","Liu Buyan coughed lightly twice, \"Junior Sister, you'd better think about it...\"","\"There's nothing else to think about!\" Huang Yueli suddenly slapped the table, stood up from her seat, and said aggressively, \"That's it! Time is running out, let's hurry up and discuss the next step!\"","\"The next step? What is the next step?\" Liu Buyan looked confused.","From his point of view, the goal set by Huang Yueli was completely impossible for them to achieve, so how can they come up with any plans?","Huang Yueli's expression was very serious, and she quickly took out the brush and paper from the space, and entered a work mode as she started bombarding him with questions.","\"Tell me first, why do you think you can't break through to the saint level? Are there any difficulties? Are there any bottlenecks?\"","Seeing how serious she was, Liu Buyan also knew that his Junior Sister was stubborn by nature and said nothing. No one could persuade him to change her mind. In desperation, he could only touch his nose and sit down again.","\"This... There are many factors that determine the level of a Spirit Medicine Master. The most important thing is of course the understanding of medicinal pills, followed by the talent of fire and wood. However, comprehension and talent alone are not enough. To have the ability to fuse medicinal materials together according to one's own ideas to form a medicinal pill, this requires the Spirit Medicine Master to have strong mental power, and to have a powerful enough flame to help. Finally, there is another factor, which seems unimportant , but what I lack the most is cultivation...\"","Liu Buyan smiled helplessly, \"I do have my own understanding of medicinal pills, but I dare not say that it can be compared with saint ranked Spirit Medicine Masters. The mental power is enough, but I learned from the Lower Realm. The strength of the deviant flame brought is very average, and it can be used to refine heaven-level medicinal pills, and the improvement of saint grade medicinal pills is very limited. As for the cultivation base, I am only at the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm, with such little strength, It is already a miracle to be able to refine a heavenly medicinal pill!\"","Huang Yueli frowned upon hearing this.","After listening to Liu Buyan's analysis, she became more aware of the seriousness of the problem.","To put it bluntly, there wasn't a big difference in the improvement of the strength of a Spirit Medicine Master and a Spiritual Armament Master.","Liu Buyan's ability to pass the inheritance test of the White Fen Clan shows that his talent in the wood element is very good. In terms of the fire element... Even if it is slightly inferior, Huang Yueli can still help him make up for it.","Even in terms of deviant flames, Huang Yueli has some of the most powerful ones in her hands.","However, the problem of cultivation was definitely a big problem!","Huang Yueli has been unable to enter the ranks of Sky Gem Grandmasters because of her limited cultivation. Liu Buyan's cultivation was far worse than hers. How easy was it to forcibly raise her rank?","Seeing Huang Yueli's brows tightened, Liu Buyan couldn't help but shook his head and said, \"Look, I just said that it is impossible for me to be promoted to the saint level! This competition ...we are doomed!\"","But who would have thought that after hearing this, Huang Yueli just rolled her eyes at him, and said in an annoyed tone: \"Who said we are destined to lose? You cursed yourself for losing before the competition even started?\"","Occasionally missing content, please report errors in time."]},{"number":3644,"title":"Chapter 3644 I Have A Way (1)","paragraphs":["3644 I Have A Way (1)","Liu Buyan was startled, and looked at Huang Yueli in surprise, “Junior Sister, what do you mean? Is there really a way for me to become a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master?”","Huang Yueli glanced at him, and slowly said: “For you to become a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master... of course it’s impossible!”","Hearing this, Liu Buyan’s face immediately collapsed, secretly thinking that his little Junior Sister had become a little unreliable now.","Since it’s impossible, why were they wasting their time here for half a day? Why not hurry up and go to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda to find suitable candidates?","!!","Huang Yueli said: “Although it is indeed difficult for you to become a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master now, maybe I have a way to greatly improve your medicinal pill skills, and even attract the attention of all the judges in the competition. Sometimes , you don’t have to be a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master to impress others with your medical skills.”","Liu Buyan couldn’t understand what she was saying at all, with a blank expression on his face, “Junior Sister, what do you mean...”","Huang Yueli opened her right hand, a cluster of crimson flames emerged from her palm, as soon as this flame appeared in the air, it became brighter and brighter... Soon, it became so bright that people couldn’t keep their eyes open.","Not only that, but the fire-attributed energy in the profound energy of heaven and earth seemed to be affected and became agitated.","Liu Buyan was so stimulated by the fire that he couldn’t open his eyes, but his voice couldn’t help trembling, “This... this flame! Could it be the legendary True Phoenix Flame!”","Regarding Huang Yueli’s possession of the Sky Phoenix Ring, even Liu Buyan was not very clear about it. Huang Yueli had only confessed this matter to Li Moying.","Therefore, Liu Buyan didn’t know that Huang Yueli actually had such a pure True Phoenix Flame in her hand.","Huang Yueli smiled, and said: “Senior Brother, didn’t you say that you don’t have a good kind of flame, which affects your performance when refining medicinal pills? Then if I give you the True Phoenix Flame, can it improve a bit?”","Liu Buyan was so excited that he was almost speechless!","“This... of course! True Phoenix Flame is known as the world’s number one kind of flame! I heard that even in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, not all geniuses can control it! Junior Sister, you are really too powerful , where did you get this from? You really deserve to be a god-level genius!”","Huang Yueli didn’t explain in detail, but just said: “I’m just lucky.”","Liu Buyan said: “However, it’s a pity. I heard that the ancient beasts in the God Realm are almost extinct, and no phoenix has appeared for a long time. As a result, the True Phoenix Flame can only be passed on from cultivator to cultivator. Each time it’s been passed on, the power of the flame will drop by one layer, and it is completely incomparable with the one obtained directly from the Phoenix! A flame as pure as yours, Junior Sister, is even rarer!”","Huang Yueli smiled, and said: “Senior Brother, you really have a good eye. The True Phoenix Flame in my hand is definitely the only one there ever is! However, you can get the purest one right away.”","“Junior Sister, do you really want to share this with me? In that case, the power of your own flame will be halved...” Liu Buyan hesitated, not wanting to implicate Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “No, I’m not giving you mine.”","As she spoke, she waved her right hand lightly, and the flame went out.","But after a breath, another flame lit up from behind her, and this time, the flame was countless times brighter than before!"]},{"number":3645,"title":"Chapter 3645 I Have A Way (2)","paragraphs":["3645 I Have A Way (2)","The strong energy fluctuations of the fire attribute made a strong man like Liu Buyan feel uncomfortable all over his body. The skin all over his body seemed to be burning, so hot that he could hardly breathe.","In this feeling of suffocation, he seemed to hear Huang Yueli’s scolding voice: “Enough, stop playing! This is my Senior Brother, you should respect him a bit! Put the flame away quickly, or you won’t be allowed to play for three days nor eat any chicken legs!”","“Alright, alright!” A slightly immature voice sounded, and the tone was very reluctant.","Immediately afterwards, the brightness of the firelight weakened significantly, and the scorching heat also subsided by quite a bit.","Although the whole room was still filled with fire energy, it was no longer so uncomfortable.","Liu Buyan immediately opened his eyes, wanting to see what happened just now and who Huang Yueli was talking to.","In the end, after just one glance, his whole body was petrified.","“This... this... this...” Liu Buyan pointed at Little Wang Cai, his wrist was trembling, his face was dull, and his jaw almost fell to the ground.","Little Wang Cai flapped his wings and floated in mid-air.","After Huang Yueli successfully absorbed the evil qi, Little Wang Cai fully replenished the energy he had spent fighting Huang Sanbai, and his strength seemed to have improved a bit.","At this time, it deliberately wanted to show itself in front of Liu Buyan, so it made itself a lot bigger.","A pair of incomparably gorgeous golden-red wings stretched three to four meters in length, and they all touched the walls on both sides of the room. His head were slightly raised upwards, with a dignified and elegant appearance.","Liu Buyan almost had a sudden cardiac arrest, and it took him a long time to regain his voice.","With a trembling voice, he said, “Junior Sister, are you just... is it the Divine Phoenix?? Really the Divine Phoenix??”","Before Huang Yueli could answer, Little Wang Cai had already gnashed his beak and said very dissatisfied: “What’s wrong with the Divine Phoenix? Knowing that I am a Divine Phoenix, you still dare to point your finger at me like this? Weren’t you taught that it is impolite for you to point at others like this?”","Huang Yueli glared at Little Wang Cai, “Alright, I just asked you to spread the fire, and I didn’t ask you to talk so much!”","Little Wang Cai said arrogantly: “My flame is so powerful, it’s not something anyone can get if they want it! Only when he can make me happy, I will consider it...”","“Really? Then think about it slowly! As for your chicken legs...” Huang Yueli folded her arms around her chest and said calmly.","When Little Phoenix heard this, he immediately lowered his head in embarrassment.","“Don’t, don’t, don’t...Female Devil, I’m wrong! I’m going to share the flame with Uncle!”","Huang Yueli twitched the corner of her mouth, “Uncle? What kind of nonsensical address is that? I’m not your mother?!”","However, before she had finished educating the brat, Liu Buyan exclaimed, “Junior Sister, this is really a Phoenix! A living Phoenix! It’s not my hallucination! You... Where did you get it? Here? Aren’t there no Phoenixes in the God Realm?”","Little Wang Cai pouted and was about to speak, but was stopped by Huang Yueli’s stern eyes.","Huang Yueli turned around and explained: “Senior Brother, don’t you know Little Wang Cai? You used to steal chicken legs for him so often!”","That’s right, Liu Buyan is one of the culprits of that spoiled brat, because seeing that Little Wang Cai was so cute and fluffy when he was a child, he couldn’t help thinking that he was so cute and kept sneaking him junk food!"]},{"number":3646,"title":"Chapter 3646 I Have A Way (3)","paragraphs":["3646 I Have A Way (3)","Liu Buyan’s eyeballs almost fell out, “This is... this is Little Wang Cai? But, isn’t Little Wang Cai a red bird?”","He looked at Huang Yueli blankly.","Huang Yueli laughed dryly, “Hehe, this... At that time in the Lower Realm, my strength was not enough, and I was worried that if I let others know that I had a Phoenix, it would cause trouble, so I told others that Wang Cai was a vermilion bird. In fact, he’s really a Phoenix.”","It was only then that Liu Buyan understood, but the surprise in his eyes still did not fade away.","He took a few steps forward and stretched out his hand, wanting to touch Little Wang Cai’s feathers.","However, before he could touch Little Phoenix’s body, the powerful fire-attributed energy had already made him a little unbearable, and he didn’t dare to approach him casually.","Huang Yueli explained from the side: “Actually, Little Wang Cai is just a spirit body, even if he appears in front of our eyes, he is actually an energy body formed by a ball of fire energy, and it feels fake to the touch. But as a Phoenix, even if he has become a spirit body, he still has a chance of nirvana. However, the method of Phoenix nirvana is probably only available to the Sacred Phoenix Clan. I can’t go back to my clan now, and I don’t know when I can do it.”","Liu Buyan finally calmed down at this moment.","After listening to Huang Yueli’s narration, he couldn’t help showing a smile on his face, “I see, it seems that I underestimated Little Wang Cai too much.”","Hearing this, Little Wang Cai raised his head arrogantly, “Now you know how great this little lord is, eh? Tch, if it weren’t for the fact that you stole chicken legs for me several times, I wouldn’t help you, hmph!”","Liu Buyan’s face froze.","Before Little Wang Cai realized what he said wrong, Huang Yueli’s cold snort came from behind it, “Alright, so you two are accomplices! I’ll just say, you were locked up before. Alright, why were there still less chicken legs! So that’s how it is!”","Liu Buyan could only put a smile on his face, “Junior Sister, it’s all my fault, so don’t blame it on the little child.”","“Little child? This brat is so courageous! He will be more presumptuous without education!” Huang Yueli put on a serious face.","Liu Buyan quickly changed the subject, “Ahem, alas, this... Where did we just talk about? Didn’t we say that you would give me the True Phoenix Flame? Then hurry up! The competition between the Cloudy Qilin Clan is happening in a few days, I need to hurry up and get familiar with it!”","Huang Yueli naturally knew that Liu Buyan was talking about.","However, what he said was very reasonable. They really didn’t have much time to waste on educating kids now.","Huang Yueli glanced at them, seeing that both of them bowed their heads guiltily, she then said: “Alright, Little Wang Cai, hurry up and give the flame to Senior Brother, I’ll add chicken legs to you tonight!”","Hearing this, one person and one Phoenix breathed a sigh of relief at the same time.","Little Wang Cai made his body smaller and flew to Liu Buyan’s side.","Liu Buyan turned his head and looked at it, “What should I do?”","Little Wang Cai said: “Just show me your palm.”","Liu Buyan immediately followed his instructions and stretched out his hand with his palm facing up.","Little Phoenix took a deep breath, and then exhaled suddenly.","A ball of dazzling flame flew to Liu Buyan’s palm.","The moment it came into contact with the skin, Liu Buyan couldn’t help but gasp!"]},{"number":3647,"title":"Chapter 3647 I Have A Way (4)","paragraphs":["3647 I Have A Way (4)","Even though he had made some preparations, he still couldn’t bear the power of the True Phoenix Flame.","Because Little Wang Cai was grateful to him for speaking for him just now, it was rare and generous to share a part of the purest natal real flame in his body.","Phoenix’s natal true plame was very rare. It is also the True Phoenix Flame, and its power can be divided into big and small. This is the most powerful one!","Even Huang Yueli, in the past, used all kinds of scheming and deceit to get it from Little Phoenix.","!!","It was rare for Little Wang Cai to be generous, but to Liu Buyan, it was not only a good thing, but also a huge pressure!","Because, the higher the level of deviant flame, the more difficult it was to absorb.","When Huang Yueli absorbed True Phoenix Flame before, Little Wang Cai said that even in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, there were not many cultivators who could successfully control the True Phoenix Flame, not to mention that Liu Buyan main cultivation was in the wood attribute.","However, it was too late to say all of this now.","The True Phoenix Flame spewed out by Little Wang Cai had already fallen onto Liu Buyan’s palm and was rapidly penetrating into his body.","Liu Buyan waited in trepidation, and quickly circulated the profound power in his body, trying to bring the best of this deviant flame into his dantian.","However, he was obviously unable to do what he wanted.","In just a few breaths, Liu Buyan’s face flushed red, and the sweat dripped down from his forehead one by one, leaving a small puddle on the ground very quickly.","Huang Yueli’s expression changed slightly, she rushed over immediately and stood behind Liu Buyan, and reached out and put her hand on his back.","Fortunately, Liu Buyan didn’t have any defences against her, so she was able to easily penetrate into his meridians.","Huang Yueli tested the situation in Liu Buyan’s body, as expected, such a powerful fire attribute energy was not something Liu Buyan could easily bear, his meridians were not strong enough, and the exercises used to transform the fire attribute energy were not enough. Not good.","Huang Yueli tried to help Liu Buyan stabilise the profound energy in her body, but the effect was not very good.","She herself was sweating all over, but Liu Buyan’s face became more and more purple.","Going on like this... was not an option!","Huang Yueli frowned, and realised that she was a little overbearing. Before she had time to explain clearly to Little Wang Cai and Liu Buyan, they had already initiated the process of transferring the fire by themselves.","She originally thought that with Little Wang Cai’s usually stingy personality, it would be nice to be able to give some of the most ordinary True Phoenix Flame, but who knew, she didn’t know what medicine he took wrongly today, and suddenly became so generous!","Even the natal true flame was brought out!","She thought for a while, leaned closer to Liu Buyan’s ear, and said, “Senior Brother, the fire that Little Wang Cai gave you is too powerful. Even if I protect you, it is an external force after all, and the effect is very limited. The best way is to learn to control these energies by yourself... Next, I will teach you a set of skills, and you should do it accordingly...”","As Huang Yueli spoke, she quickly recited a set of formulas.","This set of skills was found in the collection of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow. It can be said to be a first-class fire attribute skill. It was not an easy task to learn it completely.","However, Huang Yueli had already read it once, and when she recounted it, she made some simplifications based on her own understanding as she helped Liu Buyan control the flow of fire attribute energy in his body, and the difficulty of cultivation also dropped significantly."]},{"number":3648,"title":"Chapter 3648 I Have A Way (5)","paragraphs":["3648 I Have A Way (5)","But even so, it took Liu Buyan a long time to barely learn a part.","On the contrary, Huang Yueli gradually figured out some tricks during this period of time.","She already has the True Phoenix Flame in her body, and after several years of refinement, she has been able to use it very freely. These flames were just able to complement the disorderly True Phoenix Flame in Liu Buyan’s body.","With the help of this factor, Huang Yueli helped Liu Buyan guide the fire attribute energy in his body.","!!","Eventually, Liu Buyan’s expression returned to normal.","He exhaled a long breath, “My goodness! It turns out that absorbing the True Phoenix Flame is such a dangerous thing! No wonder it is called the number one deviant flame in the world!”","Huang Yueli said with some guilt: “Senior Brother, it’s all my fault for not reminding you, I was negligent. Are you feeling alright?”","When Liu Buyan heard her words, he closed his eyes slightly, and felt the flow of profound energy in his body. When he opened his eyes again, his eyes were full of joy.","“Good! I feel good! It can’t be better! Junior Sister, what kind of skill did you teach me? Why is it so powerful? To be honest, I also spent a lot of effort in practicing fire attribute exercises in order to improve the medicinal pill technique. However, the effect has not been very good! However, today, my cultivation base in the fire attribute has improved by a big step!”","Huang Yueli nodded in satisfaction, and said: “This is a skill I got in the abode of Saint Iniquitous Shadow. I just recounted part of it temporarily. You can take the whole manual. If you can practise it with success, your strength can definitely be greatly improved!”","Liu Buyan took the manual from her, was surprised and delighted, and thanked her repeatedly.","“Junior Sister, you are really amazing! You have only been in the God Realm for more than half a year, and you have already obtained so many treasures.”","Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth with a proud expression, “Of course, I cultivate together with my husband! Of course I’m much stronger than you alone!”","The desperation in her words was too obvious.","Liu Buyan immediately covered his chest, feeling as if he had been shot in the heart by an arrow!","Even on such an occasion, she can still show off their deep affection!","However, Huang Yueli didn’t pay attention to his expression, and continued on her own, “You were able to subdue True Phoenix Flame with the help of external force, so it might be a little difficult to control, and you need to work hard during this period of time. Only by cultivating in earnest can we ensure a stable performance on the day of the competition.”","When it came to business, Liu Buyan’s expression immediately became serious.","He nodded cautiously, “Junior Sister, don’t worry, I will definitely not slack off. It’s just...”","As he spoke, he showed a look of embarrassment again, “It’s just that the True Phoenix Flame alone can increase my strength by half a level at most, and I’m afraid it’s not enough to compete with a real saint level Spirit Medicine Master! ”","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “Actually, I have another idea, but I don’t know how effective it will be.”","“Another idea? What idea?” Liu Buyan was taken aback.","Huang Yueli said: “Senior Brother, on the way here, did you hear that a Spiritual Armament Master in Sky Gem Glass Chamber created a new method of refining weapons, which increased the power of all standard Spirit Armaments by several percent?”","Liu Buyan was startled again, “This... I seem to have heard about it, but, this and I...”","Having said that, he suddenly paused."]},{"number":3649,"title":"Chapter 3649 I Have A Way (6)","paragraphs":["3649 I Have A Way (6)","Liu Buyan thought of something, turned his head, widened his eyes, and looked at Huang Yueli in disbelief.","“Junior Sister, wait! That... that Spiritual Armament Master who created the new refining technique, don’t... don’t tell me that it’s you?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, “Why not?”","Liu Buyan almost screamed. Looking at her, it was like looking at a monster!","!!","“What?? Is it really you? How could it be you?? Well, I admit that you are indeed an unworldly genius forging armaments in our Soaring Heavens Continent, but the method of refining Spirit Armaments in the God Realm should not be similar to that of our Lower Realm and the difference should be huge! How could you have fully mastered it in such a short period of time?”","Huang Yueli had an innocent expression on her face, “Senior Brother, you are quite right. The Spirit Armament refining technique in the God Realm is completely different from the Lower Realm, so I really can’t master it. Therefore, I can only follow my own way of thinking and think up a new set of refining techniques...”","“You...you...” Liu Buyan was so overwhelmed by these words that he was speechless for a long time.","Although this matter was really incredible.","However, what Huang Yueli said was so reasonable that he didn’t know how to speak.","If you can’t master it, just think of another way!","Very good, very powerful!","It’s just...it’s just a tad bit too powerful!","Seeing that he couldn’t recover for a long time, Huang Yueli could only pat him on the shoulder and said, “Senior Brother, don’t make such a fuss, let’s get down to business!”","“Alright, alright, let’s get down to business...” Liu Buyan nodded mechanically.","However, looking at the sluggish expression on his face, it’s obvious that his mind hadn’t fully recovered yet!","Huang Yueli shook her head secretly, and continued, “The main difference between the Spirit Armament technique in the God Realm and the Lower Realm lies in the construction of the force field in the Spirit Armament. Only by using the force field to guide the circulation of the profound energy of the world can the Spirit Armament be brought into full play and maximise the effectiveness. Well, my transformation is also based on this premise.”","Liu Buyan looked at her without interrupting her.","Huang Yueli went on to say: “Just now when you were contesting with Lu Dongfeng in alchemy, I observed carefully from the sidelines, and the technique of your medicinal pill seems to be similar. After the medicinal materials are completely refined, you need to fuse the pill. Build a new force field in it to let the medicine effect play out, right?”","Liu Buyan pondered for a while, then nodded slightly, “It’s understandable, but it’s a little different from what you said.”","“Oh? What’s different?”","“In order to bring out the potency of medicinal materials, you really need to rely on a certain structure. However, it is not a force field, but through pill patterns. These pill patterns are not just on the surface of the pill, in fact, the inside of the pill is also covered with pill patterns. , it’s just that ordinary people don’t know how to pinch the medicinal pill to see it.”","After Huang Yueli heard this, she thought for a while, “This... feels pretty much the same! Why don’t you watch me try refining some Spirit Armaments, maybe my technique can also be of reference value to you?”","Liu Buyan nodded, “Then I’ll have to ask my Junior Sister to enlighten me!”","When it comes to refining weapons, that was Huang Yueli’s old profession.","She was very proficient now, and quickly set up the refining furnace, casually took out a box of low-level materials from her space, lit it up and started to refine.","While refining, she did not forget to give some explanations to Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan was stunned by her smooth movements at first, but soon put away any distracting thoughts and began to observe seriously."]},{"number":3650,"title":"Chapter 3650 I Have A Way (7)","paragraphs":["3650 I Have A Way (7)","Huang Yueli deliberately slowed down her movements, but in order not to affect the effect of refining the spirit armament, there was a limit to how much she could slow down.","After only a quarter of an hour or so, Huang Yueli stopped.","A low-grade standard Spirit Armament had been refined, and it was lying quietly at the bottom of the furnace.","However, both of them didn’t even look at the Spirit Armament. Huang Yueli immediately turned to Liu Buyan and asked, “Senior Brother, how is it? Did you see clearly what I did just now? Did you gain anything?”","Liu Buyan frowned and pondered, “I probably understand a little bit... The way you build the force field is very special. It is completely through the induction of the energy flow inside the refining material and timely adjustment to achieve such an effect, right?”","“Yes, you’re right!” Huang Yueli nodded repeatedly, and a look of surprise flashed in her eyes.","Her movements were completely unfamiliar to people in the God Realm, and her movements were too fast to a certain extent. When it was demonstrated at the Allied Armies branch, several Sky Gem Masters couldn’t keep up with her rhythm , until she demonstrated it seven or eight times before they could barely understand it.","However, Liu Buyan has grasped the crux of the problem in such a short period of time.","He was not even a Spiritual Armament Master!","Even the Spirit Medicine Masters use flames to refine pills, but there was still a big difference between the two.","Liu Buyan thought for a while, and then said: “I still don’t understand some things, please show me again, Junior Sister, that is the part where you did thirteen hand gestures in succession and when you heated it up for the second time, and also...”","Liu Buyan pointed out several places, and as he asked questions, Huang Yueli’s eyes became brighter and brighter.","What Liu didn’t say was that it was the most essential part of her technique, and it was also the part that was the most different from the Spirit Armament techniques of the God Realm!","It can be seen from this that Liu Buyan’s comprehension was really good!","That’s good, it seems that they still stood a good chance to win in the competition!","“Senior Brother, in fact, at all these junctures, I actually made a change to the profound energy. First, I constructed a small force field through hand gestures, and then imbued it into the material and spliced it together. You can watch me do it again.”","Huang Yueli casually threw the Spirit Armament that was just refined on the ground.","When the Spirit Armament landed on the ground, there was a crisp bang!","If people from the military department saw this scene, they would definitely tremble in their hearts.","This was an improved version of the Spirit Armament that all the soldiers of the entire Allied Armies dreamed of. It was refined by Grandmaster Li himself! It was worth tens of thousands of jade quartz! Yet it was simply thrown on the ground like garbage!","Huang Yueli took out another batch of materials, re-ignited the fire, and started refining again.","This time, her movements were even faster than last time.","Moreover, no further effort was needed to explain.","Liu Buyan’s eyes widened and he concentrated all the time, carefully observing every movement of Huang Yueli. At the same time, he released his consciousness to feel the energy changes in the furnace.","Huang Yueli didn’t slow down, and went all out to make the refining process of this Spirit Armament more perfect.","Liu Buyan concentrated on each and every movement of hers.","This time, within a quarter of an hour, Huang Yueli finished refining.","“Alright, how much does Senior Brother understand now?”","Liu Buyan pondered and said: “I still have something I don’t understand, but I already understand everything that should be understood. This is really revolutionary!”"]},{"number":3651,"title":"Chapter 3651 I Have A Way (8)","paragraphs":["3651 I Have A Way (8)","“If it can be combined into the medicinal pill technique, it will definitely greatly increase the efficacy of the medicinal pill! This is an improvement for the entire medicinal pill technique! It’s just...”","Speaking of this, Liu Buyan’s voice softened a little, and he seemed a little hesitant, “However, I still have to think carefully about how to apply this technique to the medicinal pill technique...”","Huang Yueli nodded, and said again: “I still have the standard Spirit Armament illustrations that I drew before, which also records the new refining methods of dozens of Spirit Armaments that I improved. Among them, the key points of the force field construction has all been marked. Senior Brother, take it and have a look, maybe it will be useful.”","Liu Buyan’s eyes lit up, “That’s great! This is really great! Junior Sister, thank you! You are such an amazing genius!”","!!","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, “We’re all family, so what’s with the thank you? Helping you is also helping myself!”","With that said, she took out a thick stack of illustrations from the space.","Liu Buyan couldn’t wait to snatch it away. He lowered his head and quickly flipped through a few pages. The light in his eyes became brighter and brighter!","He walked to the edge of the desk, sat down and began to fervently read. At the same time, he continued to write and draw on the plain paper beside him, while muttering to himself.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli didn’t dare to disturb him too much, so she sat aside by herself, picked up a few classics of medicinal pill techniques on the table, and flipped through them.","From that day on, the two of them entered the stage of desperately researching medicinal pill techniques.","Liu Buyan was fascinated by Huang Yueli’s illustrations, and he admired his little Junior Sister more and more!","A genius, she was simply a marvel!","In the past, he always felt that his talent was already high enough, and even if others were higher than him, they would not be much higher.","However, after he got to know Huang Yueli, he realised what a real peerless genius was. Each time he thought that shat was her limit, she still had the ability to go one step further, shocking him endlessly!","Huang Yueli could even think of such a trick!","What exactly was in her brain?","Liu Buyan carefully delved into this new world of knowledge. If there was anything he didn’t understand, he asked Huang Yueli beside him.","Three days later, in fact, he still had a lot of doubts in his mind, and he planned to continue his research, but time was no longer allowed.","In order to catch up with the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s medicinal pill competition, he could only choose to shift direction and first study how to use new techniques to refine the medicinal pill.","“Oh, it’s not good! It’s... going to explode! Junior Sister, get out of the way!”","“Damn it! No, it’s still wrong this time!”","“Ah, it’s over, it’s over! This furnace of medicinal materials is ruined again!”","In the next few days, in the room where Liu Buyan lived, such exclamations could be heard from time to time, mixed with the intermittent explosions.","The owner and guests of the inn had noticed this a long time ago, and knocked on the door several times, intending to drive Liu Buyan out.","However, Liu Buyan was an earth-level Spirit Medicine Master registered with the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, out of awe of this noble profession, the innkeeper still dared not drive them away directly, so he could only transfer them to a secluded hut in the backyard of the inn.","The furnishing of this hut is very dilapidated, completely incomparable to the upper room where Liu Buyan lived, but it was quieter than anyone else, and there was no need to worry about affecting others.","Therefore, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan began to study with more confidence.","To achieve a breakthrough in such a short period of time, Liu Buyan was desperate."]},{"number":3652,"title":"Chapter 3652 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (1)","paragraphs":["3652 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (1)","For several days in a row, he hardly closed his eyes, and his bloodshot eyes were glaringly bright. If he walked on the street, he would probably scare a child to death.","Huang Yueli couldn’t stand it anymore, and persuaded him: “Senior Brother, you can’t do it like this, you should rest first! Otherwise, let’s forget about trying a new medicinal pill technique to save Moying, I’m afraid you will fall here yourself .”","Liu Buyan was still staring at the pill furnace, didn’t bother to look back at her at all, just waved his hand casually, “Alright, Junior Sister, I know my own body, but I haven’t slept for a few days. I have done it before for more than ten days, aren’t I still kicking and alive!”","“But...” Huang Yueli frowned.","“Alright, Junior Sister, stop talking, the critical moment is coming! I think it will definitely work this time!...Ah, that’s great! It’s really done!”","Liu Buyan exclaimed excitedly!","When Huang Yueli heard the sound, she ran over in a hurry, and stood alone with Liu Buyan, looking towards the bottom of the alchemy furnace.","In the furnace, five round pills lay quietly.","“There are only five pills in one furnace... It’s really a little less.” Liu Buyan rubbed his chin, feeling a little regretful, “I can usually refine more than a dozen pills in one furnace for this kind of pills! How’s the effect?”","As he spoke, he took out the medicinal pill, put it on the table, crushed it with his hands, picked out a little and put it in his mouth to taste.","Huang Yueli leaned over nervously, and asked, “How is it? How is it? Brother, how do you feel?”","Liu Buyan frowned first, his eyes were deep, as if he was thinking about something, and after Huang Yueli urged him a few times, he burst out laughing.","“Hahaha, really! This Divine Doctor is really too powerful. He actually got inspiration from the Spirit Armament technique and learned a new technique of alchemy! This medicinal pill... although it is heaven grade, but in terms of its efficacy, it is beyond average. Even saint grade pills are incomparable! I really succeeded!”","Liu Buyan was overjoyed.","Huang Yueli jumped up in excitement!","She was sincerely happy for Liu Buyan to have made such a new discovery.","Of course, what’s more important is that Liu Buyan’s medicinal pill skills have improved so much, the possibility of him winning the competition will be several times higher!","She can follow Liu Buyan to meet Li Moying soon!","Only Heaven knows she had been worrying about Li Moying for more than a month, and finally saw some hope!","After the first success, the second and third successes became a matter of course.","Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan found the right direction and researched several improved prescriptions of heavenly medicinal pills.","Very soon, it was the day of the Cloudy Qilin Clan Spirit Medicine Master Competition.","“It’s a pity. If we had an extra month, we would be able to study most of the heaven grade pills. Now we have only completed five or six new prescriptions. I’m afraid it might not be enough.”","When going out, Liu Buyan was still worried.","Huang Yueli said seriously: “There is no other way now. The important thing is, Senior Brother, you must have confidence in yourself! With your current medicinal pill skills, even if you can’t compare with a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master, you will definitely be able to attract the attention of Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Patriarch, it all depends on how you behave!”","Liu Buyan came to his senses and nodded again and again, “Don’t worry, Junior Sister, I know the seriousness of the matter.”","This time, the Spirit Medicine Master competition will take place in a large square in front of Amethyst Paramount Palace."]},{"number":3653,"title":"Chapter 3653 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (2)","paragraphs":["3653 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (2)","When the two arrived, the venue was already full of people.","Not only were there many contestants wearing the robes showing off their identities as Spirit Medicine Masters, but there were also countless ordinary cultivators.","“Why are there so many people here? Are there so many people in Arcane City?” Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan were almost scattered by the crowd, and couldn’t help but complain.","A cultivator nearby heard this and explained, “Not all people here are from Arcane City! Although this place is only outside the Amethyst Paramount Palace, it has never been open to ordinary people! Many people came here from other cities, not only to see so many Spirit Medicine Masters compete, but also want to see the legendary Amethyst Paramount Palace up close!”","!!","Huang Yueli was enlightened as she looked up at the majestic building in front of her.","The outer walls of the entire Amethyst Paramount Palace were inlaid with dark purple glazed tiles. Under the sunlight, they reflect a purple-gold light, making them look extremely solemn and majestic.","From their current position, they could also see from a distance that there were several very tall lightning-attracting towers inside the Amethyst Paramount Palace, as if they were inserted directly into the clouds, and the tops of these could not be seen even if they looked up.","Huang Yueli vaguely remembered that this should be the Lightning Induction Tower of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Li Moying once told her before that the Cloudy Qilin Clan built such a tower to attract Heavenly Thunder, and then used the thunder attribute energy in it to build many trial places for the disciples of the clan to practice.","Just as she was thinking about it, the steward of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was already urging the Spiritual Armament Masters who participated in the competition to report.","Liu Buyan looked back at her, “Junior Sister, then I’ll go there, you...”","Huang Yueli said: “Wasn’t it stated that other than the contestants, no one else can enter? I’ll just watch you compete here. Don’t worry, I won’t suffer any losses, I’ll be fine!”","Liu Buyan also knew that his Junior Sister was so powerful that no one could bully her.","After thinking for a while, he nodded and squeezed towards the reporting place.","Huang Yueli climbed up to a higher ground nearby, found a place with a better view and sat down, waiting for the competition to start.","After another half an hour, the stewards finished counting the number of people.","At this moment, bursts of commotion suddenly sounded in the venue, and all the audience stood up and rushed to look in the direction of Amethyst Paramount Palace.","Huang Yueli took a look, and found that the main entrance of Amethyst Paramount Palace was opened, and a small group of people came out from inside, and sat in the private seats specially set aside in the centre of the venue with the best view.","“These are all the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! They are all masters of the Dao Profound Realm! It’s too powerful. This is the first time I’ve seen so many Dao Profound Realm cultivators appearing at the same time!”","“Look! Look! That’s Li Shihong, the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! He actually came out in person!”","“Of course, the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan is unconscious. He must be the most anxious. Of course he has to come and watch in person!”","“Ah, seeing so many great people, we really came at the right time this time! I hope that there will be surprises in the Spirit Medicine Master competition!”","Li Shihong stood up, raised his hand, and the venue suddenly fell silent.","He didn’t pay attention to the tens of thousands of onlookers at all, but just scanned all the participating Spirit Medicine Masters, and then sighed, “I don’t have anything else to say. With real skills, as long as Moying’s illness can be cured, the Cloudy Qilin Clan will not treat you badly, no matter what requests you have, we can satisfy them!”"]},{"number":3654,"title":"Chapter 3654 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (3)","paragraphs":["3654 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (3)","After saying this, Li Shihong was not in the mood to say anything else, and turned to look at Li Yunhai beside him, “Yunhai, today’s competition will be hosted by you!”","Li Yunhai stood up, bowed his hands to Li Shihong and saluted, then turned to the audience.","“A total of 1,051 Spirit Medicine Masters signed up for the competition this time! I hope that the number of people who pass the three rounds of competitions will exceed ten!”","When Huang Yueli heard this number in the audience, her heart shuddered.","!!","More than a thousand people!","This number of people can be said to be quite astonishing!","When she was in Medial Arch City, she asked Grandmaster Xiao to help organize a Spirit Armament Competition. At that time, there were only about fifty Spiritual Armament Masters who came to participate in the competition, and their skills were quite good.","This time, more than a thousand people actually came!","Of course, in the regulations of the competition of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, there were no high requirements for the qualifications of the contestants, which was part of the reason for the large number of contestants.","However, the more important reason should be the appeal of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Li Moying.","As the most popular ancient God Clan in the God Realm, the target to be treated is the “only” god-level genius in the God Realm. Any Spirit Medicine Master with some skills will be moved by this, because this was the best time to become famous!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli turned her gaze to the centre of the competition venue, searching for Liu Buyan’s figure.","She hopes that her Senior Brother will not be too nervous and can perform more stably, so that he can stand out in the fierce competition.","Liu Buyan was tall and handsome, and he stood out among a group of relatively weak Spirit Medicine Masters.","Huang Yueli found him easily, but immediately after, her brows frowned.","“...What’s going on? Senior Brother seems to have gotten into a fight with someone? It’s such a crucial time, why is there still someone fighting here?”","Huang Yue was extremely speechless in her heart.","Although Liu Buyan looks a little frivolous at ordinary times, he was more reliable at critical moments, not like someone who quarrels with others before the competition.","What exactly is going on?","Huang Yueli was not the only one who noticed this.","The steward of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, who was in charge of maintaining the order of the competition, had seen the chaos in the venue earlier than she did, and had already walked in the direction of Liu Buyan.","“You guys! What are you arguing about? The competition is about to start, why don’t you hurry back to your seats!”","Liu Buyan shrugged, turned around and left without saying a word.","However, the old man who had a dispute with him snorted coldly behind his back, “Stinky boy, stop! Did this elder allow you to leave? You deliberately plotted against my son Lu Dongfeng, not only using despicable means to make him lose in the Pill Competition and cheated him of such a large sum of money! There is a scum like you among our Spirit Medicine Masters!”","Liu Buyan stopped abruptly, turned his head to look at the old man behind him, and there was a deep coldness in his black eyes.","“So you are Lu Dongfeng’s father! Elder Lu, the legendary Number One Divine Doctor in Arcane City? I finally know what it means ‘like father like son’ !”","Elder Lu was startled, he couldn’t understand what he said, and thought he was praising him when he said “the number one Divine Doctor”.","He glared at Liu Buyan viciously, “Brat, stop daydreaming there! Do you think that if you say a few nice words, I will let a scum like you go? Let me tell you, it’s impossible!”"]},{"number":3655,"title":"Chapter 3655 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (4)","paragraphs":["3655 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (4)","Hearing this, Liu Buyan couldn’t help laughing out loud.","“Hahahaha...Old man with the surname Lu, do you not understand human language? I want to tell you that you are as arrogant and self-righteous as your son, but your brain is really bad, not only your medical skills are terrible, what’s more, you can’t even understand other people’s sarcasm, thinking that you were praised?! With your appearance, I want to see what you can do to me!”","Liu Buyan let out a cold snort, and a power emanated from his body naturally.","Although his current cultivation base was not very high, even far inferior to Elder Lu in front of him, but after all, he was still a genius who has quite a bit of experience in the cultivation world, compared with a Spirit Medicine Master who had never killed anyone before, his threats did invoke some fear.","“That’s enough, stop arguing and go back to your seats!”","The steward tried to persuade them several times, using both soft and hard tactics, but the two of them quarrelled more and more, and they had no intention of being obedient at all.","Liu Buyan even spread his arms, “My lord, you’ve seen it too, I don’t want to quarrel, but this old man pointed at me and called me a scum among Spirit Medicine Masters. Are you happy to scold me?”","“What’s wrong with me scolding you? A brat like you is simply scum! You only use insidious and dirty methods to cheat!”","The arguing between the two attracted the attention of Li Yunhai and the other elders.","Li Yunhai frowned, and signalled a disciple to take care of it.","The young cultivator nodded and walked over.","When he got closer, he suddenly recognized Elder Lu, and said with some surprise: “Elder Lu, it’s you? You have the best temper on weekdays, why would you quarrel with others? The competition is about to start, why don’t you calm down, what’s the matter, let’s talk about it after the competition is over.”","After all, Elder Lu was the elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda of Arcane City, and he was considered a famous figure in Arcane City.","Although his medical skills and reputation was not enough to attract the attention of the top in Cloudy Qilin Clan, he still pays attention to currying favor with the younger generation of the Cloudy Qilin Clan on weekdays.","This disciple, Li Qianyue, was also a heaven-level genius, and he was quite famous among the younger generation of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Elder Lu has some friendship with him.","When Elder Lu saw that an acquaintance had arrived, he immediately lifted his spirits!","He glanced at Liu Buyan provocatively, “Brat, you are dead!”","Liu Buyan naturally understood what Elder Lu meant. He felt that his backer had arrived!","However, Liu Buyan just glanced at the young disciple lightly, without showing any panic.","Elder Lu pointed at Liu Buyan’s nose, and began to complain loudly, “Young Master Qianyue, this old man stood up not for himself, but for the Cloudy Qilin Clan! You don’t know, this person is a scum in the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, who is used to using despicable and shameless means to engage in a Pill Competition, and has deceived many Spirit Medicine Masters. With people like him mixed in the competition, there is no guarantee that something will happen later! Just in case, please get this scum out!”","When Li Qianyue heard this, he was taken aback for a moment, never expecting such a thing to happen.","There was hesitation on his face, “This...Elder Lu, this is not good, is it?”","Elder Lu said: “Young Master Qianyue, don’t you believe me anymore? This old man can never be wrong! You can’t let this kind of scum stay to participate in the competition!”"]},{"number":3656,"title":"Chapter 3656 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (5)","paragraphs":["3656 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (5)","Seeing that he was trembling with anger, Li Qianyue hurriedly comforted him and said, “Elder Lu, of course I believe what you say. Since you say that this person has bad character, then he must not be a good person. If it was another occasion, I would not hesitate to kick him out but today...”","He turned his head and hurriedly glanced at Li Shihong and the others on the high platform, and said in a low voice, “Elder Lu, even our Patriarch came out in person on such a big occasion today, so nothing can happen!”","Seeing his hesitation, Elder Lu felt angry, but he still had a bit of reason, knowing that he couldn’t get angry at the talented cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","However, it is impossible for him to be willing to let him leave it like this.","!!","Ever since he heard that his son was slapped in the face by an unknown Spirit Medicine Master ten days ago and owed sky-high debts, he has been looking for the culprit.","Elder Lu didn’t believe that someone could crush his son like this in this field. In addition, Lu Dongfeng poured dirty water on Liu Buyan desperately in order to clear his name, and said all kinds of ugly things, which made Elder Lu believe Liu Buyan was a scumbag with despicable methods.","He searched for so long, but he couldn’t find anyone.","I finally met him today, and immediately relied on his status as a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master, wanting to call him out and seek “justice” for Lu Dongfeng.","Who would have thought that Liu Buyan’s words were so sharp, not only was he not frightened by his identity, but he was speechless after a few words, and he almost vomited blood on the spot!","New enmity on top of the old enmity.","Want him to let it go? Let Liu Buyan go to the competition with peace of mind?","Elder Lu glared at Liu Buyan angrily, and suddenly thought of a solution, so he said loudly: “Young Master Qianyue, I understand your concerns, this villain cannot be done by your Cloudy Qilin Clan, so let the old man do it! Because the elders of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda of Arcane City have the right to deprive the qualifications of Spirit Medicine Masters! I will declare this kid’s earth-rank Spirit Medicine Master badge invalid!”","“Elder Lu actually deprived that kid of his qualifications as a Spirit Medicine Master!”","“Oh my Gosh! This matter has become a big deal! How did this kid offend Elder Lu?”","“Ahem, I seem to know that ten days ago, at the Heaven Elixir Pagoda...”","When Elder Lu was arguing with Liu Buyan, neither of them was a low-key person, and they didn’t control the volume at all.","The audience who were far away couldn’t hear their conversation and didn’t know what was going on, but the Spirit Medicine Masters who were closer could hear their conversation.","Many people were stunned by this scene, and asked people around them one after another.","And Liu Buyan fought with Lu Dongfeng in front of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, and slapped the latter severely in the face. This incident has long been spread in Arcane City.","So, someone immediately described the situation at that time vividly.","Those who knew the truth a long time ago looked at Liu Buyan with great sympathy, and couldn’t help feeling sorry for him.","Liu Buyan’s ability to beat Lu Dongfeng in the Pill Competition shows that he has at least the strength of a heaven-level Spirit Medicine Master, and it is no problem to pass two rounds of competition today.","For a young Spirit Medicine Master like him, passing two rounds of competition was already an honor.","But now, he offended the elder because he won against Lu Dongfeng in the Pill Competition!","He would be deprived of the qualifications of a Spirit Medicine Master!"]},{"number":3657,"title":"Chapter 3657 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (6)","paragraphs":["3657 What Is This Kid Doing Here? (6)","Elder Lu was the Elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda in Arcane City, and only the Spirit Medicine Masters in Arcane City can govern it.","However, Liu Buyan had just ascended not long ago, and had never been qualified to register as a Spirit Medicine Master in the God Realm before. Even his medicinal pill technique was learned along the way over the past six months.","After arriving in Arcane City, he just registered, mainly to avoid any qualification problems when he signed up for today’s competition.","Who would have thought that in this way, he would actually put himself in the palm of Elder Lu!","!!","Elder Lu looked at Liu Buyan proudly, and said in a gloomy tone: “Hmph, for a brat who’s still young, dare to fight with this Divine Doctor? Now you know who you can’t afford to offend, right?”","Elder Lu turned to Li Qianyue, “Young Master Qianyue, this kid was not even a Spirit Medicine Master anymore, so of course he was not qualified to participate in the competition! Let him get out!”","Li Qianyue frowned and didn’t speak, as if he was weighing things up.","Seeing that he was still hesitating, Elder Lu became anxious, “Young Master Qianyue, what are you hesitating about? An ordinary cultivator without the qualifications of a Spirit Medicine Master, so what if he knows medical skills? A cultivator who has not been recognized by the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, it’s obviously dishonourable and bad conduct..”","“Heh, Elder Lu, please be careful with your words!” Liu Buyan’s voice sounded calmly beside him.","“Stinky Brat, do you want to ask for mercy now? I tell you, it’s too late!” Hearing Liu Buyan’s voice, Elder Lu sneered ferociously.","Liu Buyan’s handsome face did not show the panic he hoped to see.","On the contrary, he smiled and said slowly: “Elder Lu, I’m afraid you have misunderstood. When did I ask for forgiveness? In the first place, why should I ask for mercy? Elder Lu, you... are you saying that if a Spirit Medicine Master has not registered with the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, they are all considered as dishonourable and bad conduct? If you are like this, what about most of the Spirit Medicine Masters who participated in the competition today? Did they provoke you? Do you have to slander them like this?”","“Where did I say wrong? Those Spirit Medicine Masters who hang out in the countryside are clearly...” Elder Lu sneered halfway through his words, when he suddenly thought of something, his expression changed!","He hurriedly turned his head to look left and right, and as expected, he saw that many Spirit Medicine Masters around him were glaring at him!","“Hmph! Old Man with the surname Lu, what are you talking about? I just don’t like to be bound to your Heaven Elixir Pagoda, alright?”","“Isn’t it so? We like to practise medicine among the people, unlike people like you, who only know how to hug the thighs of the ancient gods. So we are dishonourable and bad?”","“Heh, I don’t know who it is, in the name of seeing a doctor, blackmail people everywhere and sells cheap pills as top-quality products! How dare you say that we have bad conduct?”","Angry voices of denunciation rang out one after another.","Elder Lu didn’t realize until now that in today’s competition, in order to find more Spirit Medicine Masters hidden among the people to treat Li Moying, the Cloudy Qilin Clan deliberately didn’t set a qualification threshold.","In other words, as long as you prove that you can refine medicine, it doesn’t matter even if you have never left your name in the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, you can participate in the competition!","Anyway, there were still three rounds of competitions, and everything speaks of strength!","So, half of the contestants here today were unqualified Spirit Medicine Masters.","What Elder Lu said just now was tantamount to offending all these people."]},{"number":3658,"title":"Chapter 3658 Who Was Kicked Out? (1)","paragraphs":["3658 Who Was Kicked Out? (1)","For a moment, Elder Lu became the target of public criticism.","After he understood it, he panicked immediately, his face changed a few times, and he hurriedly explained: “Everyone, please don’t get me wrong, I was just talking about this brat...”","However, no matter how much he tried to explain himself now, it was already too late.","The Spirit Medicine Masters present had already seen his arrogance just now. Having heard his words that were filled with superiority and pride, they had already seen him through.","“Misunderstanding? I don’t think this was a misunderstanding at all, was it?”","“The first thing you say was to deprive others of their qualifications as a Spirit Medicine Master. Tsk tsk, you are really arrogant and powerful! As an Elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, are you taking personal revenge by abusing your authority?”","“Fortunately, I have never registered at the Heaven Elixir Pagoda. Otherwise, just seeing your faces would make me sick!”","Those Spirit Medicine Masters who had never registered didn’t like the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, and they didn’t like to look at other people putting up a front and always acting all arrogant all day long. Seeing Elder Lu’s arrogant and domineering appearance aroused their disgust even more.","Li Qianyue also had a headache when he saw that the commotion was getting louder and out of hand.","Today’s competition was the top priority of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Li Yuntao sent him to deal with the dispute here because he valued his trust in him. As a result, not only did he fail to handle it well, the situation became more and more serious.","If Li Yunhai sees this, he will also have a hard time.","Thinking of this, Li Qianyue became more and more displeased with Elder Lu.","He coughed heavily, and his voice became cold, “Everyone, please stop arguing, but don’t forget, this was the place of our Cloudy Qilin Clan! Everyone’s here to participate in the competition, not to quarrel. Everyone here is an esteemed Spirit Medicine Master, not a shrew in the vegetable market! How is it proper to quarrel like this?”","Hearing this, everyone was at a loss for words.","Spirit Medicine Masters still values face very much. Thinking of the way he hit him just now, he was indeed a bit like a shrew cursing the street, which made them all feel a little embarrassed.","Elder Lu quickly looked at Li Qianyue and explained, “Young Master Qianyue, this old man was really unintentional just now...”","Li Qianyue waved his hand at him, “Elder Lu, there is no need to say these words. I just said that no one is allowed to cause trouble for our Cloudy Qilin Clan on an important occasion, especially today! Yet you insist on causing trouble here, is that right? Are you deliberately trying to ruin our Cloudy Qilin Clan’s prestige?”","When Elder Lu heard this, he became even more nervous.","He tried his best to gain the favour of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but now he was blinded by anger by Liu Buyan that he made such a big mistake by talking indiscriminately!","This time he gain any favour, but he offended Li Qianyue instead!","“Young Master Qianyue, I really didn’t mean to cause trouble. It’s all his fault...” Elder Lu pointed at Liu Buyan angrily.","Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, with an expression of what can you do to me.","Elder Lu almost exploded with anger again!","However, before he could say anything, Li Qianyue had already scolded: “Enough!”","He coldly glanced at Elder Lu and Liu Buyan, his tone full of warnings, “Your matter, you can settle it yourself after the competition is over! Now that the competition has officially started, whoever dares to make trouble here will immediately get out of here and be disqualified from the competition!”","“But...”","Elder Lu wanted to say something more, but Li Qianyue completely ignored him."]},{"number":3659,"title":"Chapter 3659 Who Was Kicked Out? (2)","paragraphs":["3659 Who Was Kicked Out? (2)","Li Qianyue said loudly to the crowd: “This competition of our Cloudy Qilin Clan will not restrict the origin of the Spirit Medicine Masters. It doesn’t matter whether you have the qualifications of Spirit Medicine Masters. However, I also want to remind everyone that this competition is held in great faith and we have stewards and Elders all patrolling the grounds. If anyone dares to cheat, they will definitely be caught! At that time, don’t blame our Cloudy Qilin Clan for being overbearing and unreasonable!”","After Li Qianyue finished speaking, the agitated Spirit Medicine Masters suddenly became quiet.","A hint of approval also flashed in Liu Buyan’s eyes.","This Li Qianyue really deserves to be from the ancient god clan. Although he was young, he spoke well and acted very proper.","!!","Although Elder Lu obviously had some friendship with him, when it came to serious matters, Li Qianyue’s thinking was not influenced by Elder Lu at all, and he quickly judged what to do was the most beneficial for the clan.","The purpose of this competition was to select previously unknown Divine Doctors from among the folk Spirit Medicine Masters. Therefore, these unregistered Spirit Medicine Masters are the most valued by the Cloudy Qilin Clan and cannot be offended. Therefore, Li Qianyue Immediately, he chose to reprimand Elder Lu, to appease the folk Spirit Medicine Masters, and let them participate in the competition with peace of mind.","As for Liu Buyan, the so-called “scum”, Li Qianyue did not forget it, and specially warned him.","Come to think of it, under the shock of the name of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, ordinary Spirit Medicine Masters wouldn’t dare to cheat on such an occasion!","After Li Qianyue finished speaking, he turned around and left with someone.","Elder Lu has been bragging outside that he has a relationship with the Cloudy Qilin Clan. His so-called “relationship” was also a very important factor for him to become the Elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda of Arcane City.","But now, what Li Qianyue said made him ashamed!","He didn’t dare to offend Li Qianyue, so he put all the blame on Liu Buyan!","Elder Lu glared at Liu Buyan angrily, his eyes almost burst into flames, but Li Qianyue had already said this, and he was also afraid that he would be kicked out of the arena, so he could only forcefully suppress the anger in his heart, Turned around and returned to his position.","At the same time, he cursed Liu Buyan fiercely in his heart, hoping that this kid would also blow up the furnace in the competition, and it would be best to be blown to death directly!","It’s not that Liu Buyan didn’t notice his gaze, but he wasn’t angry at all. Instead, he smiled at Elder Lu. That relaxed look made Elder Lu almost vomit blood!","After Li Qianyue returned to Li Yuntao’s side, he reported in a low voice and pointed to them specifically.","Li Yuntao also looked towards them.","Liu Buyan quickly lowered his head, pretending to be arranging his medicinal materials.","It seems that he has already attracted the attention of the high-level members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but he did not rely on his medical skills to attract attention, but on the so-called “previous record of cheating”!","At this time, the questions for the first round of competition were announced.","“The first round of the competition is very simple. Every Spirit Medicine Master needs to use the medicinal materials in front of them to refine three kinds of earth grade pills. There is no limit to the variety. Please refine the most effective earth grade pills with your best ability. The final result of the competition depends not only on the quality and quantity of the pills, but also on the types of pills.”","Even if they were all earth grade medicinal pills, the difficulty of refining each was also different. The medicinal pill that was more complicated to refine but has a good medicinal effect will have a certain point bonus.","However, it doesn’t mean that the more complicated the better."]},{"number":3660,"title":"Chapter 3660 Who Was Kicked Out? (3)","paragraphs":["3660 Who Was Kicked Out? (3)","Because the types and quantities of medicinal materials distributed to everyone was limited, and each medicinal material was only enough to refine one medicinal pill, so how to reasonably arrange according to the resources at hand has also become part of the examination questions.","However, such an examination question was obviously difficult for Liu Buyan.","After hearing the topic, he raised the corners of his mouth in disdain, “Such a kind of competition was already outdated in Soaring Heavens Continent. I didn’t expect that God Realm is still playing trivial tricks like this...”","He opened the box containing the medicinal materials, looked at it carefully, and then laughed.","With a flick of the finger, a flame flew out from the fingertips, ignited the furnace, and he started refining.","Elder Lu had been staring at Liu Buyan’s side all the time, without blinking his eyes, just wanting to see how Liu Buyan refines.","As a result, after seeing it, the eyeballs almost fell out!","“This is...an ordinary flame?? This brat uses ordinary flame to make alchemy??”","At this moment, he suddenly remembered that Lu Dongfeng had also told him about Liu Buyan’s alchemy with an open flame, but he felt that his son was so angry that he lost his mind, and he remembered it wrongly, so he didn’t take it seriously.","Now it seems that Lu Dongfeng really didn’t exaggerate.","Then this brat’s medicinal pill technique... I’m afraid it’s really a bit powerful.","Elder Lu shuddered, and quickly accelerated his refining speed.","He can’t be compared to that brat, he must refine a medicinal pill that was much stronger than him, and let this brat know what a real saint level Spirit Medicine Master was!","It’s impossible for a Spirit Medicine Master from the ordinary mass to challenge Elder Lu!","At this time, among the crowd watching the competition, Huang Yueli was also paying attention to Liu Buyan’s situation.","The dispute just now has attracted the attention of all the onlookers.","Huang Yueli also learned from the discussions among the cultivators around her that the identity of the old man who had quarrelled with Liu Buyan was actually Lu Dongfeng’s father!","“This was really a narrow road... This old man was also so arrogant and domineering, no wonder he taught a shameless son like Lu Dongfeng! Senior Brother, don’t be cowardly, you must show him something!”","Huang Yueli secretly encouraged Liu Buyan.","Fortunately, after Li Qianyue appeared later, the dispute quickly subsided.","After the competition officially started, Huang Yueli gradually felt relieved.","She has seen Liu Buyan refining medicine hundreds of times in the past few days, and she has already been able to judge Liu Buyan’s state.","Huang Yueli could tell that the dispute just now didn’t affect Liu Buyan’s state at all. On the contrary, it seemed to motivate him, making his refinement process smoother and faster, even better than usual practice!","Sure enough, the first round of competition had only started for more than half an hour, and Liu Buyan was the first to raise his hand.","At this time, Li Yuntao was still sitting on the high platform, talking in a low voice to the Elders around him bored, but in the end, he heard Li Qianyue running up in a hurry.","“Master, master! A Spirit Medicine Master has already completed the first round of refining just now!”","“What??”","Hearing this, Li Yuntao was taken aback. He sat up straight and looked down the stage, “How could it be so fast? It hasn’t been long since the competition started? Are you sure someone has already successfully refined it?”","Li Qianyue nodded, “Sure! This disciple has already gone to see it in person!”","The expression on Li Yuntao’s face was both surprised and happy, “This... this is really amazing! Is this person an ordinary person?”"]},{"number":3661,"title":"Chapter 3661 Who Was Kicked Out? (4)","paragraphs":["3661 Who Was Kicked Out? (4)","Li Qianyue hesitated for a moment, but finally nodded, “Forget it...forget it...”","Li Yuntao was very pleasantly surprised, he didn’t notice his abnormality, but said excitedly: “Sure enough, there is still a Master still among the ordinary people! The decision to hold the competition this time was right! Who was the first who completed refining a medicinal pill? Point him out for Master?”","Li Qianyue’s expression became even more embarrassing. After hesitating for a moment, he pointed in the direction of Liu Buyan, “That’s Young Master Liu.”","Li Yuntao was taken aback for a moment, “Wait, isn’t this person the medicinal pill you told me just now... the one who had a history of cheating?”","Li Qianyue smiled wryly, and said helplessly, “That’s him. However, he’s indeed the first to complete the first round of competition.”","“He didn’t use some improper means again, did he?” Li Yuntao frowned.","Li Qianyue said: “This...it seems that there’s nothing abnormal at present.”","Li Yuntao’s face was serious, and he raised his hand to attract two young cultivators, “You two go over in a moment, and after the second round of competition, just keep an eye on Young Master Liu to see if there is anything wrong with him. Once you find something suspicious, Come and report right away.”","The two immediately saluted and went towards Liu Buyan.","Li Yuntao stared at Liu Buyan for a while, his gaze slightly concentrated.","This time, the Young Master’s life was at stake. He must not take it lightly! It’s best that Young Master Liu was really capable, otherwise, he would never let him get close to the Young Master!","After about two hours, the Spirit Medicine Masters began to hand in the pills they had refined one after another.","After all, Elder Lu was a saint level Spirit Medicine Master, and he was faster than this group of Spirit Medicine Masters.","After he handed over the medicinal pill to the steward in charge of them, he turned his head and looked around. The other Spirit Medicine Masters were still sweating profusely refining it, and he immediately felt superior.","He turned around triumphantly, wanting to look at Liu Buyan’s side again.","As a result, after seeing it, he was stunned.","Because, there was no one in the position where Liu Buyan was standing before!","Elder Lu thought about it for a while, and immediately beamed with joy.","Just now, he was concentrating on refining the medicinal pill. He was afraid that even the slightest mistake would affect his ranking, so he had no time to pay attention to other things.","Could it be that, in this short period of time, that brat surnamed Liu couldn’t help but cheat, and was kicked out by the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Hahaha, well, scum will always have to meet their fate!","Elder Lu strode away from the arena and saw a familiar Cloudy Qilin Clan disciple walking towards him, so he went up to him and asked, “Master, did someone cheat in the competition and get kicked out just now? Can you tell me?” What the hell did he do?”","The cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan looked at him in astonishment, very at a loss, “Elder Lu, what are you talking about? What cheating? What was kicked out? Everything in this competition was normal, and no one was kicked out?”","After hearing this, Elder Lu was stunned. He couldn’t help frowning and asked, “But...if it wasn’t for cheating, where did that brat go? Could it be that he retired from the competition?”","“Elder Lu, are you looking for me?”","Before the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan could react, a lazy voice sounded not far behind the two of them.","Elder Lu suddenly turned his head, and saw Liu Buyan relaxing on a chair with a teacup in his hand as he looked at him lazily."]},{"number":3662,"title":"Chapter 3662 Who Was Kicked Out? (5)","paragraphs":["3662 Who Was Kicked Out? (5)","A large area shaded by lush trees behind the arena was designated by the Cloudy Qilin Clan as a place for the Spirit Medicine Masters to rest during the intermission. There were many tables and chairs, while hot tea and snacks were also prepared for them.","However, there were very few Spirit Medicine Masters sitting in the rest area at this time. There were no more than a dozen of them in total, and most of them were old men with white hair.","Liu Buyan was the only young man amongst them, so he was very conspicuous.","Moreover, he was handsome and had a unique temperament, wearing white robes and holding a teacup in his hand. He looked the character of a hero in a troubled world, and he even had a smile on his face.","!!","Lu Dongfeng felt that his smile was unspeakably hateful, and immediately gritted his teeth and said, “Stinky brat, why are you here? Shouldn’t you have been kicked out already?”","Liu Buyan didn’t answer right away, but raised his teacup, took a sip, and waited until Lu Dongfeng was so angry that he almost jumped up, then he said slowly: “Elder Lu, you are so old, you still have to be cautious when speaking. Just now in the arena, you almost got into big trouble, and now you’re speaking again before thinking? Which eye of yours saw me being kicked out?”","Lu Dongfeng almost couldn’t bring it up again, “You...you...”","However, he also sensed that something was wrong, so he quickly turned his head to look at the cultivator from the Cloudy Qilin Clan just now.","The young cultivator glanced at him and frowned slightly, “Elder Lu, this Young Master Liu was the fastest medicinal pill in the first round of competition, and the three kinds of medicinal pills he concocted were also approved by our Patriarch. Both of you are very powerful Spirit Medicine Masters, so why is there a need for any animosity?”","Elder Lu’s eyes widened, thinking that he was too tired and heard wrong.","“Wait, you... what did you just say? This brat was the fastest in refining? How is it possible? He’s just an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master?!”","The young cultivator said: “I don’t know what level of Spirit Medicine Master he is, I’m just telling the truth. Please rest here, the second round of competition will start soon. I still have something to do, so I’ll take my leave first!”","After the young cultivator left, Elder Lu glared at Liu Buyan, his expression becoming more and more ugly.","But Liu Buyan just curled the corners of his lips coldly, didn’t say anything more, and drank tea and ate snacks leisurely.","He wouldn’t be so stupid as to take the initiative to trouble Elder Lu.","It’s best for Elder Lu to piss himself off, or if he can’t be provoked to make trouble, then he will be kicked out by the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Elder Lu also knew this, so he had been working hard to suppress the anger in his heart.","However, Liu Buyan’s gesture was too irritating. Elder Lu endured it again and again, but he still couldn’t hold it back.","“Brat, tell me clearly! How could you refine the medicinal pill so quickly? You must have cheated. What did you do?”","Liu Buyan snorted coldly, “Elder Lu, if you have any objections to the results of the competition, you can tell Chief Li. What’s the use of talking here? Don’t blame me for not reminding you. The Elder was looking at us again, if you continue on like this, I’m afraid you won’t be able to participate in the next round of competition!”","When Elder Lu heard this, he couldn’t help shivering, and then he remembered his current situation.","He gritted his teeth, and finally chose to keep his mouth shut!"]},{"number":3663,"title":"Chapter 3663 Who Was Kicked Out? (6)","paragraphs":["3663 Who Was Kicked Out? (6)","For this Stinky Brat, it would be terrible if he couldn’t participate in the next competition.","It’s better to wait for the next competition, catch his tail, and then report to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so that this brat can be completely discredited!","After Elder Lu made up his mind, he gave Liu Buyan another hard look, turned around and walked to the other side of the rest area, and stopped looking at him.","Out of sight and out of mind! He really couldn’t stand it any longer!","Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, he didn’t expect Elder Lu to give up like this, he shook his head regretfully, “Oh, this old man still has a little brains, he’s much better than his son. It’s not fun! ”","The time of two hours was up soon, and the Spirit Medicine Masters who passed the competition came to the rest area one after another.","As for the rest of the Spirit Medicine Masters who were still in the arena, if they failed to refine the medicinal pill, they would be eliminated.","Huang Yueli watched from afar the stewards of the Cloudy Qilin Clan counting the number of people, and she was also silently thinking about it. In this first round of competition, about half of the Spirit Medicine Masters were eliminated.","In other words, more than half of the spirit Spirit Medicine Masters who came to participate in the competition can at least reach the level of earth-ranked spirit Spirit Medicine Masters, and they must be good among earth-ranked spirit Spirit Medicine Masters!","This ratio can be said to be very high.","It also shows that the high level of this competition has attracted many truly outstanding Spirit Medicine Masters to participate.","Her gaze turned to the rest area at the back of the arena again, wanting to see what Liu Buyan was doing, but she couldn’t see anything from this position, so she could only wait silently.","After resting for half an hour, the second round of competition began.","The rules of the second round of the competition are similar to those of the first round, except that the pills that need to be refined have been further upgraded and become heaven grade pills.","The number of people participating in the competition on the field had been reduced by half, and the view of the audience has become much clearer.","Liu Buyan was changed this time, from a corner to a central position very close to the high platform where the Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were.","Liu Buyan knew very well that it was because the senior management of the Cloudy Qilin Clan had noticed his existence and wanted to observe him closely.","However, this was exactly what he wanted.","Liu Buyan started to ignite the fire without delay, refining the medicinal materials, controlling the fire to condense the pill...","Step by step, it’s all done in a calm and unhurried manner.","Of course, this time he didn’t dare to use ordinary ordinary flame anymore, but replaced it with the deviant flame he collected himself.","In the eyes of cultivators in the God Realm, Liu Buyan’s deviant flame was quite ordinary.","Therefore, when the Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan saw it, they all frowned and looked at each other in surprise.","“He’s just using this kind of deviant flame? If I’m not mistaken, this kind of Blaze Star Flame can’t even be ranked in the top fifty of the deviant flame list, right? A well-known Divine Doctor wouldn’t use this kind of flame!”","“Can this really make a heavenly medicinal pill? Or was he really cheating as others said?”","“It’s still too early to draw conclusions. Don’t you know after watching?”","The gazes of the several Elders were all attracted by Liu Buyan, and they didn’t bother to look at the other Spirit Medicine Masters.","Elder Lu’s position was not far from Liu Buyan. He has been secretly observing Liu Buyan. Seeing that he was being followed by so many high-level members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he was both envious and jealous.","“Hmph, brat! Don’t think you’ve won just now! With so many people watching you, if you dare to cheat again, you will die without a place to die!”"]},{"number":3664,"title":"Chapter 3664 This Person Is...(1)","paragraphs":["3664 This Person Is...(1)","Elder Lu watched from behind, cursing with all his heart that Liu Buyan would not be able to withstand the pressure, and there would be some flaws.","It’s a pity that Liu Buyan’s psychological quality was very good. Knowing that so many people were watching him, it aroused his desire to show off even more.","The speed of his hand gestures was getting faster and faster, and the control of the temperature of the pill furnace was becoming more and more precise.","Huang Yueli watched from the crowd, and couldn’t help but nodded secretly. Judging from the current situation, Liu Buyan might get the first place again in the second round of competition!","Her guess was not wrong. Less than an hour later, Liu Buyan was the first to hand over the medicinal pill!","Moreover, this time, the whole process of his operation was carried out under the eyes of the Cloudy Qilin Clan big guns, there was no room or possibility for cheating at all!","As soon as the results of the competition came out, there was a commotion among the cultivators watching.","Everyone was asking for the name of this young Spirit Medicine Master.","“Who the hell was this guy? Looking at the nameplate in front of his alchemy furnace, it seems to be Liu Buyan? Why have I never heard of such a Divine Doctor named Liu in the God Realm?”","“That’s right, I haven’t heard of it either! Seeing that he’s so young and has such a high level of alchemy, he must be a famous doctor in the God Realm in the future, right?”","“Besides, he’s not bad-looking... You can really say he’s a handsome young man!”","Everyone talked a lot, and they were all amazed by Liu Buyan’s performance! There were even quite a few young girls who were fascinated by Liu Buyan’s demeanour during alchemy.","Not only the ordinary cultivators in the audience, but even Li Yuntao and other Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan couldn’t help but look at Liu Buyan differently.","Li Yuntao even ordered Li Qianyue beside him to encourage Liu Buyan.","Li Qianyue obeyed the order and walked over to convey Li Yuntao’s meaning, “Young Master Liu, congratulations on winning the first place in the second round of the competition! My Master is very optimistic about you and hopes that you can win the competition!”","Liu Buyan hooked the corners of his lips, and cupped his hands casually, “Elder Li, you’re being polite.”","He was not like Elder Lu and others, who were fearful towards the high-level members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","As Li Moying’s close friend and has saved his life several times, Liu Buyan does not think that his status was lower than the Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so he has no intention of bending his knees.","Seeing him like this, Li Qianyue couldn’t help but look at him a few more times, feeling a little surprised.","At the same time, he had more confidence in his medical skills.","Only a true Divine Doctor would be so lofty, completely ignoring the real power figures of the ancient gods.","So, when Li Qianyue talked to Liu Buyan, he also became more polite.","Elder Lu listened to him from the side, and he was so jealous that he almost went crazy!","He has friendship with Li Qianyue, and it’s all because of his shameless sticking up to him, trying his best to please him, so that he can gain a little relationship, but when Li Qianyue talks to him, he was still a bit condescending.","However, Liu Buyan was just a little-known earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master, but he can make Li Qianyue treat him so politely!","The more he thought about it, the more unwilling he became. He couldn’t help coughing heavily behind the two of them.","Seeing Li Qianyue turn his head to look over, Elder Lu said slowly: “Young Master Liu, I really want to congratulate you for winning the first place again! However, the next round will be the competition between saint level Spirit Medicine Masters. You are the top Spirit Medicine Master at the earth level, but... oh, what a pity!”"]},{"number":3665,"title":"Chapter 3665 This Person Is... (2)","paragraphs":["3665 This Person Is... (2)","Elder Lu deliberately enunciated his words, emphasising that he was an “earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master”.","Li Qianyue really listened to it, and seemed a little surprised, “Young Master Liu is... an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master? How is that impossible? Just because he won the first place in the second round of competition, the level of alchemy far exceeds ordinary heaven ranked Spirit Medicine Master! Elder Lu, did you make a mistake somewhere?”","“This...” Elder Lu suddenly ran out of words.","Wasn’t it so?","Now that the facts were in front of him, Liu Buyan was just an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master, even he himself doesn’t believe it!","However, just over ten days ago, he obviously just went to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda to obtain the badge of the earth rank? On the record of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, it was clearly written so!","Liu Buyan smiled lightly and said: “There’s no misunderstanding. I have never registered at the Heaven Elixir Pagoda for a medicinal pill before. This time, I just registered for the qualification of an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master to participate in the competition. Actually, I don’t know what level of Spirit Medicine Master I am, I rarely had contact with other Spirit Medicine Masters before.”","Li Qianyue suddenly realised, “So that’s it! It seems that Divine Doctor Liu was the kind of secret Spirit Medicine Master who lives in seclusion in a small town?”","Liu Buyan just smiled and said nothing, neither affirming nor denying.","Elder Lu stared at Liu Buyan for a long time, seeing Li Qianyue being more respectful and polite to Liu Buyan, he was so angry!","He knows the details of that brat!","After Lu Dongfeng was planted in Liu Buyan’s hands, in order to know himself and the enemy, he went to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda to check Liu Buyan’s files, and specifically asked the Spirit Medicine Master who gave Liu Buyan the certification examination.","The other party clearly said that Liu Buyan was at the level of an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master. Although he was very proficient in alchemy techniques and had a strong mental power, he knew very little about heaven grade pills. He even went back and read the introductory book of the Spirit Medicine Master.","With such a performance, who can believe that he was already at the heaven rank at that time?","Of course, it would be even more nonsense to say that he has reached the heaven rank in such a short period of ten days!","There must be some ulterior secret about Liu Buyan!","It’s just that he didn’t know what method he used, but even the Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were deceived by him!","Fortunately, there was still the last round!","The last round of competition was a competition between saint level Spirit Medicine Masters. Even if this brat can pretend, he will definitely show his feet at this time!","The time limit for the second round of competition was also two hours.","After the competition, the stewards counted the number of people who passed the competition.","This time, the number of eliminated Spirit Medicine Masters was quite large, almost reaching ninety percent!","Even if it was a heaven ranked Spirit Medicine Master who has already left a name in the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, it was rare to have the ability to complete the three types of medicinal pill refining in such a short period of time.","As a result, the original team of more than a thousand contestants was reduced to fifty-two in one fell swoop.","These fifty-two people undoubtedly have the level of top heaven ranked Spirit Medicine Masters.","Each of them received the eager eyes of tens of thousands of cultivators present.","Among them, Liu Buyan was undoubtedly the one who received the most attention.","Listening to the voices talking about Liu Buyan around her, Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth, “Senior Brother, you are famous now!”","“Now, the final round of competition begins, all Spirit Medicine Masters, please take your seats!”"]},{"number":3666,"title":"Chapter 3666 This Person Is... (3)","paragraphs":["3666 This Person Is... (3)","After the steward gave the instructions, all the Spirit Medicine Masters quickly returned to their positions.","Outside the arena, the tens of thousands of onlookers also fell silent, staring at the arena without blinking.","The competition has entered the most critical moment!","Li Yuntao stood up from his seat, walked to the centre in person, and announced the rules for the third round of competition.","!!","“The rules of this round are different from those of the previous two rounds. You have proved that you are a very good Spirit Medicine Master by passing the previous two rounds of assessment. However, you must also know that our Cloudy Qilin Clan organised this competition, not to find the best Spirit Medicine Master, but to find someone who can cure our Young Master! Therefore, this third round of competition...”","When Li Yuntao said this, he paused for a moment, and raised his hand to compare the open space behind the venue that was covered by a high platform.","“This time, we specially found cultivators from all over the God Realm who had similar illnesses to the Young Master. Although the causes of these injuries were different, the symptoms were similar. All of them were not seriously damaged in the meridians and dantian, but they were unconscious. Wake up. This third round of competition is to invite you to randomly select a wounded person and try to heal him. If you can wake up one of them, even if you have passed the competition, you can go to see the Young Master.”","When Li Yuntao said this, everyone was stunned.","It took a while for someone to react.","“This is the third round of competition?? This... this is too difficult!”","“Where did the Cloudy Qilin Clan find so many cultivators with similar illnesses?”","“No wonder it was said that this round of competition requires the strength of a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master to pass...”","“It’s more than that? This kind of disease is very rare, and there must not be many people who can be cured. Even a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master may not be able to do it, right?”","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows when she heard Li Yuntao’s words. After being slightly surprised, she fully understood.","This time, the Cloudy Qilin Clan really went all the way out because of Li Moying’s illness.","Most probably during the past few months when Li Moying was in a coma, the Cloudy Qilin Clan had already tried everything, including finding so many cultivators with similar symptoms to Li Moying from all over the God Realm, and bringing them to test the medicine.","This kind of symptom was actually very rare, otherwise it wouldn’t be curable. It’s hard for the Cloudy Qilin Clan to find so many cases, she really didn’t know how much effort and painstaking effort they had spent.","It’s a pity that Li Moying still couldn’t be cured...","As for the family members of these unconscious cultivators, they had already given up hope. When the Cloudy Qilin Clan suddenly came in, even if it was to test the medicine for the Young Master, but after all, there was still a little hope for a cure.","It was better than lying down like a living dead all the time.","So, this could be considered a win-win situation.","Just as Huang Yueli was thinking, the stewards of the Cloudy Qilin Clan had already pushed out the cultivators who needed to be consulted from behind the high platform. There were indeed quite a few of them, at least one of the Spirit Medicine Masters present was enough.","Huang Yueli glanced at the faces of these people, and couldn’t help frowning slightly.","She was too far away from the competition venue, so she can’t see why these cultivators were unconscious.","However, it was obvious that the Cloudy Qilin Clan recruited these cultivators only because their symptoms were similar to those of Li Moying, and the causes may be different.","logo","This is the end of Part One, and"]},{"number":3667,"title":"Chapter 3667 This Person Is... (4)","paragraphs":["3667 This Person Is... (4)","For Spirit Medicine Masters, the difficulty of treating them was also different, so which patient they choose as their treatment target will directly affect whether they can pass this round of competition in the end.","All the Spirit Medicine Masters were aware of this.","Everyone looked at their competitors vigilantly, and each was thinking about it in their hearts.","Liu Buyan seemed very relaxed, but he subconsciously glanced at where Huang Yueli was.","There were huge crowds of people at the seats where the cultivators were watching. Even a cultivator with strong mental power like him would not be able to find Huang Yueli right away, so Liu Buyan let out a soft sigh.","His Junior Sister could be said to have predicted everything like a god, and had guessed what might happen in today’s competition from the very beginning.","Although this third round of competition was slightly different from what she had speculated in advance, the strategy to deal with it should still be the same.","At the same time, Elder Lu was also staring at Liu Buyan.","Seeing Liu Buyan’s relaxed look, he couldn’t help but sneered coldly.","This brat... was really good at pretending!","Now this third round of competition was not just as simple as alchemy, but to test the medical skills of the Spirit Medicine Master!","For earth ranked and heaven ranked Spirit Medicine Masters, it was possible to go out and make money after learning a few pills. However, it was not so simple to be promoted to a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master.","They not only need to be able to refine saint grade medicinal pills, but also have enough ability to diagnose the injuries and illnesses of cultivators, and prescribe the right medicine. In many cases, they need to refine pills according to the cultivator’s own physique instead of relying on an unchanging prescription that’s been around.","It can be said that the exam question given by the Cloudy Qilin Clan was really testing the true ability of the Spirit Medicine Master.","Anyone who fished in troubled waters or used tricks to get past the first two rounds of competition will show their true colours here!","Elder Lu, as the Elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, was already hundreds of years old. He has seen many cases and was very experienced in the diagnosis of diseases.","He felt that only this round of competition could reflect his level.","And for a brat like Liu Buyan, it would be considered unlucky for him to encounter such a problem!","Maybe he can’t even diagnose the cause of the disease, let alone have the patient wake up.","At this time, all the unconscious cultivators had been carried to the middle of the competition field.","Li Yuntao coughed twice, and said, “Divine Doctors, you have already seen the patients. Presumably, what you are most concerned about is how these patients are assigned to you.”","The Spirit Medicine Masters kept silent and pricked up their ears, for fear of missing any word Li Yuntao said!","Which patients were selected was the key to whether they could pass the competition!","If it was as difficult to treat as Li Moying himself, no one would dare to guarantee that he could be awakened in such a short time.","Li Yuntao said: “It’s very simple. Just follow the order of your rankings in the first two rounds of competitions. The first patient will be selected first, and then the second patient will be selected, and so on.”","Hearing this, some people were excited, while expressions of the others immediately crumbled.","These depressed ones were all at the bottom of the ranking.","Originally, the second round was already a fluke, and now we can only ask others to pick the ones left, which must be the most difficult to treat.","It seems that they will definitely not be able to see Li Moying."]},{"number":3668,"title":"Chapter 3668 This Person Is... (5)","paragraphs":["3668 This Person Is... (5)","“Alright, let’s start now!” Li Qianyue walked over with a smile, and waved to Liu Buyan, “Divine Divine Doctor Liu, please start first.”","All eyes immediately focused on Liu Buyan.","All the Spirit Medicine Masters were envious and jealous of him.","Elder Lu gritted his teeth even more, clenched his fist secretly, his heart was full of unwillingness.","What’s so great about this brat, he’s just an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master, yet he can beat so many outstanding Spirit Medicine Masters and be the first to pick patients!","This was a shame to the saint ranked Spirit Medicine Masters present!","It’s a pity that no matter how unwilling he is, he can’t stop Liu Buyan.","Under the admiring gazes of tens of thousands of onlookers, Liu Buyan walked to the centre of the venue in an unrestrained manner, and began to select his patient for diagnosis and treatment.","He walked very slowly. When he passed each patient, he would stop for a few breaths to carefully observe the patient’s condition, and then walk to the next person.","The ordinary cultivators in the audience didn’t know what he was up to. After waiting for a long time without seeing Liu Buyan’s selection, many of them lost their patience.","“What’s going on here? Why does it take so long to choose someone?”","“There are more than fifty Spirit Medicine Masters present, and it already took him such a long time for him alone. I don’t know how long it will take for so many people to select if they are going to take their time to choose them one by one!”","“Can it be that today’s just about selecting people, so you can’t see the results of the competition?”","Huang Yueli listened to the discussions around her, she didn’t move her expression, but she knew very well that if she wanted to save a cultivator who had been in a coma for several months, it would certainly not be possible to do it today, and the competition should be divided into several days.","The cultivators didn’t understand, and were quite dissatisfied with Liu Buyan’s performance.","However, in the eyes of the Spirit Medicine Masters, Liu Buyan’s performance was quite shocking!","Because, he actually only observed each patient for a few breaths, and even the longest ones were only about 20 breaths, and he went straight to the next one!","Moreover, he still hasn’t turned back!","Did he make a mistake? This was picking patients!","If one would want to pick out the patients who are the easiest to cure, you must first have a preliminary diagnosis of the condition. Even if it was only a rough diagnosis, you will inevitably have to look, hear, ask, and feel the pulse when necessary. Judgement was the crux and there was no incentive if rushed.","How could it be like what Liu Buyan was doing?","This was simply like going on a holiday and watching the scenery!","Did he think he was shopping on the street? Do you think patients were fruits and vegetables displayed in the vegetable market? Just by looking at them a few times, you can see what’s going on with them?","The Spirit Medicine Masters looked at each other, looked at Liu Buyan, and didn’t know what was going on with him?","Could it be that his medical skills have reached such a level that he can make a diagnosis with just a few glances?","As for Elder Lu, he simply sneered from the bottom of his heart.","This brat...was he going to reveal his secrets this time?","How can there be a Spirit Medicine Master who diagnoses patients like him?","He obviously doesn’t understand anything, that’s why he’s pretending to be incapable here!","He wants to see what kind of patient Liu Buyan can pick out this time!","Everyone had their own thoughts, and they all watched Liu Buyan’s every move.","Although Liu Buyan walked slowly, he didn’t stop much, so he came to the end not long after.","He turned around and faced Li Yuntao on the high platform."]},{"number":3669,"title":"Chapter 3669 This Person Is... (6)","paragraphs":["3669 This Person Is... (6)","“Elder Li...”","As soon as Liu Buyan opened his mouth, everyone’s hearts were raised.","Li Yuntao nodded slightly, “Young Master Liu, have you selected the patient for diagnosis and treatment?”","Liu Buyan nodded and said, “That’s right, I’ve already chosen!”","As soon as this remark came out, even Li Yuntao was a little shocked, his brows raised, “Young Master Liu, are you certain? Once you’ve selected a patient for diagnosis and treatment, you can’t change it later!”","Even Li Yuntao didn’t expect that Liu Buyan would just take a few glances so casually, and it was considered a rather good choice.","To be honest, anyone who knows a little bit doesn’t know what Liu Buyan was looking at?","Li Yuntao was also optimistic about Liu Buyan, and he was a little biased towards him in his heart, so he asked one more question on purpose.","However, Liu Buyan’s attitude was very firm, “Yes, I have already selected the patient, and I’m certain of my choice.”","After talking about this, Li Yuntao stopped trying to persuade him, and asked directly: “Which one was Young Master Liu planning to pick? Qianyue, go and write down the number.”","Liu Buyan pointed to a cultivator in the easternmost corner, “That’s the Young Master in the grey robe, his number seems to be Number 23!”","“Number 23!”","Hearing Liu Buyan’s words, everyone looked in the direction he pointed.","It’s a pity that the audience on the periphery were too far away, and they couldn’t see clearly with their eyes widened.","And the Spirit Medicine Masters in the venue couldn’t help but take a few steps forward, and approached the east corner, wanting to see what was going on with the patient Liu Buyan picked, and why he was picked by Liu Buyan.","However, after seeing Number 23, most people were stunned.","Because, from the perspective of these Divine Doctors, this Number 23... should be the most difficult to treat among these patients!","This person was young, only about thirty years old. Although he was unconscious, his breathing was steady and his complexion was as usual, except that his lips had an unnatural red colour.","The cultivator was seriously ill and was in a coma. His lips were either grey or bruised, and it was impossible for him to be red.","Ordinary doctors may take it for granted based on the colour of their lips that this kind of patient’s condition was not serious, and most of them are just weak and weak. However, experienced Spirit Medicine Masters could tell that this unnatural colour was a manifestation of excessive profound energy in the body.","Being unconscious with abundant profound strength, if the cause of this problem cannot be found, then there was no solution at all.","If he was treated according to qi deficiency and frailty, and he was given nourishing medicine, it will aggravate this person’s condition. If it was not done well, it will directly cause the profound energy in his meridians to explode, endangering his life!","Liu Buyan actually chose such a difficult patient?","From Elder Lu’s point of view, any patient Liu Buyan chooses at will still have hope of being cured, but this one...the possibility of healing him was close to zero!","“This brat was really ignorant! How could he make such a low-level mistake! Could it be that he thinks that this person can’t be cured? It’s really ridiculous! I said it a long time ago, an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master , even if he gets to the third round by luck, he is destined to be beaten back to his original form! If he puts people to death, it will be a big joke!”","Elder Lu looked at Liu Buyan’s direction and smiled darkly.","At this time, Li Yuntao also looked at Number 23, and his pupils shrank suddenly.","“This Number 23...”"]},{"number":3670,"title":"Chapter 3670 This Person Is... (7)","paragraphs":["3670 This Person Is... (7)","Those Spirit Medicine Masters didn’t know the inside story, so naturally they couldn’t see anything special about Number 23.","However, Li Yuntao understood very well.","The symptoms of Number 23 were actually the closest to those of Li Moying, and they can even be said to be exactly the same!","This person was also a genius cultivator, his talent has reached the heavenly level, and he was also unconscious after being injured in an experience, and the condition of his body, whether it was the state of the meridians or the state of the soul, was not much different from that of Li Moying.","The only difference was that this person has been in a coma for nearly a year, and almost died several times. It was a miracle that he could survive till now.","Moreover, since the situation on Number 23 was very critical, in order to save him, his family had already broken their cans, and agreed to the Cloudy Qilin Clan to test the medicine on him.","Therefore, after Number 23 was sent to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, at first, Li Shihong and the others felt that they saw a glimmer of hope. As long as this person can be cured, it will not be far from curing Li Moying.","It’s a pity that it turned out that they were just having fun for nothing.","The cause of Number 23’s illness has not been found for a long time, let alone cured.","Thinking of this, Li Yuntao looked at Liu Buyan’s delicate and handsome face again, and narrowed his eyes.","Why did Liu Buyan choose him?","What did Liu Buyan see from Number 23? Or... just a coincidence?","However, Liu Buyan always had a very calm expression with a smile on his face, and there was nothing unusual at all.","After choosing the patients for diagnosis and treatment, he silently stepped aside and waited quietly.","Next, the second-ranked Spirit Medicine Master went over to pick someone.","The cultivators who were onlookers thought that Liu Buyan’s movements were too slow. Only then did they realise how wrong they were!","Compared with the Spirit Medicine Master on the field now, Liu Buyan’s speed was simply light speed!","The medicinal pill doctor leaned in front of the patient for a while to observe his complexion, and then raised the patient’s wrist to check the pulse.","In the end, it was Li Yuntao who became impatient and sent someone down to urge him, so he hesitantly picked one away.","After such a long delay, Li Yuntao and others also realised that it was not an option to choose one by one. After all, there were only a few people who were as decisive as Liu Buyan.","So, next, the Spirit Medicine Masters were divided into five groups according to their rankings. Each time, ten people went to pick people at the same time, and the time limit was half an hour. After they all finished reading, they reported the patient’s serial number according to the ranking.","In this way, the efficiency has improved a lot.","But even so, it was not until the evening that they were all picked.","Li Yuntao walked to the front of the stage and announced: “Everyone, I know that you are all prepared, but, for the sake of fairness, we will give you three days to diagnose the cause of the disease and refine the medicinal pill. After three days, please All Spirit Medicine Masters return to the arena again, and when the time comes, we will publicly verify the results of your diagnosis and treatment.”","Hearing this, the Spirit Medicine Masters were all relieved.","It would be too difficult for most people if they were really required to diagnose and treat on the spot.","If you can have a buffer time of three days, go back and check the medical books before making a judgement, then you will be much more confident.","Li Yuntao announced the end of the competition, Huang Yueli mixed with the crowd and returned to the inn quietly."]},{"number":3671,"title":"Chapter 3671 Amazing Skills (1)","paragraphs":["3671 Amazing Skills (1)","It wasn’t until around one that Liu Buyan came back in a hurry.","As soon as Huang Yueli saw him, she hurriedly asked: “Senior Brother, how was it? What’s the situation with the Number 23 that you’ve picked?”","Liu Buyan immediately showed a smile, “Junior Sister, you can rest assured, if you leave the matter to me, can I still mess it up for you? It’s a coincidence that the symptoms on him are of the evil qi entering the body that you told me about last time. They are exactly the same! It seems that he must have also entered some evil cultivator’s territory by mistake, which led to his coma.”","Huang Yueli was a little worried, and asked, “Really? Are you sure?”","“If the symptoms you told me last time are correct, I can be sure of it!” Liu Buyan nodded resolutely, smacking his chest in assurance.","Only then did Huang Yueli heave a sigh of relief, “That’s good! Senior Brother, this time I really worked hard on you.”","Liu Buyan smiled and shook his head, “Junior Sister, you don’t need to be polite. Originally, I wanted to save Moying, not just to help you. Besides, I learned a lot from you this time. It can be said that I have benefited a lot. If you hadn’t reminded me in advance, I wouldn’t have thought of picking Number 23.”","Before today’s competition started, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan had discussed together and speculated on what the topics of today’s competition would be.","Huang Yueli speculated that since Li Moying’s illness was very rare, it could not be cured by an ordinary saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master. Therefore, the last round of competition was likely to allow them to prepare corresponding prescriptions according to Li Moying’s symptoms.","Therefore, Huang Yueli deliberately told Liu Buyan about some symptoms and possible situations of evil qi entering the body, so that Liu Buyan could perform better than other Spirit Medicine Masters when encountering such problems. .","In the end, she was only half right.","The Cloudy Qilin Clan was indeed selecting Spirit Medicine Masters in a targeted manner. However, they did not let their Young Master come out. Instead, they found so many cultivators with similar symptoms at once as part of the assessment.","This generosity really shocked Huang Yueli!","The strength and influence of the ancient gods were even more terrifying than she had imagined.","However, although the content of the competition was slightly different, it did not affect Liu Buyan’s performance at all.","He has a good memory, and after Huang Yueli’s special training, he picked out Number 23 from other patients with acute vision.","“Junior Sister, what should we do next?” Liu Buyan stared at Huang Yueli closely, and asked, “Last time you said that if you want to save Li Moying, you must teach him the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”. Hence, to save Number 23, do you have to teach him this as well?”","As he spoke, his eyebrows furrowed immediately.","Teaching secret skills was no small matter.","This was the secret skill that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow wants to pass on to his disciples. How could he just pass it on to someone he doesn’t know so casually?","Besides, once it gets out that Huang Yueli was an evil cultivator, it will be a big trouble!","Huang Yueli saw his worry, and couldn’t help but curl her lips into a smile, “Senior Brother, then you don’t have to worry. Moying has absorbed too much evil into his body, so he has to rely on the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, but, this Number 23 can’t have a talent like Moying, and I think he wouldn’t have absorbed too much evil qi, so it’s much easier to deal with.”"]},{"number":3672,"title":"Chapter 3672 Amazing Skills (2)","paragraphs":["3672 Amazing Skills (2)","“Then what should I do?” Liu Buyan asked.","Huang Yueli thought about it for a while, and said, “You just need to refine a few pills that are calming and clears internal heat. Just leave the rest to me!”","Liu Buyan had already taken out a pen and paper, planning to write down all the important things Huang Yueli told him, for fear that he would forget, but who knows, he heard such words in the end.","He widened his eyes, “...Eh? You... ? But aren’t you a Spiritual Armament Master!!”","...","Three days later.","Early in the morning, the open space at the entrance of Amethyst Paramount Palace was full of people.","Cultivators from almost the entire Arcane City rushed over just to see the final result of this competition.","Everyone knew that today was the time for all the Spirit Medicine Masters to show their true abilities! Who was strong and who was weak, just look at the effect of the treatment, it will be clear at a glance!","Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan came together, so they arrived early and occupied a position with a good view.","In the competition venue, all the Spirit Medicine Masters who had entered the third round had already arrived. Not far in front of them was the patient they were going to treat this time.","After selecting the patients for diagnosis and treatment last time, although they could not take the patients back, the Cloudy Qilin Clan specially issued badges for each Spirit Medicine Master to enter and exit a specific area of the Amethyst Paramount Palace, allowing them to travel within the three days. Go to see the patients you have chosen for treatment at any time.","Now, everyone was ready and waiting to be verified one by one.","Li Shihong and others soon appeared on the high platform, and then, the final round of competition officially began.","When selecting patients, they started with Liu Buyan but when verifying the effect of the treatment, they started with the last one, and Liu Buyan became the last one.","So, for the whole morning, he sat in his seat, completely bored as he watched other Spirit Medicine Masters perform.","The first few Spirit Medicine Masters performed poorly.","Especially the last five. After feeding the medicinal pill to their own patients, the condition of the patients even deteriorated seriously, almost endangering their lives. It was the medicinal pill of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who came out to rescue them.","However, it’s no wonder that the last few patients were originally selected by others, and they should be the most difficult to treat. In addition, they were at the bottom of the level, so it’s strange that they can be cured well.","The later ones also performed quite poorly.","Not even one of the thirty Spirit Medicine Masters in a row was able to wake the patient.","It wasn’t until the thirty first person that people began to be successfully treated one after another.","Among them, Elder Lu was included.","His luck was pretty good.","In the first two rounds of competition, he ranked ninth, and when selecting patients, he also accidentally discovered a case that he had read in medical books before.","Although this kind of disease was relatively rare, as long as the cause was known, the treatment was very simple.","Elder Lu was overwhelmed with surprise, and quickly assigned this patient.","This was definitely a very correct decision.","After Elder Lu went back, he looked up the medical book again, and at the same time refined a furnace of saint grade medicinal pill according to the medicinal pill prescription recorded above.","After he fed these medicinal pills to the patient, the patient soon regained consciousness.","Seeing this scene, the cultivators onlookers all exclaimed!","Even Li Yuntao on the high platform couldn’t help standing up, and looked at him in surprise and joy."]},{"number":3673,"title":"Chapter 3673 Amazing Skills (3)","paragraphs":["3673 Amazing Skills (3)","Because, so far, Elder Lu was the one with the most remarkable healing effect!","Under the treatment of the three or four Spirit Medicine Masters before, they were only able to make their patient’s fingers or eyelids move a little.","But Elder Lu’s patient directly opened his eyes and even made a small sound from his mouth!","This shows that the medicinal pill he refined was extremely powerful, it was simply amazing!","Li Yuntao quickly sent two disciples down, and respectfully invited Elder Lu to a private seat on one side.","Li Qianyue, who was originally high-spirited, also bowed his head to Elder Lu this time. His polite and ingratiating attitude made Elder Lu feel very comfortable!","This was the treatment worthy of a genius doctor like him!","What was Liu Buyan, that brat?","Now, he, Elder Lu, was the genius doctor valued by the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and he was the guest of Elder Tao. After Liu Buyan made a fool of himself, he will let Li Yuntao kick out that brat who was trying to gain fame!","While thinking about it, Elder Lu looked at Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan was wearing a silver-white Spirit Medicine Master’s robe, leaning leisurely on the back of the chair, resting his chin on one hand, his eyes were slightly cold, as he glanced at the Spirit Medicine Masters in the venue.","With his lazy and calm attitude, it seems that he is not in such a critical competition at all, but drinking tea and enjoying the flowers in his backyard.","Except for him, the other Spirit Medicine Masters were anxious and nervous, which made Liu Buyan’s attitude look particularly eye-catching.","Elder Lu stared at him with hatred in his heart!","This brat’s appearance was really good, so with his pretentious attitude, it gave people the illusion that he’s an expert.","Hmph! It’s a pity that if it is fake, it will never be true!","He wanted to see how Liu Buyan would step down after picking such a patient who was the most difficult to diagnose and treat!","After Elder Lu, there are not many Spirit Medicine Masters left.","Moreover, they were all top existences among saint ranked Spirit Medicine Masters.","Therefore, the success rate of diagnosis and treatment has also been significantly improved.","Among the seven people, five of them succeeded in their patients waking up, and two of them behaved similarly to Elder Lu’s, making the patients open their eyes immediately.","Li Shihong and others saw it on the high platform, and their faces showed joy, and they nodded repeatedly.","They all felt that they made the right decision this time. They actually singled out so many Spirit Medicine Masters who have researched on this symptom at once!","Now, the only one who hasn’t had time to make a move was Liu Buyan.","Everyone’s eyes were once again focused on him.","“Divine Docter Liu, are you ready? If you are ready, then please go ahead!” Li Yuntao looked at Liu Buyan and urged him personally.","Only then did Liu Buyan put down the teacup in his hand, stood up slowly, and walked to the stretcher of patient Number 23.","He took out an exquisite Jun porcelain medicine bottle from his sleeve, and poured out a few pills from it.","Elder Lu’s eyes were fixed on Liu Buyan all the time, and he didn’t even dare to blink, for fear of missing any details.","Therefore, he could see very clearly that what Liu Buyan poured out of the medicine bottle was clearly a few Profound Serene Pills!","The quality of those pills were very good, obviously the refining was very successful, but that couldn’t change the fact that they were heaven grade pills!","Liu Buyan actually wanted to use heaven grade medicinal pills to cure such an intractable problem?"]},{"number":3674,"title":"Chapter 3674 Amazing Skills (4)","paragraphs":["3674 Amazing Skills (4)","Elder Lu was not the only one who discovered this.","Some Spirit Medicine Masters even let out a soft cry of “Huh”.","Everyone watched helplessly as Liu Buyan stuffed these heaven grade pills into Number 23’s mouth, and then...","Time passed bit by bit, and everyone was waiting to see how Number 23 would react.","Seeing Liu Buyan’s calm and confident appearance, the pill he refined should be very effective, right?","But who knows, after Number 23 swallowed the medicinal pill, let alone opened his eyes, he didn’t even move his fingers. He was still lying flat on the stretcher with a lifeless expression on his face.","For a while, everyone was a little overwhelmed.","Li Yuntao and others originally placed high hopes on Liu Buyan, but the result turned out to be like this, and they couldn’t help but look at each other in blank dismay.","After Elder Lu came to his senses, he couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","There was no sound in the venue at this time, and his laughter suddenly sounded very harsh.","However, no one thought he was impolite, because everyone had the same thoughts as him, and they all thought that Liu Buyan’s matter...was so funny!","Elder Lu came out with a smile, and walked behind Liu Buyan, “Young Master Liu, oh no I mean Divine Doctor Liu, what are you doing? You are the number one in the first two rounds of this competition. The first one to pick, I think with your level of medical skills, curing him would just be a piece of cake!”","He stretched out his head, deliberately looked left and right, and then made an exaggerated shocked expression, “Oh, what’s going on? Why hasn’t Number 23 woke up yet? Oh, I see, for sure It’s because his condition was more serious, it will take some time to fully absorb the power of the medicine, right?”","Hearing Elder Lu’s words, some kind-hearted Spirit Medicine Masters felt that they could no longer listen.","Liu Buyan was so young, it’s not easy to get to where he was today. It can be said that he was one of the top geniuses in alchemy.","Even if he was eliminated in the last round, it cannot be said that his medical skills are not good, it can only be said that he was still too young and inexperienced!","And Elder Lu tried his best to run on Liu Buyan, anyone with a discerning eye would know that he had bad intentions!","He deliberately wanted to take this opportunity to beat this top medical genius to the ground!","“Elder Lu, aren’t you asking this question knowingly? Young Master Liu probably misdiagnosed it.”","“Inexperienced doctors may evidently misdiagnose, it’s nothing!”","“Young Master Liu is only a heaven ranked Spirit Medicine Master after all. When he reaches the next level, it will definitely be a breeze to treat these diseases.”","The Spirit Medicine Masters spoke one after another and found a way out for Liu Buyan. At the same time, some people forcibly changed the subject, saying that the competition was over, and they couldn’t wait to see Young Master Li!","Elder Lu secretly scolded these Spirit Medicine Masters as idiots, and wanted to say something more to bring the topic back.","He managed to find an opportunity to taunt Liu Buyan, so he couldn’t just let it go!","However, at this moment, Liu Buyan himself spoke up.","“Dear Divine Doctors, what are you misunderstanding? When did I say that I can’t cure patient Number 23?”","“...What??”","“What? What did you say?”","Everyone looked at him blankly with confused expressions, completely unable to believe what they heard just now."]},{"number":3675,"title":"Chapter 3675 Amazing Skills (5)","paragraphs":["3675 Amazing Skills (5)","Liu Buyan turned to Elder Lu with a smile on his lips, “Elder Lu knows me better! He’s right, I can only refine heaven ranked pills because of my limited medicinal pill skills. So, although This medicinal pill is suitable for the symptoms, but it is really difficult for the patient to absorb all the power of the medicine...”","Hearing this, Elder Lu was taken aback, but not long after, a sneer appeared on the corner of his lips.","This brat... was really a complete idiot!","Those Spirit Medicine Masters kindly wanted to excuse him, but he was so ignorant that he went downhill without haste, and insisted on saying that the medicine’s effect is slow!","Isn’t this courting death? What is it?","He was worried that Liu Buyan would have escaped, but he didn’t expect that this brat would hit the knife’s edge by himself!","Elder Lu laughed secretly in his heart, twirled his beard, and said, “Since that’s the case, Divine Divine Doctor Liu, tell me how long it will take for the medicine to fully exert its effect? We can’t wait here forever, can we?”","Liu Buyan chuckled and said, “Elder Lu is right! Young Master Li is still waiting for us to heal him. We really can’t wait too long... then I can only make a fool of myself in front of everyone!”","“Make a fool of yourself? What do you mean?” Elder Lu frowned, unable to understand.","Liu Buyan didn’t answer him, but turned to Li Yuntao and the others on the high platform, bowed his hands and saluted them, and then said: “Several Elders, there is a secret method of golden needle acupuncture I’ve inherited which can accelerate the speed at which the medicinal effect of the pill flowing through the meridians. Hence, I would like to administer acupuncture for this patient.”","When Li Yuntao and the others heard this, their eyes lit up immediately.","The golden needle acupuncture!","This was a special skill of Spirit Medicine Masters!","Generally, those who have the ability to administer acupuncture with golden needles are all well-known Spirit Medicine Masters, because the methods of crossing acupuncture points with golden needles were all handed down from Master to apprentice, and there were basically no records kept in the classic texts.","Moreover, Liu Buyan still intended to administer acupuncture to such a patient suffering from an intractable problem, which reflects his level.","“Alright, alright! Since Divine Divine Doctor Liu has this skill, let’s be daring!” Naturally, Li Yuntao did not refuse.","Liu Buyan glanced at Elder Lu, and said again: “However, my method of crossing the acupoints with golden needles is a secret of my Master’s sect, and no one else can see it when I administer the needles...”","When Li Yuntao heard this, he hesitated for a while.","However, he also knew the rules of Spirit Medicine Masters, so he only thought about it for a while before nodding.","“Then please invite Divine Divine Doctor Liu to administer the needles behind the high platform. There is a screen to block it, so other people can’t see your technique. Do you think this will work?”","Liu Buyan nodded, “Yes.”","When he heard him agree, Li Yuntao sent two young cultivators over to carry patient Number 23 to the back of the high platform.","Liu Buyan followed closely and passed by.","The other Spirit Medicine Masters were naturally extremely curious. They stretched their necks one by one, eager to see how Liu Buyan was going to administer the needles!","Just now, many people saw that the medicinal pill that Liu Buyan gave Number 23 was just a very common heaven grade medicinal pill for clearing internal heat.","At first, everyone thought it was strange, and they always felt that this medicinal pill could not cure such a complicated disease.","Now that they think about it, it seems that the key to the cure... lies in Liu Buyan’s acupuncture!","As for enhancing the effect of the medicine, that was just an excuse."]},{"number":3676,"title":"Chapter 3676 Amazing Skills (6)","paragraphs":["3676 Amazing Skills (6)","Seeing Liu Buyan’s confident appearance, he must be particularly confident about his acupuncture techniques.","As a Spirit Medicine Master, who wouldn’t want to see it?","It’s a pity that the Cloudy Qilin Clan not only moved the screen to block Liu Buyan and patient Number 23, but also sent several cultivators to guard nearby, so that no one could see anything inside.","Elder Lu stared at the movements of the silhouettes on the screen and frowned.","“This brat actually has the skills of administering golden needles! If he can cure such a disease with acupuncture, then he isn’t ordinary! No, it’s impossible! He’s just an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master, so it’s impossible for him to have such a means ! Moreover, if he’s really a disciple of some kind of Divine Doctor, he would have declared his family name when he came to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, how could he not say so until now?”","Although he found various reasons for himself in his heart and fought for a long time, he was still uneasy.","Behind the screen, there was no sound at all.","What exactly was Liu Buyan doing?","In fact, Liu Buyan was indeed administering needles to Patient Number 23. However, everyone guessed wrongly. The key to curing the disease was not his technique, but... the set of golden needles in his hand!","It was refined by Huang Yueli over these three days and nights, without sleep or rest and exhausted all her energy!","This set of golden needles was imbued with the evil qi that has been refined in Huang Yueli’s body.","Evil qi has the effect of attracting each other, and the weaker evil qi will spontaneously move towards the stronger side.","And the Number 23 cultivator in front of him was just a heaven ranked talent, and his soul was not particularly powerful. He absorbed a lot of evil qi, but he didn’t go crazy immediately, but fell into a coma. This already shows that the evil qi in the body itself was not very strong.","At least, it’s impossible to compare with what’s in Huang Yueli’s and Li Moying’s bodies.","So, if Huang Yueli came here in person, all the evil qi in Number 23 would be drawn out in less than three breaths.","Now, due to the restrictions of the competition rules, Huang Yueli could not be present in person, so she came up with this method, refined a set of golden needles, and poured her own evil qi into it to absorb the evil qi in Number 23’s dantian.","Liu Buyan originally did not believe that Huang Yueli could refine such a thing.","Even though he has witnessed Huang Yueli’s incredible skill in refining weapons countless times, the thing that Huang Yueli was going to refine now was completely unheard of!","It could be said that no such thing can be found in the entire God Realm!","It all came about based on Huang Yueli’s own ideas.","How could this be possible?","However, the two of them had no other better way, so they could only give it a try.","In the end, Huang Yueli actually made this set of golden needles!","Liu Buyan placed the jade box with seventy-two golden needles on the side of the stretcher, and gently brushed the needles with his fingers.","Immediately, he flipped his wrist, grabbed a golden needle, and stabbed it on Number 23’s forehead!","Since Number 23 was in a deep coma, he didn’t respond to the needle.","However, Liu Buyan, who was in charge of doing it, could clearly feel that when the needle tip entered the opponent’s body, a cold aura rose up from the needle point!","Liu Buyan shook his hands, and quickly released the tail of the golden needle. At the same time, the muscles on his face couldn’t help but twitch.","It turns out that that is... evil qi!","That feeling..."]},{"number":3677,"title":"Chapter 3677 Amazing Skills (7)","paragraphs":["3677 Amazing Skills (7)","Even though he had the gloves Huang Yueli gave him to protect his body, he let go very quickly, and he didn’t let any evil qi enter his body.","However, when he was approached by that cold breath, he still clearly felt dizzy and nauseated, and his body also faintly radiated a chill.","“This is really... so evil!”","Liu Buyan shuddered all over, and immediately straightened up.","Realising the danger of the evil qi, he didn’t dare to be negligent in the slightest, and became extra cautious when administering the needles.","He inserted the golden needles into various acupuncture points on Number 23’s body one by one. His technique was fast and accurate, and the time of contact with the golden needles was minimised as much as possible.","In fact, what he told Li Yuntao and the others was not entirely a lie.","Although he could never find a second set of golden needles in his hand, the technique he used to administer the needles was a technique passed down from generation to generation by the White Fen Clan, and he obtained it in the inheritance secret realm of the White Fen Clan.","This set of acupuncture methods was indeed used to enhance the efficacy of pills and speed up the circulation of profound energy in the meridians.","If not, Liu Buyan would not have dared to administer this treatment to people on such occasions based on his superficial knowledge of golden needle acupuncture that Liu Buyan had learned while he was in Soaring Heavens Continent.","Liu Buyan administered the needles behind the screen, while the others waited outside, all more excited and nervous than him.","Even Li Yuntao and the others stared at the screen closely, not even daring to take a deep breath, for fear of missing something.","After all, this Number 23 was the one whose illness was closest to Li Moying’s!","If Liu Buyan really has the ability to wake up Number 23, then there is a great possibility that he could wake Li Moying up!","However, half an hour passed, and there was still no sound behind the screen.","Li Yuntao frowned slightly, feeling a little uneasy in his heart. Although it was indeed time-consuming for the Spirit Medicine Master to administer the golden needles, it seems that there was no movement at all, so it doesn’t seem to be a normal thing, right?","“Qianyue, go ask...”","Li Yuntao raised his hand to call Li Qianyue, and was about to continue his words when a cry of pain suddenly came from behind the screen!","Pain, horror, and shock were mixed in this call, and it was really scary.","However, when Li Yuntao and the others heard this, their faces quickly revealed expressions of ecstasy!","“What’s the situation? Qianyue, hurry up and see if Young Master Liu has woken up the person?”","Li Qianyue nodded hurriedly, but before he could turn around, Li Yuntao suddenly stood up from his seat again, “Wait, I’d better go over and ask myself...”","However, even Li Yuntao’s movements were a step slower!","Li Shihong, who was sitting on the main seat, didn’t say a word, but he stood up impatiently, and appeared in front of the screen with a flash.","The guards on the side were all taken aback, but they didn’t react for a while.","No one expected that the Patriarch, who was usually aloof, would appear in front of them so suddenly and so eagerly!","Li Shihong was about to rush in, but the moment he walked in front of the screen, his feet suddenly stopped.","“Divine Divine Doctor Liu, I’m Li Shihong. I heard some noise just now, is patient Number 23 already awake? If you’ve finished with the acupuncture, can I come in and take a look?”","When everyone heard this, a sense of disobedience emerged in their hearts.","This was the Patriarch of the Ancient God Clan!","To be so polite to such a young Spirit Medicine Master, even a little cautious!"]},{"number":3678,"title":"Chapter 3678 Amazing Skills (8)","paragraphs":["3678 Amazing Skills (8)","Li Yuntao and the others were shocked when they saw the Patriarch’s attitude towards Liu Buyan.","But soon, they came to their senses as they quickly followed suit and stood behind Li Shihong.","“Patriarch, why do you have to come here in person? Let your subordinates...” Li Yuntao spoke in a low voice.","Li Shihong didn’t answer, but turned his head and stared at him which made Li Yuntao immediately shut up.","The others naturally didn’t dare to speak out, so they could only line up behind Li Shihong and wait for Liu Buyan’s response.","For a while, there was no more sound in the entire arena. Everyone held their breath and looked at the row of Cloudy Qilin Clan Elders.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, no one would have thought that they would see such a scene!","The Patriarchs and Elders of the dignified Ancient God Clan would greet a young Spirit Medicine Master with such a respectful attitude.","However, the sound behind the screen suddenly stopped again, and it took a while before some slight sounds could be heard.","Immediately, there was the sound of footsteps.","Li Shihong and the others raised their heads and looked in the direction of the screen expectantly.","The screen was pushed away from the edge, and a figure walked out from inside.","Li Shihong hurried up to meet him, and said happily: “Young Master Liu, you have really worked hard this time! I didn’t expect your medical skills to be so good...”","Halfway through his speech, his voice stopped abruptly, his eyes widened, and he stared blankly at the person in front of him.","And the person who came out was also staring at Li Shihong in a daze, with a confused expression on his face, completely unable to understand what happened.","“Huh? Isn’t this Patriarch Li? Why did you come here in person? You are too polite!” At this moment, Liu Buyan’s lazily voice came out from the screen.","He walked out slowly, saw Li Shihong staring at the man just now, couldn’t help but smile, and said: “Young Master Pei, this is the Patriarch Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If he hadn’t asked Divine Doctors from all over the world to treat you, it would be impossible for me to run into you.”","When Young Master Pei heard this, his eyes lit up, and he quickly cupped his hands to Li Shihong, and at the same time bowed to salute: “Elder Li, I am Pei Qinghe, a member of the Zephyr Feather Clan. I would like to thank Young Master Liu and your esteemed self for saving my life. If there is anything this Junior can help with, this Junior will definitely do his best to repay it!”","After hearing this, Li Shihong recognized the person all of a sudden!","Isn’t the Pei Qinghe in front of him patient Number 23?","More than half an hour ago, he was still lying on a stretcher dying, unable to move a single finger. Even his family members thought he was hopeless!","But now?","He actually... has already stood up!","Moreover, judging by his appearance, his actions were as usual, his breathing was steady, and there was nothing abnormal except that he looked very weak...","Behind Li Shihong, whether it was Li Yuntao and other Elders, or other participating Spirit Medicine Masters, they all recognized Pei Qinghe’s identity at this time.","Moreover, the expressions on their faces were exactly the same as Li Shihong’s.","They looked at him incredulously without exception!","Some people even had their mouths wide agape!","Liu Buyan actually woke up the most difficult patient Number 23!","No, no, it’s more than just being waking him up!","He was very much alive and kicking!","How could there be such a miraculous medical skill in the world?"]},{"number":3679,"title":"Chapter 3679 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (1)","paragraphs":["3679 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (1)","Everyone wanted to find out how this was accomplished and their gazes subconsciously shifted to Liu Buyan’s hand.","Just now, Liu Buyan went behind the screen in order to avoid people’s prying eyes as he administered the golden needle on Pei Qinghe.","However, at this time, his needles had already been put away, and even if everyone was blind, they still couldn’t see anything!","What’s more, the method of crossing the acupoints with the golden needle was completely under the control of the Spirit Medicine Master. Even if you see Liu Buyan administering the needle with your own eyes, if you don’t understand the mental method he used, one would still not be able to comprehend it.","After Pei Qinghe expressed his gratitude, he waited for Li Shihong and the others to express their views.","As a result, everyone looked at him and Liu Buyan without speaking.","This made him even more confused, and looked left and right strangely, “Patriarch Li, what’s going on? Is there something wrong with this Junior?”","Li Shihong just woke up like a dream, and hurriedly said: “No, no, Young Master Pei, there is nothing wrong! You don’t have to thank me, we are also trying to save the Young Patriarch of our clan. This is a matter of mutual benefit. Come, please bring Young Master Pei to the guest room to have a good rest!”","The maids came over in response, and made a gesture of invitation to Pei Qinghe.","To be honest, Pei Qinghe was still a little confused and at a loss. However, he was a guest after all. Although he felt strange, he still followed the maids and left as promised.","Li Shihong strode forward, facing Liu Buyan, unable to restrain the excitement in his heart, “Young Master Liu, I didn’t expect you to have such amazing medical skills at such a young age! Even surpassing the top of countless gods. You are really a Divine Doctor! Your performance today really opened my eyes! If we were rude in any way over the past few days, please forgive us!”","Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, “Patriarch Li, you are too polite, you are too polite!”","Although the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s competition was still very fair, the stewards and cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan have the arrogance ingrained in them, thinking of their own lineage from aristocratic families, hence they had not been too polite to Liu Buyan over the past few days.","If it was Liu Buyan’s usual behaviour, he would put on airs and make things difficult for Li Shihong.","However, thinking that this person was Li Moying’s benefactor, Liu Buyan could only let this opportunity go.","It wasn’t until this time that the onlookers outside the venue understood it one after another.","All of a sudden, there were exclamations one after another.","Many people couldn’t even believe what they saw with their own eyes!","“I...I can’t be dreaming, right? Number 23...hasn’t he been in a coma for several months and was on the verge of death? How long has it been, and he can walk on his own already?”","“Did I make a mistake? Could it be that I was dreaming too? This is simply impossible?”","“No, it’s true... That Young Master Liu looks very young, yet he has such high medical skills!”","“This... I still can’t believe it! Could it be that Liu Buyan did something secretly? Didn’t Elder Lu keep saying that Young Master Liu has bad character and likes to cheat in competitions?”","“Damn! Do you still believe what that villain said? This was a patient brought by the Cloudy Qilin Clan himself! Can Liu Buyan play tricks under the eyes of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? His medical skills are so high, and he can save people. What’s the truth, everyone has seen it! As for the slanderous words, I think Elder Lu was jealous of his high medical skills, so he deliberately discredited him!”"]},{"number":3680,"title":"Chapter 3680 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (2)","paragraphs":["3680 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (2)","Huang Yueli was listening at the side, and couldn’t help but raise the corners of her mouth.","There were many people who questioned Liu Buyan’s medical skills before, but after he showed his edge, most people’s impression of him suddenly changed!","Sure enough, strength was the best way to fight back against rumours!","Outside the arena, it was extremely noisy at this moment. However, no one in the arena noticed this.","Facing Liu Buyan, Li Shihong said eagerly: “Divine Doctor Liu doesn’t have to be humble, the first place in this competition is none other than you! Please stay in Amethyst Paramount Palace for a while longer, my clan’s Li Moying has been in a coma for more than a month, and his symptoms are the same as that of Young Master Pei just now, so please take care of him!”","Liu Buyan chuckled, “Well...Since I signed up for this competition, it’s naturally my duty to attend to Young Master Li.”","When Li Shihong heard him pause at first, he thought he was dissatisfied and that he was unwilling to treat Li Moying, so he was extremely nervous.","After hearing to the end, he was finally relieved.","“In this case, on behalf of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, thank you! Don’t worry, as long as you can save Moying, the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan will regard you as our guest of honour in the future. If there is any trouble, we can help you!”","Li Shihong said, nodded to Liu Buyan and said, “Young Master Liu, please stay with us in Amethyst Paramount Palace for a while. I have already arranged for you the best courtyard, which is in behind the mountain. You will love...”","Li Shihong turned around, intending to take him into Amethyst Paramount Palace himself.","Seeing this, all the Elders took a few steps back and stood respectfully by the side.","To be honest, some people were not quite willing to let their powerful masters of the Dao Profound Realm make way for a weak young Spirit Medicine Master!","However, seeing that Li Shihong was so cautious and polite to Liu Buyan, they didn’t dare to show any dissatisfaction.","The Spirit Medicine Masters all stared at Liu Buyan with envious eyes.","As a Spirit Medicine Master, wasn’t that the goal of their life’s struggle?","Shocking the entire God Realm with his own medical skills!","Even the Patriarch of the Ancient God Clan personally came to invite him to heal. In order to make him feel better, even all the Elders in the clan had to make way for him!","Liu Buyan, this brat was really lucky! It was impossible not to envy him!","Elder Lu gritted his teeth even more. He felt that blood was coming from his mouth. He was jealous and depressed at the same time!","Liu Buyan, he actually woke that person up! How was that possible? How could he do such a thing?","Moreover, he even did it so well that the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, who has always been so arrogant, treat him so courteously!","Li Shihong has never looked directly at him, Elder Lu!","This gap was really too big!","Everyone felt that Liu Buyan had reached the pinnacle of his life, and everyone wished to replace Liu Buyan and stand in his place.","However, to everyone’s surprise, after Liu Buyan followed Li Shihong to the entrance of Amethyst Paramount Palace, his footsteps suddenly stopped.","Li Shihong took a few steps forward, and found that Liu Buyan hadn’t followed him, so he couldn’t help being stunned for a moment, “Young Master Liu?”","Liu Buyan turned around and looked up at the crowd outside the arena."]},{"number":3681,"title":"Chapter 3681 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (3)","paragraphs":["3681 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (3)","“Young Master Liu? What’s the matter with you? It’s getting late, and a banquet has been prepared in the main hall, please be sure to appreciate it...”","Li Shihong’s polite words were interrupted with Liu Buyan raising his hand.","Li Shihong frowned inwardly.","In his capacity, it has been a long time since a junior has been so disrespectful to him. However, he could not get angry with Liu Buyan, because he was more worried that Liu Buyan would suddenly go back on his word and refuse to give Li Moying treatment.","Although Liu Buyan has already made a promise just now, if he really wants to go back on his word, or if he wants to offer some extremely harsh conditions at a low price, then the Cloudy Qilin Clan has no other choice. coerced by him.","After all, Li Moying’s life was a priceless treasure to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, no matter what the price was, it was worth it!","Fortunately, Liu Buyan did not behave as he feared.","He turned his head to look, frowned, and said to Li Shihong: “Patriarch Li, this time I came to Arcane City, not alone, but with my Junior Sister! To tell you the truth, my Junior Sister’s medical skills are also very good, but she is shy by nature and doesn’t like to participate in such kinds of public competition. Young Master Li’s condition is serious, and I still need my Junior Sister’s assistance with the diagnosis and treatment, so I have to trouble Patriarch Li Help me pick my Junior Sister up!”","When Li Shihong heard this, he was pleasantly surprised!","He was already very, very happy to have such a Divine Doctor as Liu Buyan. Unexpectedly, Liu Buyan actually bought one and got one free, and brought a Junior Sister with outstanding medical skills!","This was what he wished for most!","Li Shihong was overjoyed, and hurriedly agreed, “It should be, it should be! Divine Doctor Liu, don’t worry, your Junior Sister was also a guest of our Cloudy Qilin Clan, and I will send someone to invite her right away. I just don’t know... where is she now? ”","Liu Buyan said: “Junior Sister should just have watched me compete in the crowd! She is a very beautiful woman, wearing a light purple silk long dress, and also has my Spirit Medicine Master’s badge in her hand. You can just use that for verification.”","Li Shihong turned his head to look at Li Yuntao beside him.","Li Yuntao understood immediately, and personally took his disciples to find her in the crowd.","Only then was Liu Buyan satisfied, and followed Li Shihong into the Amethyst Paramount Palace.","Li Yuntao hurried through the crowd, trying to find out the woman in the long purple dress.","It’s a pity that there were too many people, and everyone in the venue was about to leave at this time. The scene was extremely chaotic, even if people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan came out to maintain order, it was useless.","Li Yuntao led a group of people and searched around for two hours, but failed to find the woman in purple.","During this period, Li Shihong sent people to urge him several times, and Li Yuntao broke out in a sweat, but if he couldn’t find it, he couldn’t find it!","He was so angry that he even scolded Li Qianyue, his favourite big disciple!","“How can you be so useless! You can’t even find a person! A woman in a purple dress with a Spirit Medicine Master’s badge on her. Such a person is outstanding. As long as you look carefully, how can you not find it? It seems that you are not paying attention at all, are you? Get lost and look properly!”","Li Shihong was so anxious that he was about to lose his temper.","He was very aware of the importance of this matter.","What Liu Buyan said just now meant that if he couldn’t find his Junior Sister, he wouldn’t be able to treat Li Moying’s illness!"]},{"number":3682,"title":"Chapter 3682 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (4)","paragraphs":["3682 The Pinnacle Of Life For A Spirit Medicine Master (4)","Although they didn’t know whether what Liu Buyan said was true or not, but now, no matter what Liu Buyan said, Li Shihong would nod in agreement, let alone such a trivial matter as finding his Junior Sister?","Besides, if this kind of trivial matter can’t be done well, it will only appear that the Cloudy Qilin Clan was not capable enough.","At this time, Li Shihong was sitting in the main hall with Liu Buyan.","The table in front of him was already filled with delicacies, but Liu Buyan didn’t even look at these dishes, just holding a teacup and waiting silently.","Although he didn’t urge him, Li Shihong knew that Liu Buyan was getting impatient.","The waiter at the door hurried in, and Li Shihong’s eyes lit up immediately, “How was it? Did you find someone?”","The waiter lowered his head and said in fear: “Report to the Patriarch, the person...hasn’t...hasn’t been found...”","Li Shihong was so angry that he slapped the table hard, and said angrily, “What’s going on? Why can’t you find anyone?”","“Uh, Elder Tao said that there are too many people watching the competition today...”","“A lot, a lot, what do you mean by a lot?” Li Shihong said angrily: “It’s only tens of thousands of people, but can it be called a lot? Every time the God Realm fights, the number of people watching is tens or hundreds of times that of today’s, and I have never heard of it. What kind of trouble will happen! No one can be found here, and the Elder Li Yuntao doesn’t have to do it!”","Li Shihong’s face flushed with anger, and the waiters all knelt on the ground with a thump, not daring to make a sound.","Li Shihong wanted to say something more, but out of the corner of his eye, he saw Liu Buyan who was sitting on the ground, so he suppressed his anger and waved his hand to send the waiters away.","“Go and urge me again! Tell Li Yunhai to bring someone to look for him! Tell them brothers, even if the entire Arcane City was turned over tonight, they must be found for me!”","Seeing the waiters retreat in a panic, Li Shihong turned to Liu Buyan and sighed.","“Divine Divine Doctor Liu, I really made you laugh. It’s really outrageous that you can’t even find anyone. But please rest assured, as long as your Junior Sister is in Arcane City, nothing will happen. She may have been lost in the large crowd but they will definitely find her by tonight.”","Liu Buyan put down his teacup, and said in a cold voice: “I hope so.”","Li Shihong was afraid that he would be worried, so he said a lot of words to comfort him.","Liu Buyan’s long eyelashes drooped down, covering the emotions in his eyes and preventing Li Shihong from seeing the flashing smile in his eyes.","Li Shihong thought that he was worried that Huang Yueli would be unsafe if she was alone outside, but in fact, he had no such worries at all.","Huang Yueli has always been the only one who bullies others. Who could bully her? Dare to play tricks on her, that person must have ate a bear’s heart and a leopard’s guts! That person wouldn’t even know how he died in the end.","For example, this Elder Li Yuntao!","Without even thinking, Liu Buyan figured that he had been screwed by Huang Yueli!","He was 90% sure that Huang Yueli hid on purpose so that they couldn’t find anyone, just waiting for Li Yuntao to be scolded!","In fact, Liu Buyan did not guess wrong.","At this moment, Huang Yueli was sitting in an elegant seat on the second floor of a tea house close to Amethyst Paramount Palace, eating melon seeds, while idly looking at the street downstairs, Li Yuntao was scurrying around like a headless fly, Holding the portrait in person, he walked around the streets to inquire about the whereabouts of the woman in the portrait."]},{"number":3683,"title":"Chapter 3683 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (1)","paragraphs":["3683 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (1)","And she had gone back to the inn a long time ago to change her clothes, and now she was wearing a crimson red dress instead of a light purple dress!","Even on her face, she deliberately put on a little more rouge, which looked quite different from the portrait.","Only ghosts were the only ones who could find her!","However, seeing that it was getting late, she thought about it, and she didn’t plan to continue watching an all-night show here.","!!","It’s really happy to see Li Yuntao’s misfortune, but her husband was still waiting for her to save him! This was a top priority that cannot be delayed!","Huang Yueli casually threw the shells of the melon seeds that she just ate——","“What??”","“Damn it! Where did the melon seed shells come from?”","“Don’t you want to live? How dare you throw melon seeds on top of the Cloudy Qilin Clan??”","“Who did it? Come out here!”","Everyone in the teahouse looked at Huang Yueli with sympathetic eyes, thinking that this girl was definitely going to be in trouble!","In Arcane City, no one can offend the Cloudy Qilin Clan if they offend anyone! Usually no one dared to speak loudly when talking to members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but now this girl poured a whole pot of melon seed shells on their heads!","Moreover, she seemed to have a death wish, those discarded melon seed shells fell on top of Elder Li Yuntao!","It seems that she will never see the sun tomorrow!","“Did you hear that? Get out of here quickly! Otherwise, everyone in the teahouse will sit together!”","Hearing the noise from downstairs, the faces of other guests were also a bit ugly, and someone couldn’t help but urged: “Girl, we all saw the melon seed shell you threw just now, please go down now! This kind of thing, even if you want to deny it, you can’t deny it...”","After Huang Yueli finished her last sip of tea, she put down her cup and glanced at this person lightly.","“Go down? Sure, I’ll go down. When did I say I wouldn’t go down?”","With that said, she stood up, stretched lazily under the eager and anxious eyes of everyone, and then walked to the first floor without haste.","Downstairs, Li Yuntao was full of anger, with his hands back, in a very awkward posture, he was picking out the broken shells of melon seeds that had fallen into his collar.","As an esteemed Elder of the Ancient God Clan, he actually had melon seed shells sprinkled on his head, not to mention how embarrassing he was. His first reaction was to quickly remove the melon seed shells from his hair and collar.","However, melon seed shells are small things in the first place, the more anxious they were to get rid of them, the more they fell into the collar and fell directly into Li Yuntao’s clothes.","On the melon seed shell, there was a handful of itching powder that Huang Yueli casually sprinkled, which immediately caused a large red and itchy rash on Li Yuntao’s back.","This time, it was really enough for Li Yuntao, he wanted to scratch his back, but he couldn’t make it too ugly because of his identity, and the melon seed shells inside his clothes kept falling. When it fell off, all the rubbed skin developed red rashes, and the situation became more and more serious.","Li Yuntao stretched out his hands for a while, and bent down again for a while. He scratched his ears and cheeks, and was entangled to the extreme. It was like having a convulsion.","“Master, you ... what’s wrong?”","Li Qianyue saw this scene from a distance, and walked forward quickly, wanting to help, but didn’t know where to start.","Moreover, Li Yuntao’s current state was really too weird, as if he had gone crazy!"]},{"number":3684,"title":"Chapter 3684 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (2)","paragraphs":["3684 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (2)","Li Qianyue wasn’t sure what happened to him, so he didn’t dare to approach him.","Li Yuntao saw that he still dared to back away, and shouted angrily: “Didn’t you see that thing with no eyes just poured the melon seed shells on my head? Why don’t you hurry up and help me get those damned melon seed shells out of the way? Hurry!”","“Huh? But...”","Li Qianyue hesitated at first, because he really couldn’t figure out how to get those melon seed shells out. So much has fallen into the clothes behind Li Yuntao, unless he took off his clothes now, otherwise, how could it be possible to get out?","!!","However, seeing Li Yuntao’s expression that he was about to explode on the spot, he really didn’t dare to speak out what was in his heart, so he could only nod submissively and said, “Yes... yes! This disciple will immediately think of a way, think of a way...”","Li Qianyue hurriedly ran behind Li Yuntao.","Li Yuntao saw that the others were not pleasing to the eye, and roared angrily: “What are you all doing standing there? Why don’t you hurry up and catch that guy who littered!”","The young cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were already stunned by the sudden change, but at this moment they suddenly came back to their senses, turned around quickly and wanted to rush to the teahouse.","At this moment, a figure walked down the stairs slowly, holding onto the stairs.","“Everyone, are you looking for me?” A maiden’s voice which had a tinge of laughter resounded.","When everyone looked up, they were all slightly taken aback.","Although Huang Yueli deliberately changed her disguise, the change was not large, and she had no intention of continuing to act ugly, so at this time she still looked like an exceptional beauty.","The young cultivators were overwhelmed by her beauty, and didn’t realise it for a while. She was the culprit that caused Li Yuntao to be so crazy!","However, Li Yuntao didn’t have the heart to admire any beauties.","Now he was so itchy that he could hardly control himself, and he was about to tear the clothes on his back.","At the same time, he can’t wait to tear the people who throw melon seed shells into pieces!","Seeing a person coming down from upstairs, he didn’t even see the other person’s face clearly, so he pointed at her and shouted angrily, “Hurry up and take down that thing that doesn’t have eyes!”","When the young cultivators heard the words, none of them obeyed immediately, but looked at the people around them hesitantly.","Such a beautiful girl really doesn’t look like a litterer!","Elder Tao couldn’t have made a mistake, right?","“What are you still doing in a daze? I searched all day today but couldn’t find anyone, and now I’m asking you to catch that bastard who threw the melon seeds shells at me, but you can’t do it? What’s the use of you bastards?”","Seeing that they were not moving, Li Yuntao became even more annoyed!","The cultivators had no choice but to go to Huang Yueli’s side, but seeing such a delicate beauty, none of them had the heart to be rough on her, but said very politely: “Girl, someone threw a pot of melon seed shells upstairs just now. Did you see who threw it?”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, and said, “I saw it!”","The cultivators’ eyes lit up, and they hurriedly asked: “Did you see it? Then you should quickly identify the person! Our Elder is very angry this time! This person is going to be in trouble!”","Everyone stared at Huang Yueli, waiting for her to identify the culprit.","They just said, how could the beauty in front of them do such a shameless thing?"]},{"number":3685,"title":"Chapter 3685 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (3)","paragraphs":["3685 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (3)","However, Huang Yueli smiled again, and said very calmly: “I was the one who threw out that plate of melon seed shells just now!”","“What??” The cultivators all looked confused.","Li Qianyue also said: “Girl, you... If you haven’t done such a thing, don’t admit it indiscriminately! To tell you the truth, we are members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. The culprit who did that will up up miserable in our Elder’s hands.”","Huang Yueli still had a relaxed and comfortable smile, and said unhurriedly: “What I said is the truth! When I heard such a loud commotion downstairs, I thought some hooligans were fighting and causing trouble on the street. That’s why I threw the melon seed shells, wanting to warn them! Unexpectedly, it was actually thrown on the Elder of the Cloudy Qilin Clan...”","The cultivators were stunned when they heard this.","However, Li Qianyue and the others all showed terrified expressions. When they heard her opening remarks, they kept winking at Huang Yueli, trying to make her shut up quickly!","This beauty was so courageous that she even dares to say such a thing!","She even compared the esteemed Elder of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to a local hooligan!","Didn’t you see that Li Yuntao was so angry that his entire face was red? How dare she add fuel to the fire like this! Was she really brave, or simply stupid?","It’s a pity that the eyes of those cultivators were almost cramping, but they couldn’t stop Huang Yueli from finishing her sentence.","Li Qianyue hurriedly turned his head to look at Li Yuntao. As expected, Li Yuntao’s complexion had turned to a liver color, the bloodshot eyes were clearly visible, and even the profound power in his body was a little out of control!","He was on the verge of breaking out!","Li Qianyue was already very afraid of Li Yuntao. Seeing his appearance, he originally wanted to plead for Huang Yueli, but now he did not dare to utter a single word.","Li Yuntao suppressed the discomfort in his back, gritted his teeth, and said with a sneer: “Alright, alright! Very good! It turns out that in your eyes, our dignified ancient gods are hooligans! You just admitted that you deliberately wanted to harm me, the evidence is conclusive! Someone, arrest her and put her in the dungeon! I must let her know what price she will pay for insulting the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","The aura around Li Yuntao was released. Under the coercion of the Dao Profound Realm powerhouse, all the cultivators present felt a huge sense of oppression. They lowered their heads one by one, not daring to even breath loudly.","At the same time, everyone cast a sympathetic glance at Huang Yueli.","In fact, when the Cloudy Qilin Clan was yelling about on the street just now, while they stopped people and questioned them, many cultivators were dissatisfied, thinking that the clan was too arrogant and domineering.","However, no one dared to speak out like Huang Yueli.","Now, finally, someone dared to tell the truth, and taught Li Yuntao a lesson. She did such a gratifying thing, but in the end... what awaits this little girl will be an extremely miserable ending...","Li Yuntao felt that his disciples were not obedient enough, so he went up to him himself, trying to tie Huang Yueli up.","However, Huang Yueli took a step back at the right time, but just avoided his attack.","Li Yuntao was stunned for a moment, obviously he didn’t expect that a mere teenage girl would have such skill!","He became even more angry, and stepped forward to arrest her personally.","However, just as he was about to touch Huang Yueli’s wrist, he suddenly felt something in his hand, only to find that what he was grasping was a cold and hard badge!"]},{"number":3686,"title":"Chapter 3686 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (4)","paragraphs":["3686 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (4)","“What’s this?”","Li Yuntao felt that something was wrong, and immediately turned pale with shock. His first reaction was that Huang Yueli threw out a hidden weapon!","With a flick of his wrist, he was about to throw the badge out.","However, at this moment, Huang Yueli chuckled lightly and said, “Elder Tao, if I were you, I would definitely not throw away this Spirit Medicine Master badge. If you really want to do this, you have to think about it carefully!”","Li Yuntao had already thrown the badge into the air, but suddenly he heard the words “Spirit Medicine Master badge”. His mind buzzed, and his body reacted faster than his mind. A wave of profound force wrapped around the badge, abruptly The raw land rolled it back before it hit the ground!","“What? What did you say? What Spirit Medicine Master badge?” Li Yuntao asked in shock.","Huang Yueli didn’t answer, but smiled and raised her chin, signaling Li Yuntao to look at the item in his hands.","Li Yuntao looked down and almost jumped up!","What he had in his hand was the badge of an earth-ranked Spirit Medicine Master!","Trembling, he turned the badge over. On the golden badge, Liu Buyan’s name was clearly written.","“This...is this the Spirit Medicine Master badge of Doctor Liu?” Li Yuntao widened his eyes, looked at the small badge in his hand, and couldn’t believe it, “Impossible? This...where did you get it?” What? How could the badge of Divine Doctor Liu be in your hand? This... this must be a fake!”","Huang Yueli’s eyes looked like she was looking at an idiot, “I’m not capable of forging a Spirit Medicine Master badge in such a short period of time! If you have any doubts, you can take it to the Heaven Elixir Pagoda to verify it. Let’s see if it’s true or not!”","What Huang Yueli said was so sure, she didn’t have any guilty conscience at all.","Li Yuntao observed the expression on her face and had to admit that the possibility of her lying was very small.","But, if this was really Liu Buyan’s badge, then the only reason why it appears here is...","“You...you are Divine Doctor Liu’s Junior Sister??”","Huang Yueli nodded, and said: “If your so-called Divine Doctor Liu is the owner of this badge, then yes, he was my Senior Brother!”","Li Yuntao still didn’t quite believe it, frowned, and asked suspiciously: “But... But, Doctor Liu clearly said that his Junior Sister was wearing a long lavender dress, and you don’t look quite like the one in the portrait. ...”","He subconsciously turned his head and looked at the portrait in the hands of a Cloudy Qilin Clan disciple.","Huang Yueli also glanced in that direction, and then said with a half-smile, “This portrait was drawn by a member of your Cloudy Qilin Clan, right?”","Li Yuntao was taken aback, “How do you know?”","Huang Yueli said as a matter of course: “My brother is not only good at medical skills, he is even a master in painting! If he were to paint my portrait, how could he draw so poorly? It doesn’t look like me at all. Unexpectedly, the Cloudy Qilin Clan, as an ancient god clan that has been passed down for hundreds of thousands of years, can’t even find anyone who can draw!”","Li Yuntao was so angry that he almost vomited blood again!","Huang Yueli’s mouth was really too poisonous!","Actually, through a portrait, the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan was despised!","According to Li Yuntao’s temper, he couldn’t bear such a thing, but he couldn’t get angry with Huang Yueli now, and he didn’t even dare to say anything harsh!"]},{"number":3687,"title":"Chapter 3687 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (5)","paragraphs":["3687 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (5)","After all, this was Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister!","If he said something wrong and offended the girl in front of him and she complained about him to Liu Buyan, God knows if Liu Buyan would go back on his word and refuse to treat Li Moying?","If he was the person who caused the delay of healing Young Master’s illness, the other elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will eat him alive!","In desperation, Li Yuntao could only grit his teeth and swallow this forcibly!","“It seems that our artist did not paint well. He didn’t even paint the charm of Young Miss Li. It also caused a misunderstanding between us. I will definitely punish him when I go back!”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, and said, “So, Elder Tao doesn’t intend to hold me accountable for throwing melon seed shells?”","Li Yuntao hurriedly shook his head, “What do you mean by holding you accountable? Young Miss Li, you did a great job of throwing the melon seed shells. If it weren’t for the help of your pot of melon seed shells, we would not have found you! The clan’s stinky boys are really too incompetent, you are sitting in the tea house, and they haven’t found anyone! Everyone should be punished!”","He glanced coldly at a group of young disciples of the Cloudy Qilin Clan behind him.","Li Qianyue and the others lowered their heads one after another, as if humbly admitting their mistakes, but they couldn’t help but murmur in their hearts.","This teahouse was the largest one near Amethyst Paramount Palace, and it couldn’t be more conspicuous. Moreover, it’s normal for people watching the competition to drink tea here when they leave. It’s the place where Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister was most likely to stay.","How could they have missed such an important place?","In fact, they have been in and out of this teahouse seven or eight times in a row, and every time they have shown that portrait to everyone in the teahouse!","However, Huang Yueli just didn’t respond at all, and didn’t admit that she was the person they were looking for!","Li Yuntao was already full of anger because of the melon seed shells, but now he can’t get angry at Huang Yueli, so he can only vent his anger on these young disciples!","Hence, they were at ones who suffered a relentless barrage of scolding.","Someone was young and energetic, unconvinced, he couldn’t help but raised his head, and retorted: “Elder Tao, you really can’t blame us! We went to the teahouse to see it just now, and I personally took the portrait to show Young Miss Li, and even told her that we are looking for the Junior Sister who was the champion of today’s medicinal pill competition! It was impossible for her not to know that we are looking for her, but she did not admit her identity!”","As soon as this person spoke, the scene immediately fell silent.","His fellow disciples all subconsciously glanced at him, and were very speechless towards this kid.","Who doesn’t know about this? However, everyone knows the seriousness of the matter, and the most important thing now was to bring Young Miss Li back as soon as possible!","How dare he jump out and criticize Young Miss Li!","When Li Yuntao heard this, he was so angry that he almost choked!","He had guessed for a long time that Huang Yueli hid on purpose to watch their jokes. However, guessing was nothing but guessing. Being directly pointed out by someone was another matter. He was 30% angry, but suddenly became 80%!","However, he quickly remembered his responsibilities, suppressed his breath, and turned to Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, this brat is really out of his mind, how dare he slander you like that! Don’t worry, as an Elder, I will ensure that he’ll be severely punished!”"]},{"number":3688,"title":"Chapter 3688 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (6)","paragraphs":["3688 The Hateful Melon Seed Shells (6)","Huang Yueli simply stood there as she watched the farce before her and the smile on her face did not change at all.","In fact, no matter whether it was the young man who suddenly jumped out to accuse her, or Li Yuntao reluctantly lowered his head, it seemed to have no effect on her emotions.","Huang Yueli glanced at the aggrieved young man lightly, and said , “What are you punishing him for? He didn’t lie? I did see the portrait, but I didn’t follow them down.”","“Young Miss Li, you are...” Li Yuntao never expected that Huang Yueli would say this, and immediately froze.","“Why didn’t you tell them your identity? If we knew that you were here, we wouldn’t have to look for you everywhere and search like headless flies!”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, and said with an innocent face: “Why should I tell you? My Senior Brother said that there are many bad guys out there. So when going out, especially more so for a weak woman like me who has no strength to restrain a chicken, it’s even more important to be careful. Who knows what you are looking for me for? Seeing that you are yelling and screaming about, you are obviously not a good person!”","“You... you...!”","This time, Li Yuntao wasn’t about to vomit blood, but he really vomited blood!","The red lump on his back was still itching to death, but he used all his willpower to not immediately take off his clothes and roll on the ground, but managed to stand still and talk to Huang Yueli here.","Most of the profound energy in his body was used to suppress the lump on his back. Being provoked one after another, the circulation of profound energy was affected. Caught off guard, a mouthful of blood spurted out!","Seeing that Li Yuntao’s face turned blue and he could not stand still, his disciples rushed up and surrounded him anxiously.","“Master, what’s wrong with you?”","“Elder Tao, what... what’s going on? Could it be that something happened during your cultivation yesterday?”","“Then what should we do? It’s easy to leave damage to the meridians if you cultivate so carelessly!”","His symptoms looked like he had Qi Deviation and had gone crazy.","The young Cloudy Qilin disciples were more or less knowledgeable. After recognizing these symptoms, they were all anxious, and the scene became even more out of control.","Huang Yueli watched coldly from the side, and secretly sneered.","It’s just vomiting blood. Was a dignified elder of the Ancient God Clan so fragile? Who was he trying to fool by pretending to be pitiful by putting on this look?","Did he think that by doing this, it would make her feel guilty?","Heh, she still remembers how Li Yuntao made the choice when Li Moying and her were both seriously injured at the entrance to the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow!","In the eyes of these so-called superior God Clan elders, the life of a human girl was worthless!","Huang Yueli’s eyes were icy cold, and she really wanted to add more fire, and directly drive Li Yuntao to death here.","However, seeing that it was getting late, she was still worried about Li Moying’s condition, so she decided to let him go today.","Huang Yueli took a few steps forward, stopped beside Li Yuntao, and said in a cold voice: “Elder, didn’t you just say that my Senior Brother is looking for me? Where is he, when will I see him? If you’re not here to bring me to meet him, then I don’t have time to waste time here with you, I’ll take a step first!”","With that said, she turned around and pretended to leave.","When Li Yuntao saw it, his face turned green."]},{"number":3689,"title":"Chapter 3689 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (1)","paragraphs":["3689 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (1)","He did so much just now, from vomiting blood to pretending to faint, he used so many low-handed methods that he used to disdain, in the end, all of them were for nothing!","Young Miss Li acted as if she hadn’t seen it at all, she didn’t even frown.","Seeing that Huang Yueli was really going to leave, Li Yuntao couldn’t pretend anymore, so he quickly got up from the ground.","“Young Miss Li, please stop quickly! We are definitely not lying to you. Your Senior Brother is very worried about your safety and has been looking for you! We will take you to find Divine Divine Doctor Liu right now. You should come with us, don’t let your Senior Brother worry!”","Huang Yueli showed an apprehensive expression, “But Elder Tao, don’t you have an internal injury?”","“It’s not a problem, it’s not a problem! It’s just a little bit of injury, it’s not a problem at all, it’s because my disciples couldn’t hold back and made a big fuss, making Young Miss Li laugh!”","Li Yuntao was so angry that he almost vomited blood at Huang Yueli’s sarcastic remarks.","He gritted his teeth and held back, and placed all the blame on the disciples’ heads again.","This time, even the kid who didn’t have eyes just now knew how powerful he was, so he didn’t dare to say anything casually, and silently bowed his head to bear the charge of making a fuss.","Only then did Huang Yueli nod her head, and said, “If that’s the case, I’ll trouble Elder Tao to lead the way.”","Li Yuntao forced a smile that was uglier than crying, and personally sent Huang Yueli into the carriage.","In the main hall of Amethyst Paramount Palace.","The sumptuous dishes on the table had been reheated three times, but Liu Buyan still only focused on drinking tea and refused to move his chopsticks. He resolutely stated that he must wait until his Junior Sister appeared.","“Why does it take so long to find someone? My Junior Sister is young and beautiful. I’m really worried...” Liu Buyan made a sad expression on purpose.","But he was secretly sighing in his heart, his Junior Sister...could be a little too ruthless!","It’s been so long and she still hasn’t shown up yet. He didn’t know how long she would take to play with Li Yuntao and the others!","Seeing his expression like this, Li Shihong felt even more dissatisfied with Li Yuntao in his heart. If Liu Buyan was not still sitting here, he would have wished to go out and find someone in person!","“Come on, hurry up! Tell Li Yuntao...”","Halfway through the conversation, a steward hurried in from the outside, directly knocked open the main hall door, and before he could catch his breath, he couldn’t wait to speak: “Clan...Patriarch, Elder Tao, he...he... ”","“What happened to him? Did you find anyone?”","Hearing this person’s hesitant words, Li Shihong stood up all of a sudden, and asked eagerly.","The steward nodded vigorously.","Li Shihong finally showed joy, and clapped his palms vigorously, “Then why are you still standing there? Hurry up and invite Young Miss Li to come in?”","“Yes... yes... Elder Tao has already brought people over...”","While speaking, a sound of footsteps came from the end of the corridor.","Li Yuntao walked in front, his footsteps were so fast that he almost wanted to run.","However, after he walked a few steps, he had to stop again and turned to look behind him.","Because, no matter how impatient he was, Huang Yueli always walked behind him unhurriedly. Although the speed was not very slow, it was definitely not fast!","In Li Yuntao’s eyes, it was no different from a snail crawling.","“Young Miss Li, can I trouble you to hurry up? Our Patriarch is urging you!”","Hearing Li Shihong’s voice from the main hall, Li Yuntao was so impatient!"]},{"number":3690,"title":"Chapter 3690 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (2)","paragraphs":["3690 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (2)","It took so long to find this little girl today, and Li Shihong urged him so many times, it was obvious that he was getting impatient. If he continued to procrastinate, the consequences would definitely be serious.","However, it was useless just because he was anxious, Huang Yueli didn’t seem to understand his difficulties at all, and asked innocently: “Elder Tao, why are you walking so fast? Much better than me, I am such a weak woman, how can I keep up with you?”","Li Yuntao was choked yet again.","Huang Yueli’s words were too reasonable!","This little girl looks weak, and she is also a Spirit Medicine Master. Her cultivation level would definitely not be very good. It was normal for her to be unable to keep up with him.","Li Yuntao originally had a lot of things to say, but now he couldn’t say anything. He could only suppress his anger with all his strength, and watched Huang Yueli walk forward, little by little.","The corridor of Amethyst Paramount Palace was very long, and it took a lot of time to walk from the entrance to the main hall.","Li Yuntao was so anxious that he broke out in sweat, and he waited until Huang Yueli walked to the gate.","He quickly pushed open the door of the main hall, and walked in quickly.","“Patriarch, Divine Divine Doctor Liu, I’ve already found Young Miss Li! Young Miss Li, your Senior Brother is here, and he’s very worried about you!”","Seeing Li Yuntao who was sweating profusely, Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, then turned to look at Huang Yueli behind him.","His gaze fell on Huang Yueli’s face, and he couldn’t help but freeze.","It wasn’t until Huang Yueli blinked at him that Liu Buyan came back to his senses!","His Junior Sister’s disguise technique was really amazing! I don’t know what she did, but it’s completely different from the portrait he asked people to draw!","You know, he had seen that portrait before, and the artist’s level was very high. With just a few words, he painted Huang Yueli’s charm to about ninety percent...","In the end, all these efforts were in vain!","Huang Yueli changed her clothes and casually changed her makeup, which was completely different from the one in the portrait.","Liu Buyan looked at Huang Yueli, then at Li Yuntao, and shook his head secretly.","One can tell at a glance that Li Yuntao had been abused by his Junior Sister so badly! Even he felt a little sympathy for that guy!","Li Shihong was taken aback when he saw Huang Yueli, “This...” He turned to look at Liu Buyan, “Young Master Liu, is this your Junior Sister?”","He could also see that Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister looked different from the portrait.","Liu Buyan nodded, “That’s right! Junior Sister, where have you gone? I’m so worried! You’re a girl, it’s too unsafe to be outside at night!”","He put on a worried look, and he really looked like a good brother who was worried about the safety of his Junior Sister.","Seeing how cooperative he was, Huang Yueli immediately put on a frightened look, and said pitifully, “Senior Brother, I’m sorry, I was accidentally squeezed out by the crowd and lost my way! I even met a bunch of bad guys! Thanks to Elder Tao who brought someone to rescue me, if it was later, I’m afraid it would be even more dangerous!”","Li Shihong heaved a sigh of relief after hearing this.","Fortunately, it’s good that he didn’t find the wrong person! At least he found Divine Doctor Liu’s Junior Sister!","But when he heard the back, he couldn’t help feeling a little angry, and turned towards Li Yuntao in dissatisfaction.","Look, it scares the girls like this!","If Li Yuntao’s ability was stronger, he could have found him earlier, and Young Miss Li would not have been frightened by these things!"]},{"number":3691,"title":"Chapter 3691 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (3)","paragraphs":["3691 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (3)","Li Shihong thought so in his heart, but he didn’t say anything.","Telling this matter will only make Liu Buyan dissatisfied. Since Liu Buyan didn’t notice, he doesn’t need to remind the other party.","However, when Li Yuntao saw Li Shihong’s eyes, he suddenly understood what he was thinking, and couldn’t help crying out in his heart!","Did you make a mistake? That stinky girl must have pretended too much, right?","What kind of little white flower was she pretending to be? She was clearly a tricky and hateful little girl!","Just now she was sitting in the teahouse drinking tea leisurely, taking them as a joke, and even threw the melon seed shell into his clothes! Everyone was played around by her!","Weak? Where was she weak?","Still afraid of being bullied by bad guys?","Which bad guy sees her, doesn’t run away crying?","Li Yuntao was so depressed, but he didn’t dare to say anything!","Seeing how Liu Buyan cared for Huang Yueli in every possible way, he must dote on this Junior Sister very much, unless he wanted to mess up his consultation with Li Moying, otherwise, that little girl was someone he could not afford to offend !","There was already a huge fire burning in his heart but couldn’t let it out, causing the profound energy in his body to fluctuate violently.","Originally, he managed to suppress the itch on his back, but at this moment, it flared up again, making him feel uncomfortable all over.","However, he was now in front of Li Shihong, which was even more embarrassing than when he was at the teahouse just now, and there was no way to scratch.","Li Yuntao endured and endured, the muscles on his face began to twitch.","Huang Yueli was beside him, so she could see his expression in full view, and immediately called out: “Ah! Elder Tao, what’s wrong with you? Why are you in such pain? Could it be... that you have lost your temper?”","Li Yuntao’s profound strength was already in chaos, but after hearing this, he almost vomited blood again!","If he really went mad, it was definitely because he was pissed off by this stinky girl!","Li Shihong didn’t understand what was going on at all, with a puzzled look on his face, “Yuntao, what happened to you today? I searched for someone for a long time before, and now you have such an expression. Could it be that you really had a Qi Deviation during your cultivation?” What’s the problem, are you feeling unwell today?”","“Here...”","Li Yuntao gritted his teeth, struggling in every possible way!","This stinky girl was simply too deceitful! Do you really think that he was a majestic Elder of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who can do nothing to her?","Even if she was Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister, this was the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan after all! If he reveals the true face of this stinky girl, even if Li Shihong doesn’t dare to offend them now, it won’t be so when Li Moying recovers in the future!","Li Yuntao decided not to be patient any longer, but to tell all the things Huang Yueli did!","But at this moment, Liu Buyan suddenly spoke.","“Patriarch Li, it looks like Elder Tao has a wheal rash! This problem was usually only experienced by ordinary cultivators. I never thought that Elder Tao, who is a strong Dao Profound Realm, will suffer from this problem... But It’s alright, I’m the best at curing such ailments, as long as I take this bottle of medicine, the disease will be cured immediately!”","Without saying anything, Liu Buyan took out a medicine bottle from his interspatial ring and handed it to Li Yuntao.","Li Yuntao looked at the small medicine bottle, struggling endlessly in his heart.","Liu Buyan could tell what was wrong with him at a glance, so he must also be able to see that Huang Yueli had poisoned him.","The other party took out the antidote, obviously trying to seal his mouth!"]},{"number":3692,"title":"Chapter 3692 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (4)","paragraphs":["3692 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (4)","If he insisted on telling what Huang Yueli had done, then Liu Buyan would not have to treat him.","Although Li Yuntao didn’t believe that no one else could cure this poison, the lump was really uncomfortable. It was so painful and itchy that he wished he could fall to the ground and roll around!","If he doesn’t detoxify quickly, he doesn’t know what he will do in the next moment!","Li Yuntao had no choice. After struggling for a while, he was quickly defeated.","He clenched his teeth, and took the medicine bottle from Liu Buyan, “Then I... thank you, Divine Doctor Liu!”","Liu Buyan smiled and waved his hands, with an approachable look, “Elder Tao, you are too polite! You can help me find my Junior Sister, which was the greatest favour to me! It’s just to give you a bottle of medicinal pill. That’s all, it’s easy, you don’t have to take it to heart!”","Without knowing it, Li Shihong went in and watched from the sidelines. Immediately, his impression of Liu Buyan became even better.","Speaking of today’s matter, Li Yuntao didn’t handle it well. He spent a long time looking for someone!","Even if Liu Buyan blamed him, it should be done.","However, Liu Buyan didn’t mean to blame him at all. Instead, he expressed his gratitude, and even took out a bottle of medicinal pill to Li Yuntao.","Such a mind, such a bearing, really deserves to be a generation of Divine Doctors!","And Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister also looks outstanding, she looks like a lady of a noble family.","Li Shihong hurriedly said: “Divine Doctor Liu, you really make us feel ashamed! Come on, sit down, now that Young Miss Li has been found, can you rest assured and have a few more drinks with me?”","Li Shihong pulled Liu Buyan to sit down, and cast Li Yuntao a glance at the same time.","His gaze was filled with disgust.","How could Li Yuntao not understand that after being tricked by his Junior Sister, he was tricked by her Senior Brother again!","This pair of brothers and sisters were really black-bellied to the bone! He fell too hard today!","However, he had already missed the best opportunity to expose the two of them. Now that Li Shihong has sent him down, he can no longer stay here...","Li Yuntao gritted his teeth fiercely, walked a few steps, and looked back at the three people who were chatting happily in the main hall.","“Liu Buyan, and that dead girl! Hmph! We’ve got a bad debt! Don’t be complacent, one day, I’ll let the Patriarch see your true colours! Wait for me!”","After Li Yuntao left, a smile finally appeared on Li Shihong’s tense face, and he asked Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli to sit down, introduced delicacies one after another, and warmly invited them to taste.","He was full of compliments on Liu Buyan’s medical skills, but he was still a bit tentative in his conversation, and he kept asking about Liu Buyan’s background and his Master’s succession.","Liu Buyan naturally wouldn’t fail to hear it, but he wasn’t surprised at all.","Anyway, the Cloudy Qilin Clan regards Li Moying as the most precious treasure of the entire clan, and they are absolutely cautious about matters related to him.","Even if he won the first place in the competition and seemed to be the person most likely to cure Li Moying, the Cloudy Qilin Clan couldn’t trust him completely.","Liu Buyan took out the statement he had prepared a long time ago, “To tell you the truth, Patriarch Li, I am a descendant of the White Fen Clan, but I didn’t learn the Spirit Medicine technique from the clan.”"]},{"number":3693,"title":"Chapter 3693 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (5)","paragraphs":["3693 Finally Entered Amethyst Paramount Palace (5)","“Oh? You...you are from the White Fen Clan?” Li Shihong’s eyes lit up when he heard this.","The White Fen Clan was the least numerous among the twelve Ancient God Clans. Compared with the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Veracious Wyvern, which have the largest numbers, their number was only about 10% of their number.","However, the status of the White Fen Clan amongst the God Clan was very high.","That’s precisely because the White Fen Clan was a clan rich in Divine Doctors!","Due to the natural talent of the powerful wood attribute, every member of the White Fen Clan has the talent to become a Spirit Medicine Master, and even heaven ranked Spirit Medicine Masters are very common among the White Fen Clan.","Although there are fewer saint ranked Spirit Medicine Masters, there are definitely more of them than other God Clan.","Since Liu Buyan has the blood of the White Fen Clan, it was normal for him to have outstanding medical skills.","Liu Buyan nodded, and said again: “I do have the blood of the White Fen Clan, but it was not an official White Fen Clan, because my great-grandmother was a member of the White Fen Clan, and later married the human race, and by the time it passed down In my generation, the bloodline is already very thin. My family was not an ancestral Spirit Medicine Master at first, and I only started to learn the medicinal pill technique after acknowledging a reclusive saint level Spirit Medicine Master as my Master.”","This, of course, had been discussed with Huang Yueli earlier.","And Huang Yueli’s identity was the daughter of his reclusive master.","Li Shihong then curiously asked about Liu Buyan’s parentage, but Liu Buyan started to play dumb at this moment, saying that he didn’t know the identity of his master, and that his Master kept secret about his past.","More than 80% of these words were lies.","However, the only detail was true.","Liu Buyan really has the blood of the White Fen Clan, and has the unique aura of the White Fen Clan on his body.","Taking advantage of Liu Buyan’s inattention, Li Shihong secretly released his divine sense to investigate, and after confirming this point, he believed his words.","Immediately, he became more confident in Liu Buyan’s medical skills.","After the two exchanged pleasantries for a while, Liu Buyan suddenly felt that someone beside him tugged on his sleeve.","As soon as Liu Buyan turned her head, she met Huang Yueli’s big watery eyes. There was obvious impatience in her eyes, and she was pursing her lips slightly, staring at him dissatisfied.","It was only then that Liu Buyan realized that his little Junior Sister couldn’t wait to see her husband!","Seeing that he was only interested in chatting with Li Shihong, she was unhappy!","Liu Buyan shook his head helplessly. His Junior Sister was good at everything, but there was one thing. She was too enamored of her man?","Anyway, Li Moying has been in a coma for so long, and he can’t die, so it’s the same if he goes to see a doctor tomorrow during the day, isn’t it?","Liu Buyan only hesitated for a while, and suddenly, he felt a tingling pain on his arm!","“Ouch!”","He was pinched by Huang Yueli, and he cried out in pain!","Li Shihong asked in surprise: “Young Master Liu, what’s wrong with you?”","Liu Buyan’s facial expression distorted for a moment, and he quickly picked up the wine glass to cover up, coughed a few times, and said, “This... I was wondering what the condition of the noble Young Master is? If it’s convenient, can we check on him now?”","When Li Shihong heard this, he immediately beamed with joy!","He didn’t expect that Liu Buyan not only had outstanding medical skills, but also was so dedicated that he had to see Li Moying tonight before he even finished his meal!"]},{"number":3694,"title":"Chapter 3694 Li Moying’s Condition (1)","paragraphs":["3694 Li Moying’s Condition (1)","There was no reason for Li Shihong to refuse, so he immediately agreed, got up immediately, and personally took Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli to see Li Moying.","From the main hall to the back mountain, there was quite a distance, and the maids walked in front with lanterns to guide the three of them.","Along the way, Li Shihong and Liu Buyan kept talking in low voices, and the topic revolved around Li Moying’s condition.","“Divine Doctor Liu, to be honest, Number 23 whom you attended to in the third round of competition has symptoms that were closest to Moying’s. Since you can heal Number 23, there should not be too big of a problem to heal Moying?” Li Shihong asked tentatively.","Liu said quietly, “That’s not necessarily the case. Even if the symptoms appear to be the same, the actual cause may not be the same. We still need to see the patient and make a careful diagnosis before making a judgement.”","Hearing this, Li Shihong was a little disappointed.","But after thinking about it, it was this professional attitude that made this person even more reliable.","If Liu Buyan opened his mouth and said that he would definitely be able to cure Li Moying, he would feel uneasy.","“Then, Divine Doctor Liu, what do you think of a disease like Moying who has been in a coma for several months for no reason?”","Liu Buyan already knew the real reason for Li Moying’s injury from Huang Yueli, but it was impossible for him to tell the truth directly.","Just as he was thinking about how to speak, Huang Yueli suddenly caught up a few steps from behind and walked up to them.","She turned to look at Li Shihong, “Patriarch Li, before you ask about Young Master Li’s condition, shouldn’t you also tell us how did Young Master Li get injured? Only when we know the ins and outs of the matter can we judge?”","Li Shihong hesitated for a moment, and then said: “It’s not that I don’t want to tell you two, but...even I don’t know how Moying was injured. I think you two have heard about some rumours before coming here. There are rumours going around and to tell you the truth, these rumours are true, and the person who injured Moying was Huang Sanbai of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! However, we don’t know what he did. By the time Elder Tao rushed over, Moying was already in a coma, until today...”","“Oh? So, when Elder Tao rescued him, Young Master Li was alone?”","Li Shihong nodded, “That’s right, that’s right. When Moying went out, there were a few guards by his side, but they were all seriously injured, and they haven’t woken up yet!”","Huang Yueli nodded when she heard the words, “So that’s it!”","However, where Li Shihong couldn’t see, a chill flashed across Huang Yueli’s face.","Sure enough, after Li Yuntao and the others returned to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they didn’t even mention her existence.","Li Yuntao has been punished a lot today, but the other party was really not wronged at all!","Come to think of it, everyone thought that she had died at the entrance of that secret realm, right?","I don’t know how these people would feel when they saw that she had suddenly come back to life, and that she had infiltrated into the Cloudy Qilin Clan in an open manner.","While speaking, the three of them had arrived at the gate of the small courtyard where Li Moying lived.","Li Shihong pushed open the door with his own hands, and walked in with Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli.","“Young Master Liu, Young Miss Li, this is where Moying lives. Since he was injured that day, he has been unconscious like this. No matter what methods we use, he has no response...”"]},{"number":3695,"title":"Chapter 3695 Li Moying’s Condition (2)","paragraphs":["3695 Li Moying’s Condition (2)","In order for Liu Buyan to make an accurate diagnosis, Li Shihong began to eloquently introduce the various measures they had taken to wake up Li Moying over the past two months.","Liu Buyan listened very carefully, but Huang Yueli didn’t seem to hear Li Shihong’s voice at all.","Her eyes focused on Li Moying’s face, and all her thoughts were occupied by the unconscious man in front of her!","When Huang Sanbai plotted against them at the entrance of Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s Secret Realm, both of them were seriously injured. She thought that this time, both of them were really going to die together!","Later, people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan rescued Li Moying. Although she was left alone, Huang Yueli didn’t have much resentment in her heart.","Because she knew that the clansmen of the Cloudy Qilin Clan would definitely do everything they could to save Li Moying.","As long as Li Moying could live well, it didn’t matter if she died. I just hope that when Li Moying wakes up, he won’t be too sad for her, and don’t go against the heavens and sacrifice himself to forcefully save her. This was really the end.","However, what happened after was beyond her expectations.","She actually fell into the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow once again, and it was a blessing in disguise. She attained the inheritance of Saint Iniquitous Shadow! Not only did she not die there, on the contrary, her cultivation base greatly improved, she broke through the bottleneck in just over a short period, and entered the Heart Profound Realm!","On the contrary, the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s side was really too weak. Up to now, they have not found a way to save Li Moying.","Even though she knew that Li Moying’s life was not in danger, Huang Yueli felt extremely worried when she thought of him lying on the bed. Although she didn’t show it on her face, every night she would be awakened by nightmares!","And now, she can finally see Li Moying again!","Her husband was only a few steps away from her, as long as she stretched out her hand, she could touch and feel his body temperature...","“Ahem!”","Liu Buyan’s heavy cough suddenly sounded behind her, and Huang Yueli was shocked, and suddenly snapped back to her senses.","Only then did she realize that she had unknowingly walked to Li Moying’s bedside, and stretched out her hands towards Li Moying, her slender fingers almost touching Li Moying’s face!","Li Shihong, who was beside Liu Buyan, was looking at her with surprised and strange eyes, as if he didn’t understand why she reached out to take advantage of Li Moying.","Huang Yueli was embarrassed for a moment, but her face was still extremely calm, and she slowly retracted her hand.","“Senior Brother, have you finished asking? It’s useless to ask for a long time, so I should quickly check the pulse of Young Master Li in order to accurately judge the condition? I see that Young Master Li still has a bit of depression between his brows, and I don’t know why so it’s best to check if he’s hurt! If you can’t take care of it, then I’ll come attend this for you first?”","After hearing these words, Li Shihong showed an expression of revelation.","It turns out that Young Miss Li was also a Spirit Medicine Master with extraordinary medical skills, and she was so dedicated!","As soon as she entered the door, she thought about seeing the patient quickly!","She stretched out her hand, it was because she must be trying to diagnose Li Moying’s pulse!","Li Shihong hurriedly said: “Two Divine Doctors, I have already finished talking about Moying. After he passed out, we asked many Spirit Medicine Masters to see him. A few saint level Spirit Medicine Masters have given pills, and I’ll send someone to send you the list later!”"]},{"number":3696,"title":"Chapter 3696 Li Moying’s Condition (3)","paragraphs":["3696 Li Moying’s Condition (3)","“Please feel free to diagnose and treat, don’t worry about anything!”","Li Shihong had a good attitude and was very cooperative.","Liu Buyan glanced at Huang Yueli, and saw that she had put on a decent smile again, and couldn’t help laughing secretly.","This little girl was too good at pretending! The words just now really sounded as if she had really meant that! Even an experienced old fox like Li Shihong was fooled by her.","Just as he was thinking, Huang Yueli suddenly glared at him.","Liu Buyan received her urging signal, clenched his fist and put it on his lips, coughed again, “This... Patriarch Li... I have a merciless request...”","“Your Excellency, just say it! No matter what the request is, our Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely be able to meet it!” Li Shihong said hurriedly.","Liu Buyan said: “This... was actually not a difficult thing to do. It’s just that when my Junior Sister and I are treating patients, we need to use our master’s exclusive pulse diagnosis method which cannot be passed on to the outside world. Therefore, I have to trouble the Patriarch and several Elders avoid it for a while. Not only today, but also in the future when we diagnose and treat, no outsiders are allowed to be present.”","“This...” There was obvious hesitation on Li Shihong’s face.","Although most doctors do not allow people to watch, but this was a god-level genius of their Cloudy Qilin Clan! He was really worried if he was not watching from the sidelines!","In case someone was unfavorable to Li Moying, the Cloudy Qilin Clan cannot afford such a blow!","Even when the Elders from the Heaven Elixir Pagoda headquarters came, he did not avoid suspicion and leave.","“Divine Doctor Liu, I’m not a Spirit Medicine Master, and I don’t have any talent for alchemy. Even if I watch from the sidelines, I can’t learn your unique skills. Please don’t worry...” Li Shihong tried to persuade Liu Buyan .","However, Liu Buyan shook his head resolutely, “I’m sorry, Patriarch Li. If you can’t agree to my condition, we won’t be able to treat Young Master Li. We can only ask you to hire another wise man!”","Li Shihong gritted his teeth, struggling in his heart.","No matter which option he chooses, it was unacceptable to him.","However, in the end, he could only choose to give in.","“Alright, then please take care of Divine Doctor Liu and Young Miss Li. I’ll just go outside and wait!”","As Li Shihong said, he took another look at Li Moying who was motionless on the bed, and then turned and left the room.","However, his consciousness still locked the room tightly. Once there was any abnormal movement inside, he would be able to detect it in time. Even if there was a door across the room, he was confident that he would be able to arrive in time for rescue.","After sending Li Shihong away, Liu Buyan said to Huang Yueli: “Junior Sister, oh Junior Sister, you are too careless! Li Shihong is still here, yet you want to take advantage of the Young Master, tsk tsk, if I hadn’t reacted In time, you will be regarded as a female pervert, caught and drowned in a pig cage!”","Huang Yueli gave him a blank look, and also whispered, “What pervert! I just wanted to touch him to see if his body temperature was normal! There was absolutely no other meaning!”","“Oh? Really? I think you were drooling just now? Oh come on! Li Moying is at most a little more handsome than me. Why is there so much drool?”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips, “Who...who was drooling? Besides, my family, Moying, is the most handsome in the entire God Realm, more than just a little bit more handsome than you! Hmph!”"]},{"number":3697,"title":"Chapter 3697 Li Moying’s Condition (4)","paragraphs":["3697 Li Moying’s Condition (4)","Saying that, she walked to Li Moying’s side again.","Li Moying lay quietly on the bamboo bed covered with spirit-gathering arrays, her eyes were tightly closed, and her long eyelashes left a faint shadow under her eyes.","Although he was unconscious, his breathing was still steady. His face looked slightly pale, but his expression was very quiet, as if he was just asleep.","Huang Yueli looked at the familiar handsome face, her affectionate gaze lingered as she bit her lips lightly with her teeth.","Standing behind her, Liu Buyan looked at her gentle and affectionate gaze, feeling somewhat disappointed in his heart.","After being separated from Huang Yueli and the others for the past two years, he cultivated alone, not only his cultivation level improved a lot, but his state of mind as well. Especially the moment he broke through the tenth level, his entire soul was sublimated. The relationship between them has also faded a lot.","There are some things that belong to him and cannot escape after all.","But it’s not his, no matter how much you force it, you can’t get it.","His Lass Li may always be in his heart, but it was no longer a bloody wound on his heart.","However, these two people can show their affection in such a way that one was awake and the other was in a coma. As a single person, he still feels anguished!","Liu Buyan coughed heavily again!","Huang Yueli was startled, then blushed with embarrassment before she said: “Senior Brother, why do you keep coughing today? Did you catch a cold? You are a doctor yourself, why are you so careless about your body?”","Liu Buyan chortled as he rebutted: “Are you still checking his pulse? If not, I’ll do it instead! Patriarch Li is still waiting outside!”","Huang Yueli knew that this was Liu Buyan reminding her that if she did something inappropriate, Li Shihong would easily find out.","“Of course I’m going to check his pulse! But I have to follow the four ways of diagnosis. Look, listen, question and then feel the pulse. Aren’t I looking now?”","“Then you’ve been looking long enough!” Liu Buyan complained.","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth in anger, and reached out to touch Li Moying’s forehead.","The fair hand stayed there for a long time.","During the whole process, Huang Yueli closed her eyes slightly, and the profound energy fluctuations in her body also became intense, as if she was thinking about something.","Liu Buyan stood behind her, not daring to disturb her. It was not until Huang Yueli opened his eyes again that he asked in a low voice, “How is it? What’s the situation with Li Moying now?”","Although he was a serious Spirit Medicine Master, no one knew better than Huang Yueli on the symptoms of evil qi entering the body, so at this time, it was natural to rely on her opinion.","Huang Yueli pondered and said: “Moying’s situation is a bit different from mine. When I was practising the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, I was just invaded by evil qi in my body, so although I couldn’t move, my mind was quite clear, and I could mobilise most of the profound energy in my body, but Moying...”","She frowned, “After these two months, evil qi have invaded all his meridians and dantian, and even his soul has been affected. If it wasn’t for his special constitution, he wouldn’t be able to bear it at all! Even his consciousness is no longer clear, I tried to communicate with him with my spiritual consciousness just now, but I didn’t get any response! In addition...there is a lot of evil qi in his body, at least hundreds of times that of Number 23’s!”","Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan looked at each other and came to a conclusion, “It’s probably not as easy as we thought at first to wake him up!”"]},{"number":3698,"title":"Chapter 3698 Li Moying’s Condition (5)","paragraphs":["3698 Li Moying’s Condition (5)","Liu Buyan frowned, “How can this be? Even if you say it’s not easy, then... we can even forget about others.”","Huang Yueli thought about it again, and said: “I just said that the situation was a bit different from what I expected, and it doesn’t mean that it can’t be cured? Saint Iniquitous Shadow once said that Moying can withstand the soul splitting technique, then this bit of evil qi will definitely not pose a fatal threat to him.”","“Then what should we do now?” Liu Buyan stared at Li Moying on the bed and asked.","Huang Yueli said: “How about this, I will try to teach him the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” first.”","Liu Buyan was startled, and asked strangely: “He’s already lost his consciousness, how are you going to teach him such a complicated secret manual?”","Huang Yueli directly sat down beside Li Moying’s bed, “It’s of course impossible for him to read by himself now, but I can inbue the evil qi in my body into his meridians, arouse the resonance of the evil qi in his body, and then guide the evil qi in the direction indicated in the secret manual. As long as he can complete the first sixty cycles, he can expel half of the evil qi that has invaded his primordial spirit, so that his consciousness can be clearer.”","Liu Buyan said happily: “There’s actually such a way! Why didn’t you say it earlier? Then let’s start now?”","Huang Yueli glanced at him, “Do you think this is easy? The evil qi in my body was not as much as his. It’s very difficult to control the movement of these evil qi in one cycle, not to mention sixty cycles!”","Liu Buyan frowned again, “Then what should I do?”","“Since there is no other way, no matter how difficult it is, we can only try.”","Huang Yueli’s eyes fell on Li Moying’s face.","This handsome and powerful man was lying quietly at this moment. Under the dim light, his perfect facial features and fair skin looked unreal like a dream.","When he was sober, he was so powerful and domineering, but now he can’t even move...","Huang Yueli brushed her fingers over Li Moying’s tall nose, her gaze gradually became firm, “Senior Brother, I will ask you to help me next!”","Liu Buyan hurriedly said, “I’ve been waiting for your words! Tell me, what do you need me to do?”","Huang Yueli said: “When my evil qi enters Li Moying’s body, it will definitely cause him serious discomfort and his body temperature will rise rapidly. Once the situation was serious, it may still cause permanent damage to him, so, we need to rely on Senior Brother’s technique of golden needles to stabilise his physical condition...”","Liu Buyan nodded, “I see, was there anything else I should do?”","Huang Yueli shook her head and said, “Also...forget it, the gap between you and Moying’s cultivation base was a bit big, and you haven’t cultivated evil qi, if you make a move, you will be easily backlashed. So, wait a minute, no matter what happens, You must not act casually, lest you be involved!”","Liu Buyan’s face darkened upon hearing the words.","In the past, when his little Junior Sister made a move, she needed him to protect, but now he was actually told not to make a move!","This was simply a disgrace to him!","But, who made him unable to keep up with them in his current cultivation?","Liu Buyan secretly made up his mind to practise harder in the future, at least not to be a drag, right?"]},{"number":3699,"title":"Chapter 3699 Li Moying’s Condition (6)","paragraphs":["3699 Li Moying’s Condition (6)","Huang Yueli reiterated the other precautions to Liu Buyan once more before she climbed to the inside of the bamboo bed, helped Li Moying up with Liu Buyan, and put him in a meditation position.","Huang Yueli sat behind Li Moying, raised her right hand and placed it on his vest.","Liu Buyan had already opened the set of golden needles specially made by Huang Yueli, holding his breath and concentrating on it, ready to administer it at any time.","Huang Yueli took a deep breath, “Alright, let’s start now!”","!!","Liu Buyan nodded.","Huang Yueli slowly imbued evil qi into Li Moying’s body.","The evil qi in Li Moying’s meridians was originally dormant, but after contact with the intruding energy from the outside world, it immediately had a violent reaction, like a beast coming out of the gate, it swooped towards her!","Huang Yueli let out a muffled “Ugh” from her throat!","At the same time, a trace of blood flowed from the corner of her mouth.","Originally, Liu Buyan was fully on guard, ready to administer Li Moying the needle, but he didn’t expect that the first injured person was not Li Moying, but Huang Yueli!","He suddenly became nervous, moved closer to Huang Yueli, observed her expression carefully, and said in a low voice, “Junior Sister? Junior Sister, how are you doing?”","Huang Yueli opened her eyes slightly, gritted her teeth and said, “I’m fine, you don’t need to worry about me, just keep an eye on Moying’s situation!”","“But...” Liu Buyan frowned.","From his point of view, Huang Yueli’s situation seems to be much more dangerous than Li Moying’s!","Li Moying’s face was still as usual, like a perfect doll just like before, motionless, the burst of profound energy just now had an impact on only Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli said: “Senior Brother, you don’t have to worry, I know what’s my limit! Just keep an eye on Moying!”","Seeing her persistence, Liu Buyan had no choice but to return to his original position.","Huang Yueli took a deep breath, forcibly suppressed the internal injury she suffered just now, mobilised the evil qi again, and slowly probed towards Li Moying’s meridians.","This time, with lessons learned from the past, she became more cautious in her actions.","First, she used a very weak evil qi to test Li Moying’s meridians. Sure enough, the force she used was relatively weak, and the backlash caused was relatively weak. She easily withstood the impact and let her evil qi mix into Li Moying’s.","The test was successful, which lifted Huang Yueli’s spirit!","However, she continued to be cautious, and did not get carried away with success just because she had achieved some results.","She has always maintained a slow but steady speed, gradually increasing the concentration of the evil qi penetrating into Li Moying’s meridians. After her evil qi reached a certain level, she began to try to integrate Li Moying’s evil qi, and let them follow the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” designated direction.","In the beginning, she spent a lot of effort to make Li Moying’s evil qi follow her a little bit.","Just such a small amount caused her to exhaust almost all her mental strength, her face gradually turned red, and big droplets of perspiration dripped down her forehead.","Liu Buyan had already begun to administer needles for Li Moying, but from the corner of his eyes, he was always paying attention to Huang Yueli’s situation.","Seeing her in such a difficult and painful state, he felt nervous and worried, but because of Huang Yueli’s order just now, he didn’t dare to slack off in the slightest, and he didn’t dare to interrupt her in the middle."]},{"number":3700,"title":"Chapter 3700 Li Moying’s Condition (7)","paragraphs":["3700 Li Moying’s Condition (7)","He could only hope in his heart that Huang Yueli’s guiding process would go smoothly.","Fortunately, after a while, Huang Yueli’s complexion obviously became much better, and the profound energy escaping from her body also eased a lot.","Seeing such a situation, Liu Buyan let out a sigh of relief.","It seems that Huang Yueli was getting better and better, and successfully made the evil qi in Li Moying’s body follow her.","The fact was exactly what he had thought.","Although it was very difficult at the beginning, the evil qi in Huang Yueli’s body and Li Moying’s meridians actually came from the same source, hence they could be integrated with each other. Given some time, through the “Saint Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, she finally gained the initiative to lead the evil qi.","The evil qi flowing through Li Moying’s meridians became smoother and faster.","Huang Yueli’s tense nerves also relaxed a little, and she began to guide the evil qi according to the secret manual.","The evil qi passed through the first meridian slowly but smoothly, then the second, and the third...","Huang Yueli was immersed in this process, completely unaware of how much time had passed.","Finally, the evil qi circulated through all of Li Moying’s meridians. As long as it returned to the dantian again, it will complete a whole cycle of circulation.","After the first cycle was completed, the rest will be much simpler.","Seeing that the victory was in sight, Huang Yue was also a little excited in her heart, but she still controlled the evil qi very carefully, and slowly moved towards Li Moying’s dantian...","But at this moment, a sudden change appeared!","The moment this mixed evil qi entered the dantian, Huang Yueli felt a huge burst of energy erupting from Li Moying’s body!","This energy was dozens of times stronger than the backlash she encountered at the beginning! It was far beyond what Huang Yueli could bear!","“Ughh—pffft—!!”","Huang Yueli suddenly spat out a mouthful of blood!","At the same time, her whole body was bounced off, and she fell straight backwards!","Fortunately, there was a wall behind Li Moying’s bamboo bed, which prevented Huang Yueli from falling too badly.","But even so, this blow was enough for her, Huang Yueli only felt that her internal organs seemed to be on fire! The evil qi in the meridians also began to scurry around, reaching the verge of losing control.","“Junior Sister! What’s wrong with you? What happened? You... are you alright?”","Seeing this, Liu Buyan really couldn’t care less about obeying Huang Yueli’s orders, so he rushed towards her, grabbed her wrist, and was about to check her pulse.","Huang Yueli coughed twice, “It’s nothing serious...”","Just as she was about to say something, she suddenly heard a knock on the door.","“Divine Doctor Liu, Divine Doctor Liu! What happened just now? Why is there such a big commotion? Did something happen? Hurry up and open the door and let us in!”","Li Shihong’s anxious voice sounded outside the door.","Obviously, when Huang Yueli was bounced away just now, the noise was too loud. Li Shihong and the others had been guarding outside the door, so it was impossible not to hear it.","During the consultation, there was actually a fighting sound, which made them worried, and they couldn’t help knocking on the door to ask questions.","Liu Buyan’s expression froze, he quickly raised the volume, and said, “Just now, the profound energy in Young Master Li’s body was stimulated by my acupuncture, which made a little noise.”"]}]);
